INSERT INTO `tbl_rera_complaint_misc_details` VALUES (25,1001,2018,'MCNo10012018','FormTypeMISC','All residents of JJ Valley','jagdeepvirdi31@gmail.com',9417370545,0,'House no 16, J J  valley, village hussainpur , rupnagar','Mr. harjeet singh, Director of M/s Juneja Builders, house no 946, garden colony, kharar, punjab','J J Valley, village hussainpur, rupnagar-140001','J J Valley, village hussainpur, rupnagar-140001','Please find below the issues, which we all residents of JJ Valley, Village hussainpur, rupnagar are facing from our day to day life.\r\n1. Nor they have proper functioning of Sewerage treatment plant at JJ Valley neither they have proper disposal of treated water because of this dirty and standing water, every one is prone to many infectious disease caused.\r\n\r\n2. Neither they have proper road facility at JJ Valley because of this the colony looks like jungle.\r\n\r\n3. Neither they have proper system to clean weeds grow on empty plots  and it looks like jungle.\r\n\r\n4. Parks are also unorganised and undeveloped.\r\n\r\n5.They even don\'t have complete proper outer boundary for the colony because of this, wild animals are entering every time.\r\n\r\n6. They do not have proper system to clean water tank periodically to provide safe drinking water to people.\r\n\r\n7. they do not have proper management system for storm water or rain water in the colony.\r\n\r\nWe all requested the above mentioned issue with Director, Juneja Builders many times, he always used to give false commitment to resolve them.\r\n\r\nSo weall residents of JJ Valley, requested to you kindly look into the matter and do the needfull action to resolve them fastly and permanently so that the residents can live hassle free life.\r\n\r\nThanking you\r\n\r\nAll Residents of JJ Valley ','Complaint letter from All JJ Valley Residents','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','570580','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8018353c-45b5-487a-881a-e9c76d9540f6\\','Doc201808104eacaa0b-16f7-4624-846a-baed90c0462c.pdf',0,0,'Present pictures of jj Valley','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','834269','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8018353c-45b5-487a-881a-e9c76d9540f6\\','Doc201808102ebbddab-00ce-40a2-b376-1ae494e184ff.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-10 14:27:04.000','','','','1001',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-10 14:27:04.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-10 14:27:04.000'),(26,1002,2018,'MCNo10022018','FormTypeMISC','ATS Prelude Apartment Owners Association (Regd)','atspreludeaoa@gmail.com',9888194707,0,'1st Floor, Club House, ATS Golf Meadows Prelude, Barwala Road, Dera Bassi, District SAS Nagar, Punjab - 140507\r\nC/o Flat No. 1111, ATS Golf Meadows Prelude','ATS Golf Meadows Prelude,  Barwala Road, Village Madhopur,  Dera Bassi, SAS Nagar,  Punjab -140507','ATS Infrastructure Limited ATS Golf Meadows, Chandigarh Ambala Highway, Opp. Sada Shiv Complex, Near Dera Bassi Barwala Chowk, Dera Bassi, SAS Nagar, Punjab 140507','Village Madhopur, Tehsil Dera Bassi, Barwala Road','Dear Sir\r\n\r\nThis is to bring to your kind attention that the Residential Project of ATS Golf Meadows Prelude situated at Dera Bassi Distirct SAS Nagar is till date NOT REGISTERED with the RERA Authority. The said project was sanctioned by the office of the Municipal Council, Dera Bassi vide Permit letter No. 830 dated 12.05.2006 for ATS Golf Meadows Prelude situated at Village Madhopur, Tehsil Derabassi, District S.A.S Nagar Mohali, Punjab. That Municipal Council, Dera Bassi vide Letter Ref. No. 342 dated 13.07.2016, copy annexed as Annexure -1 addressed to the Chief Vigilance Officer-cum- Nodal Officer and Director, Local Government Deptt. Punjab, Chandigarh, clearly state that No Occupation Certificate has been issued to ATS Infrastructure Ltd. for their housing project of ATS Golf Meadows Prelude by the Municipal Council. It is added in this communication that only Partial Completion Certificates of towers have been issued for the said project. That Municipal Council Letter with Ref No. 296 dated 24.06.2016 addressed to Regional Deputy Director also establish the fact that NO COMPLETION CERTIFICATE has been issued to the Promoter for the project ATS Golf Meadows Prelude and is annexed as Annexure 2 \r\n\r\nWe find that many of the components of the housing project have still not been accomplished. We are giving hereunder a list of some of such components for your information \r\n\r\nThe EWS tower no. 16 does not have the requisite number of flats as per the Revised Sanctioned Plan of Municipal Council, Dera Bassi dated 20.07.2010.  There should be 48 EWS units where as the tower has less than 40 units ready. Department of Local Government (Town Planning Wing) vide Notification dated 24.10.2016. (No. DTP (LG)-2016/ 2361) clearly states that the concerned Urban Local Bodies had issued partial completion certificates, as a result of which the promoters were able to sell the plots/flats without fulfilling their social obligations towards EWS. As per Section 2.1 of the said Notification, the developer/promoter is bound to allot flats for EWS category as per conditions of the approval of building plan. Even, the Environment Clearance letter No. 205-A/SEIAA(P)/2010-IA III dated 23.08.2010 clearly stipulates that the Project shall have 50 EWS Units.\r\n\r\nBasements of the towers are left in-complete and are lying unusable which are to be provided to Residents for Stores/Services as per the sanctioned plan. Passage to the basements has raw stairs with no lighting arrangements or ventilation. Water harvesting arrangement/proper drainage not in place leading to water logging in the basements.\r\n\r\nSolar lighting and water heating arrangements are also not in place.\r\n\r\nSolid waste collection and disposal system is not in place and bio-decomposing plant etc. yet to be installed.\r\n\r\nInstallation of organic waste converter and adopting vessel bio-composting of garbage/ kitchen waste not yet undertaken.\r\n\r\nInstallation of UV system with the STP has not been undertaken yet.\r\n\r\nThe boundary wall is not of the proper height all around. At some of the places, the boundary wall is only now being raised where as at one place near gate no. 4, the boundary wall is made of green hedge only. \r\n\r\nNOC from NRO, Ministry of Environmental and Forests under the Forests Conservation Act, 1980 for the approach road to the project is yet to be obtained. \r\n\r\nApproval from NHAI for the entry to the project is yet to be obtained.\r\n\r\nNo remedial action been taken by the Promoter for Violations in the Sanctioned Plan despite Notice being issued by Municipal Council, Dera Bassi vide its Letter No. 3749 dated 21.06.2016.  \r\n\r\nNon Compliance Notice has also been issued to Promoter by Ministry of Environment, Forests and Climate Change dated 16.11.2015 highlighting few of these points as mentioned above.\r\n\r\nWe on behalf of the Apartments Owners/Residents of the project ATS Golf Meadows Prelude, Dera Bassi request you to kindly direct the Promoter of the Project, who fall within the ambit of the Act but have not applied for the registration of their project till date, to get the project ATS Golf Meadows Prelude registered immediately so that we may take up the remedial action against the promoters under the respective statutory provisions.\r\n\r\nSecretary\r\n\r\nDr. S C Anand\r\nFlat No. 1111, ATS Golf Meadows Prelude','Municipal Council Letter No. 342 dated 13.07.2016','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','125218','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1b6e3e4b-3731-43de-9951-8cbd4967d616\\','Doc20180813f87df21f-6cf8-40cd-b2d0-998aa3dcf97c.pdf',0,0,'Municipal Council Letter No. 296 dated 24.06.2016','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','353395','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1b6e3e4b-3731-43de-9951-8cbd4967d616\\','Doc2018081300eeda99-3cad-4050-8ccf-ad36ad76617c.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-13 17:05:55.000','','','','1002',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-13 17:05:55.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-13 17:05:55.000'),(27,1003,2018,'MCNo10032018','FormTypeMISC','Yellowstone Industrial Plot Allottees Welfare Association ( Regd) through its Vice president Sh. Naveen Manglani','naveenmanglani2@gmail.com',9914099255,0,'House No.1759  Phase 5, Mohali, Pin 160059.\r\n2nd Address.  N.M. Industries, Plot No. 753, Industrial Area Phase 2, Chandigarh','Yellow Stone Landmark Infocity through its Managing Director Sh. Tajinder Singh Bhatia','M/s Sukhm Infrastrcuture Pvt .Ltd (Yellow Stone Landmark Infocity), Site Office, Sector 66-A,   S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali, Punjab.','Sector 66-A,   S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali, Punjab.','1.That the complainant association is a registered society named as Yellowstone Industrial Plot Allottees Welfare Association and has authorised its Vice President and General Secretary through a resolution passed on dated 16.08.2017 to file the present complaint on its behalf against the respondent before this Honble Authority. \r\n2.That the respondent is real estate company and deals in developing real estate projects launched a mega IT Project namely YELLOWSTONE LAND MARK INFOCITY, at SECTOR 66A, Mohali, stated to be approved by the State Government in the year 2009. \r\n3.That the respondent issued attractive advertisements in Media or otherwise using name of big House such as Reliance, Berggeun Holding etc. promising to investors to deliver what India yet to deliver. \r\n4.That the respondents offered allotment of plots of different sizes on depositing 27.5 percent earnest money of Basic Sale Price by the investors.  Further amount of 12.5 percent of BSP was also to be paid on issuance of allotment letter. Payment over and above 40 percent was linked to the development of work.\r\n5.That the members of the complainant association has paid 60 percent or above of the BSP to the respondents to purchase the said plots in the project of the respondent. \r\n6.That despite receiving money from the complainant members, the respondent failed to hand over the possession of the plots within stipulated period to the complainants.\r\n7.That the aggrieved complainant members through their association filed complaint no. 22 of 2017 before this Honble authority for directing the respondents to develop the project immediately  and to hand over the possession of plots to the complainant members within a time bound schedule and also prayed for compensation.\r\n8.That the Honble authority dismissed the complaint vide its orders dated 15.01.2018 of the complainant members on the ground of jurisdiction that the respondent project was not registered with the authority. Copy of the orders is attached herewith.\r\n9.That the non registration of the project with the authority and further, without registration advertising, booking, selling, offering for sale and inviting persons to purchase in any manner any plot etc contravenes section 3 of The Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016 and attracts punishment under section 59 of the Act.\r\n10.That the present complaint is being filed within the period of limitation.\r\n11.That the complainant further declares that the matter regarding which this complaint has been made is not pending before any court of law or any other authority or any other tribunals except one similar complaint no. 25 of 2018 which was inadvertently filed before The Adjudicating officer and same was withdrawn with liberty to file before the Regulatory Authority. \r\nReliefs sought\r\nIt is therefore respectfully prayed that the complaint of the Complainant may kindly be accepted and the respondents may kindly be punished and dealt with as per law and provisions of the Act and also Any other relief which the Honble authority may deem fit. \r\n','Annexure C/1 (Order dated 15.01.2018)','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','629564','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a0402c25-3bbd-4305-b8e3-54a2a9567cbf\\','Doc201808146eb55ac1-c549-4b1a-886b-d35d4764ac4f.pdf',0,0,'Order','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','629564','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a0402c25-3bbd-4305-b8e3-54a2a9567cbf\\','Doc20180814ee69ed95-928a-4617-a5e5-f0a55392316e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-14 20:42:27.000','','','','1003',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-14 20:42:27.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-14 20:42:27.000'),(28,1004,2018,'MCNo10042018','FormTypeMISC','Avtar Singh Luthra','crownavtar@gmail.com',9988467744,0,'Flat No. 603-A Royale Empire\r\nPeer Mushalla, Zirakpur District Mohali.','Royale Empire.  Promoters a father-son partnership firm with Sarvshri Jiwan Garg and Prince Garg as partners.','Kishapura Road,  Peer Mushalla,  Zirakpur Project on Land Area 9.25 Acres  comprise of about 500 3BHK flats','Village Peer Mushalla, Zirakpur District Mohali','Completion certificate yet not obtained. Application for registration under RERA not yet submitted. \r\n1.       About 50 families are residing in one of the tower consisting of 98 flats, to whom possession given by promoter from 2011 onwards. \r\n\r\n2.       Still there are deficiencies in basic facilities and completion/ partial completion certificate is yet not obtained.  Matter is very well reported and in knowledge of MC  Zirakpur but no action appears to have been taken by MC.  \r\n\r\n3.       The partners remained absconded and thereafter in and out of jail, since 2012 and even now they are in jail.\r\n\r\n4.       Even in the recent past  the possession of some flats is reported to have been given.\r\n','One page of brochure detailing facilities offered','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','132905','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f2e5fcf7-8193-45a1-a04c-c9528dacc78d\\','Doc2018081693fb2412-3065-4ac9-8984-6f5622094ffb.pdf',0,0,'Complaint sent by me on Email dated 19th July 2018','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','668394','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f2e5fcf7-8193-45a1-a04c-c9528dacc78d\\','Doc20180816031881e0-97a4-4591-9833-6516940e6ce6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-16 12:59:25.000','','','','1004',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-16 12:59:25.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-16 12:59:25.000'),(29,1005,2018,'MCNo10052018','FormTypeMISC','Deepika Garg','saurabhkaushiknabhaite@yahoo.com',9316444706,0,'Deepika Garg wife of Pardeep Kumar resident of House No.260-C, Hira Enclave, Nabha, District Patiala','Nabha Enclave, Village Dulladi, Tehsil Nabha, District Patiala','Nabha Enclave, Village Dulladi, Nabha Malerkotla Road, Tehsil Nabha, District Patiala',' Village Dulladi/Tehsil Nabha/on Nabha Malerkotla Road','It is submitted that as per the Act all the ongoing projects in which completion certificate has not been issued on the date of commencement of the Act have to mandatorily apply for registration. Apparently the project on the given site was neither complete nor any certificate of completion has been issued till date. Therefore, it was mandatory for the respondent No.1 to get the project registered under the Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act (herein after referred to as the Act). On not having done so, the promoters have made themselves liable to be punished under section 59 of the Act.\r\n       That the complainant has purchased a plot measuring 17 Biswas 10 Biswasis i.e. 874.98 square yard situated in the Nabha Enclave, Village Dulladi, from the respondent No.1 vide registered sale deed No.2270 dated 22.08.2012\r\nbefore the sale of said plot to the complainant, respondent No.1 has assured that the above said colony named as Nabha Enclave is approved by Punjab Urban Development Authority and it was intimated that all the necessary permissions has been obtained from the concerned authority and it would be developed as per the rules.\r\nd)	That at the time of sale of said plot, the respondent No.1 has shown the Map of said colony to the complainant in which the site of park, school etc. were shown and it was also agreed that proper sewerage, roads, street lights, water Tank, Electricity will be provided as these are the mandatory provisions under rules \r\nthe complainant has many times, requested that no development work has been done by him as the said colony is lying completely undeveloped but the above said did not pay any heed to the complaints of the complainant and instead of doing the needful, he abuse and threatened the complainant.\r\nThere is no sewerage, no electricity, no roads and no water supply etc. in the Colony and the colony has turned into a mini forest.\r\nThat all most every plot of the above mentioned Nabha Enclave has been sold by the respondent No.1 but still the society is lacking the basic enmities.\r\nThe complainant has also moved complaints regarding above said incomplete project to Additional Chief Secretary, Housing and Urban Development Authority, PUDA Bhawan, Head Office Mohali, Sectot-62, SAS Nagar (Mohali) but no action has been taken by  them.\r\nAbove mentioned project is still uncomplete and has also not got it registered under Real Estate Authority Act, 2016 which is clearly violation of Section 3 of the RERA Act and for that the owner is liable for punishment and penalty under section 59 of RERA Act.\r\nThat he has adopted unfair trade practice as he has sold the plot to complainant on the pretext that all the facility mentioned in the site plan will be provided but still after more than 6 years, the above said colony is incomplete and lacking the basic facilities and for that reason, inquiry should be marked for verifying all the irregularities.','photocopy of registered sale deed ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','573006','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5dd61546-2539-425e-9b3e-acc6c16d28bb\\','Doc201808232e563406-f707-4c95-b476-59b2f8931576.pdf',0,0,'Photographs of the colony, legal notice and representations','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','880027','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5dd61546-2539-425e-9b3e-acc6c16d28bb\\','Doc201808235e938b76-1912-4bae-b359-87b76451a6f1.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-23 16:47:08.000','','','','1005',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-23 16:47:08.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-23 16:47:08.000'),(30,1006,2018,'MCNo10062018','FormTypeMISC','Rahul malhotra','rahulmalhotra1540@gmail.com',9999914241,0,'House no 485 , first floor\r\nsector 16','Pearl city Mohali sector 100 and 104 Mohali, SAS Nagar','Sector 100 and 104 Mohali, SAS Nagar, Punjab','Sector 100 and 104 Mohali','Pearl city Mohali is being developed by PACL and is a mega housing project approved by GMADA and PACL and approved by various agencies of Government of Punjab. It is having more than 1500 plots of varied size. We have paid money ranging from 20-30% till 100% of entire amount of plot. Project was supposed to be delivered to buyers in 2014 with complete external works.','Sector price list','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','87882','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6cc91137-f299-463b-865a-d2fea557575d\\','Doc20180826d9f1847f-b9f5-4b32-9405-7d1a243c5a20.pdf',0,0,'Marketing documents from builder','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','366681','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6cc91137-f299-463b-865a-d2fea557575d\\','Doc2018082669de2a43-4262-4960-a652-552bcdcd2288.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-08-26 18:06:10.000','','','','1006',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-08-26 18:06:10.000','MiscComplainant','2018-08-26 18:06:10.000'),(31,1007,2018,'MCNo10072018','FormTypeMISC','MANOHAR LAL BHATIA','nikitabhatia137@gmail.com',9779604847,8360722641,'village nanawi, PO malangad Tehsil Bangana, Distt Una Himachal Pradesh','SANSKRITI APARTMENTS','SECTOR 115,  Kharar Landraan Rd. Greater Mohali','Mohali, Punjab','Fraud done. 50% payment has been done but no possession given and is not registered with RERA Pb. neither has attained its completion certificate','Reciepts','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','147426','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\00629af3-46dc-44e3-bd10-ee7ec3cba0fb\\','Doc20180913213d19fc-de03-4c51-8c62-2009031606c6.pdf',0,0,'Reciepts','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','147807','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0