fice no 909 in corporate tower II , area of 1365 Sq feet Super area We booked a office space 1350 sq feet in year 2006 with total cost of Rs. 61,42,500 by  depositing advance of Rs Five lac  by cheque no 387843 Dated 01-09-2006 Drawn on ICICIBANK Ltd  in favor of   Today Homes & Infrastructure Private Limited- City Centre ( LIT)  project came into the limelight in 2007 after Punjab vigilance bureau registered an FIR against it .It was alleged that the company derived benefits worth Rs several thousand Crores  . We as Business man whose plan was to open the office in Ludhiana City centre after giving various project details & suited our working plan . now after struggling for last 12 years , we donot know the status of the project, only whenever we try to contact  office of Today Homes & Infrastructure Private Limited on regularly basis, We have no status of project , our all request to refund the deposit Rs 500000 Lacs with 18% interest, the builder confirm this project was earlier with Supreme court  after arbitration report  last year Nov 2017 , we were told that soon we shall get our funds back with Interest, But now after 10 months we have no clue on refund of our funds , which are blocked for last 12 years,  We only have hope from RERA PUNJAB to give us justice to get our Due amount duly compensated as we had invested for 1365 square feet office space in Sept 2006','CHEQUE  PAID 01-09-2006','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','385589','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\65ea739b-08dd-4492-883e-11096c3e51c9\\','Doc201810024ea6d0b3-9081-4034-acf2-6543e0268fe6.pdf',0,0,'CORPORATE TOWER II FLOOR DRAWING #909 1365 sq feet','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','642807','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\65ea739b-08dd-4492-883e-11096c3e51c9\\','Doc20181002f464560e-8c04-4cd1-a216-e767660ba99f.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-02 08:42:07.000','','','','1017',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-02 08:42:07.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-02 08:42:07.000'),(42,1018,2018,'MCNo10182018','FormTypeMISC','BHUPINDER SINGH','bhupi_iaf@yahoo.co.in',9910209635,1722212774,'K NO 933, PHASE XI, SECTOR 65\r\nMOHALI 160062','GMADA, Purab Premium Apartments ','SECTOR 88 ','MOHALI','1. Purab Premium Apartment 1  project  was promoted by GMADA in Sector 88, Mohali and launched in the year 2011 and projected as a Premium one with world class amenities and facilities was to be completed in 3 years after the issue of letter of intent (LOI). The LOI was issued in May/Jun 12 and after completion of building and infrastructure, GMADA was required to obtain Completion / Occupation certificate and thereafter issue possession letter by May / Jun 2015. GMADA failed to obtain valid and authentic certificate from the competent authority within the above period and thus falls in the category of ongoing project and required to register with Punjab RERA authority in terms of section 3 of RERA act. \r\n2. GMADA is avoiding registration of this project by producing invalid and false certificates signed by non-competent authorities and against the laid down rules, regulations and policy on the subject. Certificates submitted earlier by GMADA to escape registration must be verified and suitable action taken to get Purab Premium Project registered under RERA Punjab.\r\n3.  On perusal of pending projects with RERA, Punjab as given on RERA web site at serial no 68, GMADA is reflected as promoter of a project for sector 88-89 including Purv Apartments (548.45 Acres). This information is misleading as it does no pertain to Purab Premium Apartments Scheme 2011, as was advertised and followed up with a brochure and so far, GMADA has not received valid and authentic completion certificate as already explained above. Purv Apartments mentioned therein may be fresh scheme which has no relationship with original scheme of 2011. Subsequent to original scheme of 2011, Purab Premium Apartments II and III were also advertised and brochures issued. These were different schemes issued on different dates and these dates may be considered differently for registration with RERA Punjab. Now coming back to pending application with RERA Punjab at S No 68, as per chairman RERA Punjab while briefing the media said Each project is a separate identity and thus has to be registered separately. From close scrutiny of Sl no 68, it seems that GMADA has clubbed two projects, one relates to development of land area and the second relates to a building project.\r\n4. It is requested  that RERA authority must  initiate and take appropriate actions to ensure GMADA to register Purab Premium Apartments Scheme1 Project with RERA so as to enable large number of allottees to get justice who had refused acceptance of offer of possession due to absence of completion certificate. These helpless allottees will be able to file case against GMADA and get justice from RERA. It may be noted that RERA Punjab is presently not accepting any case against projects not registered with them.\r\n5. More details of the case are attached.','Detailed letter on the issue ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','102267','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ef188a01-1d37-4c7d-bd72-ae3622fbe333\\','Doc201810044fff75d3-5856-4295-81b8-e7660f0e5f35.pdf',0,0,'Extract of Brochure of Scheme','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','905603','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ef188a01-1d37-4c7d-bd72-ae3622fbe333\\','Doc20181004e18e1043-2aae-41e5-9de0-e9a96a4f2518.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-04 20:31:36.000','','','','1018',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-04 20:31:36.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-04 20:31:36.000'),(43,1019,2018,'MCNo10192018','FormTypeMISC','GAGANDEEP PAJNI & NEENA SETH PAJNI ','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,'#102, Sector 10 A, Chandigarh-160011','THE SHERWOOD ESTATE','The Sherwood Estate located in Sector 113, Mohali.','Sherwood Estate, Sector 113, Mohali, district SAS Nagar, Punjab.','4.	Facts of the case\r\n1.	That the OP NO.2 had launched a project in the name and style of THE SHERWOOD ESTATE located in Sector 113, Mohali, district SAS Nagar, Punjab.\r\n\r\n2.	That it is submitted that the complainants were interested in a plot and had booked the plot in the OP NO.2s project. The payments made by the complainants are annexed as ANNEXURE C-2.  The details of the amount paid by the complainants are stated in the following tabular form\r\n\r\nSr. No.	Date	Receipt no.	Amount\r\n1.	31.07.2011	363	21000\r\n2.	31.07.2011	227	862500\r\n3.	01.03.2012	571	862250\r\n		TOTAL	1745750\r\n\r\n3.	That on 13.08.2011, the complainants were allotted a plot measuring 250 sq.yards in OP NO.2s project i.e. SHERWOOD ESTATE. In that allotment letter, it was clearly mentioned that the plot will be delivered within one and a half year i.e. 18 months from the date of booking. The said allotment letter is annexed as ANNEXURE C-1.\r\n\r\n4.	That it is pertinent to mention here that to the utter surprise of the complainants, the OP NO.2s project SHERWOOD ESTATE was taken over by the RKM HOUSING SOCIETY LIMITED and the letter mentioning the same was received by the complainants on 21.01.2015. The above mentioned letter from RKM SOCIETY LIMITED is annexed as ANNEXURE C-3.\r\n\r\n5.	That it is pertinent to mention that the OP is a chronic litigant and a serious defaulter in such cases. There are many cases that have been decided against the OP NO.1 & OP NO.2 by various consumer commissions as well as courts. One of such  judgments is attached as ANNEXURE C-4.\r\n\r\n6.	That it is pertinent to mention here that the OP NO.1 i.e. RKM SOCIETY LIMITED  have yet to register its project    RKM CITY, located in sector 113, SAS Nagar, Mohali, with RERA. That Section 3 of the Real Estate (Regulation & Development), Act, 2016 states that, \r\n\r\nProvided that projects that are ongoing on the date of commencement of this Act and for which the completion certificate has not been issued, the promoter shall make an application to the Authority for registration of the said project within a period of three months from the date of commencement of the Act.\r\nThe complainants would like to draw the attention of the Hon able Authority towards the fact that Section 3 to 19, Section 40, 59 to 70 and Section 79 to 80 of the Real Estate (Regulation & Development), Act, 2016, came into force w.e.f. notification dated 01.05.2017. Due to this fact alone, it was mandatory for the OP NO.1 to register its project RKM CITY, located in sector 113 Mohali, with the RERA as the OP NO.1 did not possess any of the requisite certificates at the time when the relevant section (Section 3) of the central act which pertains to the registration of the project came into force, i.e. on 01.05.2017.  Notification dated 01.05.2017 is annexed as ANNEXURE C-6.\r\n\r\n7.	That it is pertinent to mention here that the OP NO.1 has deliberately and intentionally are not getting its project registered under section 3 of Real Estate (Regulation & Development), Act, 2016 and is still in business for selling its plots in its project RKM CITY, Sector 113, Mohali through its brokers via major real estate websites. Screenshot of the websites are annexed as ANNEXURE C-5. \r\n\r\n8.	That it is pertinent to mention here that the OP NO.1 has not registered its project with the concerned authority within the stipulated time period prescribed under section 3 of the act. Therefore under section 59 of the Real Estate (Regulation & Development), Act, 2016 for non compliance with the said Act and for such violation of Section 3 of Central Act, penalty amounting to 10% of the estimated cost of the OP NO.1s project RKM CITY, Sector 113, Mohali should be handed over to the complainant. \r\n\r\nFor the convenience of this authority, the said section is reproduced hereunder\r\n(1) If any promoter contravenes the provisions of section 3, he shall be liable to a penalty which may extend up to ten per cent. of the estimated cost of the real estate project as determined by the Authority.\r\n 	(2) If any promoter does not comply with the orders, decisions or directions issued under sub-section (1) or continues to violate the provisions of section 3, he shall be punishable with imprisonment for a term which may extend up to three years or with fine which may extend up to a further ten per cent. of the estimated cost of the real estate project, or with both.','Annexures C-1 to C-6','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','452604','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6a01482c-0c05-4753-a5b7-057520fe7472\\','Doc20181009b8182a31-2cf1-4028-a548-654f5b2de932.pdf',0,0,'Power of Attorney','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','56562','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6a01482c-0c05-4753-a5b7-057520fe7472\\','Doc201810098121f824-60d0-4873-99b7-80aebd3a1c17.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-09 18:47:05.000','','','','1019',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-09 18:47:05.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-09 18:47:05.000'),(44,1020,2018,'MCNo10202018','FormTypeMISC','Harish verma ','harishverma1984@hotmail.com',9877168803,0,'Hoshiarpur district','Guru Kashi Enclave ','talwandi sabo opp. SDM court or Office ','talwandi sabo ','Guru kashi enclave is unregistered illegal colony in talwandi sabo which was cut when the anil kumar garg Ex. ADC Anil kumar garg was on the post of ADC in puda. He has also a partnership in this colony. Now govt cannot find this fraud that\'s why they are selling the plots at low cost and Finishing the fraud .Pls enquire the this report and tell to Finance Minister of punjab Manpreet singh badal this complaint already sent to him.','aghqefjgh','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','82131','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\85967ac3-9956-4319-b340-f602a92203a8\\','Doc20181009694d5480-3d40-4647-8d77-89c917ff2d3d.pdf',0,0,'adardgg','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','82131','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\85967ac3-9956-4319-b340-f602a92203a8\\','Doc201810097f6b3244-3c8d-4acd-8276-934a56d60774.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-09 21:12:55.000','','','','1020',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-09 21:12:55.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-09 21:12:55.000'),(45,1021,2018,'MCNo10212018','FormTypeMISC','Ashwani Kumar Prashar ','sanjeevgupta253@gmail.com',9417208002,0,'Flat No. 704, GVT Towers, Old Ambala Road, opp DPS World School, Gazipur, Zirakpur, District Mohali','ORVIS GRAND','GVT Towers, Old Ambala Road, opp DPS World School, Gazipur, ','Zirakpur, District Mohali','1.	Date of Booking  		                October , 2017\r\n2.	Date of partial completion  	15.12.2017\r\n3.	Unit-  Flat bearing No. 809, 8th Floor, Tower B, 2630 sq ft (super area) 5 bedrooms, Drawing Room, Dining Room, Kitchen, Five Wash Rooms, Puja Room, Store , Balconies etc.\r\n4.	Name of the project -  ORVIS GRAND\r\n5.	Total Sale consideration- 	Rs.5119400(Inclusive of all taxes)                             \r\n Sale consideration 	Rs. 5000000\r\nIFMD				Rs.25000\r\nClub Charges		Rs.80000\r\nGST on Club Charges	Rs. 14400\r\nTotal				Rs. 5119400\r\n\r\n6.	Total payment made by the complainant-  Rs 5000000/-\r\nDate						Amount\r\n17/10/2017					900000\r\n24/11/2017					2500000\r\n31/08/2018					1350000\r\n29/09/2018					250000\r\nTotal						Rs 5000000\r\n\r\nA.	That the above mentioned unit was sold to the complainant in October, 2017 and respondent has obtained the partial completion certificate on 15.12.2017 in respect of Tower No. B. It was mandatory for the respondent to get itself registered in May, 2017 since it was not is possession of partial completion nor the said tower was complete in all respects. The fact is that even after obtaining the said partial completion the work was not complete as admitted by the respondent vide its letter dated 5.4.2018. \r\nB.	That the respondent was bound to execute the agreement as per RERA and it intentionally did enter into an agreement before December, 2017 to avoid execution of agreement as per RERA and committed violation of Section 13 of RERA and even the agreement executed between the parties in February-March,2018 is not as per RERA. The agreement entered into between the parties is having clauses which are arbitrary.\r\nC.	That in order to avoid registration under RERA and execute agreement as per RERA, the respondent has adopted illegal methods and intentionally did not register under RERA.\r\nD.	An appropriate action be taken against the respondent under Section 59 and 61 of RERA','PARTIAL COMPLETION','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','597977','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\343aec75-db18-4689-9f4d-482f72d78f36\\','Doc20181014eb75ce2f-ca0b-4166-8d07-54d45f7a4168.pdf',0,0,'LETTERS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','891560','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\343aec75-db18-4689-9f4d-482f72d78f36\\','Doc2018101406df8b0b-5a1b-466f-a886-c8526331604c.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-14 08:50:02.000','','','','1021',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-14 08:50:02.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-14 08:50:02.000'),(46,1022,2018,'MCNo10222018','FormTypeMISC','Satish sharma','s.satish30@yahoo.com',9418022394,0,'Bhagyodya Jyotish Kendra The Mall\r\nSOLAN','Royale Empire','Peer Muchhalla( Adjoining Sector 20, Panchkula), Zirakpur, Distt. Mohali','PeerMuchhalla ','The project has built 300 flats. Some of them are incomplete and the builder M/S Jiwan Garg and Prince Garg have abandoned the pjoject. Kindly get this project registered under RERA','Brochure of the project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','923729','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\af254041-50d7-40a6-9200-2cf89b48d6ca\\','Doc2018101698a4d39b-11a7-4618-ba1a-0706fea8a3e6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','923729','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\af254041-50d7-40a6-9200-2cf89b48d6ca\\','Doc2018101660b16f3a-3ea1-466e-934e-308658f0eda8.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-16 17:13:34.000','','','','1022',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-16 17:13:34.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-16 17:13:34.000'),(47,1023,2018,'MCNo10232018','FormTypeMISC','Subedar Singh','subedar_singh@hotmail.com',9999688879,0,'C-803,PLUMERIA GARDEN ESTATES, OMNICRON -III, GREATER NOIDA,  BUDDH NAGAR, UP -201310','KSB ROYAL HEIGHT','SECTOR-126, KHARAR MOHALI','MOHALI','This project is not registered in under RERA, I HAVE already registered the complaint in court RERA/65/2018, RERA/66/2018, RERA/67/2018. Dated 18th Apri 2018 but still no action was taken by the authority. \r\n\r\n','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','17579','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9cb100b8-56f8-4237-b7d4-8b5ac9a6d9b1\\','Doc20181017cefc24b0-7041-43e5-b7f5-006bc5629731.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','19574','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9cb100b8-56f8-4237-b7d4-8b5ac9a6d9b1\\','Doc201810179965a4f3-8b57-4b2a-85c7-5aa40fcfa445.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-17 12:08:16.000','','','','1023',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-17 12:08:16.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-17 12:08:16.000'),(48,1024,2018,'MCNo10242018','FormTypeMISC','Kamalroop Singh Sooch Jaswinder Singh Pawar Parshotam Singh Dhillon Mrs. Bhupinder Rai through Manjit Singh','counsel_manjit@yahoo.co.in',9814700360,0,'Care of  Manjit Singh Advocate K.No. 360 Phase 4 S.A.S. Nagar Mohali - 160 059','That EMAAR MGF Land Ltd a Developer incorporated under the Companies Act 1956 having its Registered Office at 17B MG House Asaf Ali Road New Delhi','Central Plaza at Mohali Hills Sectors 105 108 109 SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab','Sectors 105 108 109 SAS Nagar Mohali Punjab','Complaint for non registration of the Project as required under Section 3 of the  RERA Act 2016.','Buyers Agreement dated 31st March 2008','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','274205','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2dfa94be-7be1-415c-bf8f-6d80acde368c\\','Doc20181018a3fae30f-f12c-433b-8de0-281b2efd6b33.pdf',0,0,'Letters No. 01138 PR20150914173510269 dated 14.09.2015 and others','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','348760','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2dfa94be-7be1-415c-bf8f-6d80acde368c\\','Doc201810180ad9898b-680e-4