021c48ceea8-d1ae-4e51-8217-7da754367dd8.pdf',0,0,'Letter from GMADA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','644045','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5dc60673-9d5f-40dc-8ed6-d6d8fb99f403\\','Doc201810217c22e919-b2fd-4982-a946-097f3d7fb5d4.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-21 10:58:07.000','','','','1026',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-21 10:58:07.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-21 10:58:07.000'),(51,1027,2018,'MCNo10272018','FormTypeMISC','Col. ( Retd.) S.S. Gyani','shashipalgyani@gmail.com',9988151070,0,'Apartment N0. 93, Block D, Multitech Towers, sector 91 Mohali. Punjab','Multitech Towers Sector-91 Mohali','Plot No. 02, Sector 91 Mohali, Punjab','Sector-91 Mohali','COMPLAINT AGAINST PROMOTER / BUILDER M/s MULTITECH TOWERS PVT LTD, having its office at  S.C.O. NO. 139-141, SECTOR 17-C, CHANDIGARH FOR NOT REGISTERING ITS PROJECT LOCATED AT GH-2, SECTOR 91, MOHALI WITH REAL ESTATE REGULATION AUTHORITY ( RERA -2016)\r\n\r\n','Complaint against Builder','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','250561','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8046405b-3676-40ed-b115-e5c00398481b\\','Doc201810211277850a-789c-4b4e-b130-f275525b6097.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','644045','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8046405b-3676-40ed-b115-e5c00398481b\\','Doc20181021ec438945-3213-49ac-8f94-8631ea64c735.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-10-21 11:03:47.000','','','','1027',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-10-21 11:03:47.000','MiscComplainant','2018-10-21 11:03:47.000'),(52,1028,2018,'MCNo10282018','FormTypeMISC','Kamal Grover','uniquefriend01@yahoo.com',9814110005,0,'Flat No,.5 F, Shivam Apartment, Golden Enclave, Lohgarh road, Zirkapur','Mona Greens2','Gazipur road, Zirakpur','Gazipur/tehsil Zirakpur/district SAS Nagar Mohali','As per RERA act incomplete projects falls under RERA act and should be registered\r\nwhereas Mona green 2 at Gazipur road is still under construction and have not even got completion certificate of J Block So it should be registered with RERA but company had registered their another project but left out this project to sake their skin as project is around 3 years delay\r\n2  As per law EWS space should be reserved and could not be sell out to others but in this project company sold out the space using rights in the form of club house to all the residents and made the very small swimming pool zym and community hall at the first two floors of the space resereved for EWS\r\n3  Construction material used is very cheap hence backside boundary wall of this project has fell down and is under construction whereas project is under construction and there is no weight on this wall\r\n4 Builder had violated site plan and had installed the generator and other electricity unit on the exit road whereas per plan shown to all the buyers there was a road \r\nFurther the electricity unit is just adjourning to the children park and while installing this unit adoring to the children park is playing the lives of the residents as during rainy season  any mishap penning could be happened as residents and their children are playing in this very small park.\r\n5. Project is still under constitutions even then builder had applied for completion certificate against the law.\r\n6. Without getting completion certificate  builder had issued possession certificate to the residents which is also not as per law.\r\n7.There are various similar discrepancies which are dealt with strict hands to save the interest of genuine buyers.\r\nKindly action should be taken against this builder and discrepancies should be removed.\r\nThanking you\r\nyours faithfully\r\nKamal Grover\r\nAdvocate\r\nOwner of J 704 Mona Greens 2.\r\nM 9814110005','Mona Green 2 is not available on RERA Site','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','76254','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\fc7b2581-6631-47c0-bcd1-a826a70e6d28\\','Doc20181029c6faeeba-c393-4ec9-ba1a-d2835bcc35e6.pdf',0,0,'Situation of MonaGreen 2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','155208','.pdf','readwriteda