 Tibri Road, Bypass  84.77 Acre, New Gurdaspur','Gurdaspur Improvement Trust Colony, Development Scheme no 7, Tibri Road Gurdaspur. Punjab.','Gurdaspur Improvement Trust Colony Development Scheme no 7, Tibri Road, front falling at village Sahijada Nangal 84.77 Acre,  Gurdaspur','24	12-Nov-2018	No clearance from MOEFF, Fire, Pollution control Board, NHAI/PWD, Depart of housing and Urban Development as per approval granted for CLU	\r\nNo Completion certificate for the Layout, No Occupancy certificate for the layout, No water, NO STP, No Roads, Still Layout is under Development	\r\nRERA authority need to take action against such promoters for violating rules and cheating innocent public.	\r\n27		Changed Layout Plan without approvals, Got approved for residential layout but making a commercial layout.	\r\n28		Charging illegal non-construction and enhancement fee from allotees for which they took full money from august 2011, but so far delivered nothing 	\r\n29		Charging illegal money for executing Sale deed and issuance of No Due Certificates, which are legal documents after every sale transaction.	','detailed list of timeline and Violations and need to Register under RERA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','59924','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\63f11eb2-2e71-4cc9-bfee-91298a345118\\','Doc201811124b36714e-f41b-4771-b9a0-4f95f9407bbf.pdf',0,0,'Timeline from MOEFF for Approach road for layout - not approved yet','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','122120','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\63f11eb2-2e71-4cc9-bfee-91298a345118\\','Doc2018111226d461f9-f86f-4dba-b20f-96f49decb671.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-11-12 10:20:12.000','','','','1032',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-11-12 10:20:12.000','MiscComplainant','2018-11-12 10:20:12.000'),(57,1033,2018,'MCNo10332018','FormTypeMISC','Vivekanand Sharma','vnsharma1168@yahoo.co.in',9815603702,0,'Vivekanand Sharma R/o H.No.1168, Sector 42-B, Chandigarh-160036','MR.RAVI GARG, MANAGING DIRECTOR, MOBILE NO. 9501254111, SANSKRITI APARTMENTS & SANSKRITI CITI CENTRE, SECTOR 115, GREATER MOHALI','SANSKRITI APARTMENTS & SANSKRITI CITI CENTRE, SCO NO. 78-79, FIRST FLOOR, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH. TEL.NO.0172-4645409-10-11-12-13-14','SECTOR 115, GREATER MOHALI (PUNJAB)','It is for the information that I have visited the RERA Office, Sector 18, Chandigarh on 14.11.2018 and found from their record that SANSKRITI APARTMENTS, SECTOR-115,GREATER MOHALI is not registered with RERA Punjab. It is, therefore, requested to take necessary legal action at the earliest and also resolve the refund booking amount alongwith interest to the complainant i.e. Vivekanand Sharma.\r\nDelay in Possession of furnished Flat No. 323(A) Ground Floor of 1100 Sq. ft. ASTER in SANSKRITI APARTMENTS, SECTOR-115,GREATER MOHALI for which the Possession was due on 16-01-2018 as per the Allotment Letter Agreement dated 16-01-2016 under clause 30(a) the possession was due within 24 (Twenty Four) month after the Allotment letter.  But the construction work has been suspended since 2017 after furnished construction of two sample Flats of 2BHK and 3BHK to lust the Public in 2016. I have already paid Rs. 6,96,947/-  (Rupees Six lac ninety six thousand nine hundred fourty seven only)  from 31-10-2015 to 13-01-2016 (Copy of receipts are attached in PDF format) against receipts from SANSKRITI  GROUP OF COMPANIES, SCO No. 78-79 Sector-8C, Chandigarh before Allotment letter.\r\nAt the time of booking of above Flat, the flat rate were negotiated with Ms.Asha & Mr.Sunil, Sales Representative of SANSKRITI GROUP OF COMPANIES i.e. Rs.22,40,000/- with possession time 18 months i.e. 02.12.2015 however at the time of Agreement dated 16.01.2016 the rate were increased Rs.23,36,300/- with time period of possession was increased 24 months without assigning any reason (Proof enclosed).\r\nSANSKRITI GROUP OF COMPANIES has also conveyed vide letter dated 02-01-2016 that Interest 24 percent will be charged if payments not received on or before due date (copy attached).\r\nIt is mentioned here that SANSKRITI GROUP OF COMPANIES, SCO 78-79, Sector-8C, Chandigarh has published the SANSAKRITI APARTMENTS, Sector-115, Greater Mohali in the year 2015. The two sample flat furnished of 2BHK and 3BHK were constructed in the year 2016 to encourage the public for booking. The plinth level of some units have been started and since 2017 the construction work has been suspended and even Sample flats are also in bad shape. Now, No body is available in Sites as well as in Head office, Sector 8C,Chandigarh. Even the Managing Director of Sanskriti Group namely Mr. RAVI GARG, Mobile No. 9501254111 keeping his mobile switch off or not picking at all. Thus the Firm has cheated the public money and thus, now lost the faith.\r\nKeeping in view of the above you are, therefore, requested to kindly direct the SANSKRITI GROUP OF COMPANIES to refund the my above money i.e. Rs. 6,96,947/- (Rupees Six lac ninety six thousand nine hundred fourty seven only) already paid to SANSKRITI GROUP OF COMPANIES for SANSKRITI APARTMENTS, SECTOR 115, GREATER MOHALI along with 24 percent interest and also bear the cost of Documents as well  as the cost of RERA, if any, to resolve this issue at the earliest . \r\n','Receipts the amount paid by the complainant','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','306321','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7a973a34-f12a-4999-b408-820875550dcf\\','Doc20181114afaf302b-10c7-4fab-aa85-bd1523c13293.pdf',0,0,'Allotment Letter/Agreement','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','273675','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7a973a34-f12a-4999-b408-820875550dcf\\','Doc20181114ef955c90-3a7a-44ca-b375-7c329341c1a3.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-11-14 13:33:41.000','','','','1033',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-11-14 13:33:41.000','MiscComplainant','2018-11-14 13:33:41.000'),(58,1034,2018,'MCNo10342018','FormTypeMISC','Navin Kumar','kmrNavin@gmail.com',9990304903,0,'Rajesh Laboratory, Krishna Gali Narwana, Haryana','Scheme no 7, Tibri Road, Improvement Trust Gurdaspur','Scheme no 7, Tibri Road, Improvement Trust Gurdaspur','Gurdaspur','\r\n\r\n1 its Ongoing project - missing necassary clearances from PUDA, MOEFF, NHAI, PPCB, Fire etc.\r\nGIT has approval for acquisition of the land from Government.\r\n\r\n2 PSPCL agreement still ongoing - refer letter\r\nApproach road - requests are pending with MOEFF\r\nout of 83 acres, only 29 percent is residential, rest all will be commercial.\r\n\r\n3 No STP, no water supply, no water distribution system, no Internal roads, no street lighting.\r\n\r\nsewage pipe is directed to open drain. \r\n\r\nGIT is auctioning property wihout RERA registration no, inspite of the fact that even basic development works is not completed.\r\n\r\nGIT made entrances by encroaching forest land without approval, and forcing allottes to construct houses by levying very heavy non-construction fee.\r\nGIT made changes in clause no. 7 of allotment letter which is a violation to 1983 rules.\r\nGIT is making another illegal colony having all basic amenties are just in papers.\r\n\r\ncommencement of the Project in 2004, acquired agricultural land from farmers in 2007.  And alloted to buyers in august 2011, within just 8 months of physical \r\n\r\nposession of the land i.e. 23 DEc 2018 from farmers.\r\n\r\nPaid 1/4 of market price to farmers (just 12 lakh per acre) and sold same land (at 7108 per sq yard, Rs. 3.5 Crores per acre )  29 times of rate paid to farmers.\r\n\r\nNo development even till today but an organized loot of poor citizens in the name of penalities for not constructing house within 3 years of allotment. \r\n\r\nHigh court enhanced land rate to 24lakh, But GIT is raising endless, daily new demands in the name of enhancement fee.\r\n\r\nBuyer are being chared even for execution od sale deed.\r\nFor issuance of NO Due certificate, GIT demands rs 1000 and offers provisional No Due certificate, So that it can tinue looting people for life time.\r\n\r\nrefer photos of land which is converted into barren land by such oifficials, which is useful for noone, neither farmers nor citizens.\r\n\r\nhuge money taken in the name of enhancement is not being mentioned in sale deed anywhere.\r\n\r\nFor a plot of 500 sq yard, having sale price of 35,54,000, we have already paid 46,00,000 from year 2011.\r\n\r\nSo in summary they sold us agricultural land (after stealing soil) at the rate of residential land (no amenity, no completion date) and raising demands like golden egg \r\n\r\nlaying goose, providing no details on how its calculating, from which date, at what rate. \r\n\r\nRaising illegal , unexplained, demands like 7,00,000 in 7 days.\r\n\r\nwe are not finding any way to exit from this trap. pls help.\r\n\r\nAll projects except Improvements Trusts are getting registered with RERA. GIT is looting citizens much more that a private builder can. ','Forestry approval status for approach road','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','122120','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0455f147-7701-48d2-ba29-e4be2d95ac45\\','Doc201811154801a753-2bcf-438f-93b7-ee27b3ac9653.pdf',0,0,'RTI','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','192865','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0455f147-7701-48d2-ba29-e4be2d95ac45\\','Doc201811159f6b1016-4d00-4fc3-b4fd-ceca169cebb0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-11-15 20:08:42.000','','','','1034',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-11-15 20:08:42.000','MiscComplainant','2018-11-15 20:08:42.000'),(59,1035,2018,'MCNo10352018','FormTypeMISC','ARUNA SHARMA RAJ KUMAR','MANOJVERMA1111@YAHOO.CO.IN',8283829570,0,'FLAT NUMBER 313 FOURTH TOWER CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB','SANJEEV KUMAR AND OTHERS CITY HEIGHTS BUILDERS AND PROMOTERS ',' SITE OFFICE AT CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB',' PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB AT CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY','BUILDER HAS NOT ATTAINED COMPLETION CERTIFICATE TILL DATE SO NEEDS TO BE