nately they had to closed that society project because of some reason. When l went to them to refund my money they refused to refund. Now lam requesting you that kindly take some action against these society builders ( Dara Group) and refund my amount Rs 58000/- as soon as possible.\r\n','Payment Receipt','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','352867','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b648ab59-5861-4cfd-97ee-f11c84713ff2\\','Doc20181205edec8757-0388-4266-a126-efc6e710fe80.pdf',0,0,'Confirmation Letter of Pre-Booking','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','228846','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b648ab59-5861-4cfd-97ee-f11c84713ff2\\','Doc2018120514133a65-df67-44a1-b002-b0cffb7330af.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-12-05 13:33:23.000','','','','1043',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-12-05 13:33:23.000','MiscComplainant','2018-12-05 13:33:23.000'),(68,1044,2018,'MCNo10442018','FormTypeMISC','SANJAY KUMAR and SWETA SANJAY KUMAR','lawofficeofhimanshuraj@gmail.com',9988100005,1724181010,'#102, Sector 10 A, Chandigarh','KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS','KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS situated in Sector 126, Mohali',' district SAS Nagar, Punjab','	Facts of the case\r\n1.	That  OPs  had launched a project in the name and style of KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS situated in Sector 126, Mohali, district SAS Nagar, Punjab\r\n\r\n2.	That it is submitted that the complainants were interested in an apartment and had booked the apartment having price tag of Rs.32, 00,000 in the Ops project. The complainants to fulfill their legal obligation towards had also availed loan from the bank to pay off the installments on time. The details of the amount paid by the complainants is stated in the following tabular form\r\nSr. No.	Date	cheques DD Rtgs No.	Amount	By Whom\r\n1	23.07.2015	BARBH105204144649	1,80,000	Complainant\r\n2	03.08.2015	BARBH15264515	1,40,000	Complainant\r\n3	04.08.2015	BARBH15216142557	50,000	Complainant\r\n4	06.08.2015	BARBH15218100781	85,000	Complainant\r\n5	07.08.2015	BARBH15219459743	75,000	Complainant\r\n7	19.08.2015	291950	23,50,000	Bank\r\n		TOTAL	28,80,000	\r\n\r\n3.	That it is pertinent to mention here that the OPs have yet to register its project KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS with RERA. That Section 3 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development, Act, 2016 states that, \r\n\r\nProvided that projects that are ongoing on the date of commencement of this Act and for which the completion certificate has not been issued, the promoter shall make an application to the Authority for registration of the said project within a period of three months from the date of commencement of the Act \r\nThe complainants would like to draw the attention of the Hon ble Authority towards the fact that Section 3 to 19, Section 40, 59 to 70 and Section 79 to 80 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development, Act, 2016, came into force w.e.f. notification dated 01.05.2017. Due to this fact alone, it was mandatory for the OPs to register its project KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS with the RERA as the OPs did not possess any of the requisite certificates at the time when the relevant section Section 3 of the central act which pertains to the registration of the project came into force, i.e. on 01.05.2017.  Notification dated 01.05.2017 is annexed as ANNEXURE C 1.\r\n\r\n4.	That it is pertinent to mention here that the OPs have deliberately and intentionally are not getting its project registered under section 3 of Real Estate Regulation and Development, Act, 2016 and is still in business for selling its flats in its project KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS through its brokers via major real estate websites. Screenshot of the websites are annexed as ANNEXURE C 2. That it is also pertinent to mention here that there are many cases lodged against the OPs in Consumer Commissions and in one of the case No.792 of 2017 SANJAY KUMAR VS. K SONI BUILDERS and PROMOTERS and OTHER, the Ops has filed an affidavit through its managing Directors stating that the said project KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS is at finishing stages and the units are ready for possession. The said statement in the affidavit of the OPs makes it crystal clear that OPs are still in business of selling of units in its project KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS without having requisite clearances from the concerned authority and without registering its project with RERA, till the filing of the present petition. Hence, the OPs are liable for violation of the central act and must be penalized for the same. List of cases against the OP is annexed as ANENXURE C 3 and an Affidavit of the OP in one of such cases is annexed as ANNEXURE C 4.\r\n','Annexures C-1 to C-5','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','852935','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\cffb75ff-4e0d-4d90-856a-abfb1b863241\\','Doc2018120997e2b7dd-6920-4c4a-8b23-29f13c927fec.pdf',0,0,'Power of Attorney','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','58566','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\cffb75ff-4e0d-4d90-856a-abfb1b863241\\','Doc20181209beaea4ba-3e66-4edf-b3a0-dc225019a068.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2018-12-09 17:08:33.000','','','','1044',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2018-12-09 17:08:33.000','MiscComplainant','2018-12-09 17:08:33.000'),(69,1045,2018,'MCNo10452018','FormTypeMISC','neeraj goel','neeraj4goel@gmail.com',9217657750,0,' FLAT NO 305  BLOCK 2 CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI ','CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA','CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB','VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB','BUILDER HAS NOT ATTAINED COMPLETION CERTIFICATE TILL DATE SO NEEDS TO BE REGISTERED UNDER RERA ACT . IF IS NOT REGISTERED IS TO BE PENALIZED AS PER LAW AS BASIC FACILITIES IN THIS PROJECT ARE LACKING. FLATS ARE NOT LIVEABLE.SO COMPLAINT IS FILED TO MAKE THIS PROJECT REGISTERED UNDER RERA ACT AGAINST PROJECT APPROVED IN THE NAME OF MS. SANJEEV KUMAR AND OTHERS AND PROMOTED BY CITY HEIGHTS BUILDERS AND PROMOTERS  SITE OFFICE AT CITY HEIGHTS SOCIETY PEER MUCHALLA VILLAGE MC ZIRAKPUR SAS NAGAR MOHALI PUNJAB WHOSE PARTNERS AR