as not registered even till today. it is furthermore relevant to mention here that the project is ongoing.','Allotment letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','605642','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\27a568a1-8027-49ef-b0a2-53180ce8ba4c\\','Doc2019012215a48a55-9581-4a91-9e9d-40f3f4a1dc0e.pdf',0,0,'Communication','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','476251','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\27a568a1-8027-49ef-b0a2-53180ce8ba4c\\','Doc20190122cf1a9e20-4ff8-460a-8d39-b9e98ca27ba8.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-01-22 00:56:50.000','','','','1053',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-01-22 00:56:50.000','MiscComplainant','2019-01-22 00:56:50.000'),(78,1054,2019,'MCNo10542019','FormTypeMISC','Satish Kumar','adv.dixitgarg@gmail.com',8130090494,0,'H. No 85-A, 1st Floor, Dushant Lok, 3rd Sector 57, Gurgaon, Haryana','Royal Heights','Sector 126, Mohali','Kharar, sector 126, Mohali','As per Section 3 of the RERA Act, the builder i.e. M/s K.Soni Builders & Promoters Pvt. Ltd. registered office at SCF 13-14, Chajju Majra Road, Sector 126, Greater Mohali, Kharar is required to registered its project namely \"Royal Heights\" at Sector 126, Mohali as admittedly, the construction work is still going on and no occupation is obtained yet. Further it is submitted that as per the mandatory provisions of the RERA Act, the builder is required to registered its project but in the present case, the said project has not be registered yet by the builder/promoter. So, the strict action may kindly be taken against the builder/promoter and he be directed to get his project registered as soon as possible and also heavy penalty should have been imposed upon the builder/promoter for not complying with the mandatory provisions of the RERA Act.','Agreement','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','787682','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\bf14eebe-a3ec-46de-8378-abdb0ee8af15\\','Doc20190124fa849c44-9324-4eab-827e-9bdbf1fbaf6e.pdf',0,0,'Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','734638','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\bf14eebe-a3ec-46de-8378-abdb0ee8af15\\','Doc20190124b9c6f420-d0ae-412f-bb2a-9136c2c1867c.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-01-24 22:07:35.000','','','','1054',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-01-24 22:07:35.000','MiscComplainant','2019-01-24 22:07:35.000'),(79,1055,2019,'MCNo10552019','FormTypeMISC','Sanker Kumar Roy','sa73ro@gmail.com',9868943361,0,'Qtr No. 533, Tyre-1, Sector-2, R.K Puram, New Delhi-110041','Royal Heights','Sector 126, Greater Mohali, Kharar','Sector 126, Greater Mohali, Kharar, Distt. Mohali','As from the photographs attached it is prima facie clear that the construction work is still going on and the builder is required to get his project registered with the RERA authorities but the same is not registered even till today which is clear violation of Section 3 of the RERA Act. The builder should be directed to get his project registered.','Photograph','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','67825','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0205bac8-95f3-44c1-baad-bc4441c06e23\\','Doc201901287537b580-30aa-4d70-8668-13f4fd7b4c88.pdf',0,0,'Photograph 1','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','48773','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0205bac8-95f3-44c1-baad-bc4441c06e23\\','Doc20190128791514b8-987c-4d4e-8ddb-6b7c0d63e8d7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-01-28 22:04:24.000','','','','1055',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-01-28 22:04:24.000','MiscComplainant','2019-01-28 22:04:24.000'),(80,1056,2019,'MCNo10562019','FormTypeMISC','Neeraj Sarmai','neeraj_sarmai@hotmail.com',9646769001,0,'FNO - 41 B, SBP Homes Ext 2, Sector 126 , Greater Mohali - 140301','SBP Gardenia','SBP Homes Gardenia, Sector 126, Greater Mohali, Kharar, SAS Nagar Punjab','ChajjuMajra','I went to SBP Gardenia Sales office on 6th Jan 2019 and got booking done for flat having unit no 251. Sales team told me that we have all the approvals and shown some RERA no also. Later when I checked in RERA site that this project is not registered and then started requesting SBP officials for refund of my booking amount of 1 lakh which was made 50,000 using POS and 50,000 using cheque for which scanned documents are attached. I have been following since 12-Jan with SBP official by visiting there office and on mail but no response from them so finally seeking your help.','Booking Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','689807','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0818ed68-e746-4802-837e-9aaadf7233f9\\','Doc2019020696397e9e-38b2-4cfe-8a32-df7eb1c6dc17.pdf',0,0,'Booking form and additional documents','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','923583','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0818ed68-e746-4802-837e-9aaadf7233f9\\','Doc20190206705ffb54-462d-451b-9af9-758c1798b0ce.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-02-06 17:20:44.000','','','','1056',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-02-06 17:20:44.000','MiscComplainant','2019-02-06 17:20:44.000'),(81,1057,2019,'MCNo10572019','FormTypeMISC','baljeet singh bal','advhar77@gmail.com',8477000009,0,'18 Rajguru nagar extension  Ludhiana','K 10 TOWER   FEROZE GANDI MARKET LUDHIANA','SCO 22 23 FEROZE GANDHI MARKET LUDHIANA','LUDHIANA','THE PROJECT IS WITHOUT THE COMPLETION CERTIFICATE AND THUS LIABLE FOR REGISTRATION UNDER RERA AS PER THE ACT','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','420360','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5915205a-e16e-436b-9457-66e53da6aa29\\','Doc20190212153d568c-2af9-4f9b-896e-c505e42f6ce8.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','420360','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5915205a-e16e-436b-9457-66e53da6aa29\\','Doc20190212bd7432d5-8fb3-4e43-a286-336495423f13.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-02-12 14:25:03.000','','','','1057',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-02-12 14:25:03.000','MiscComplainant','2019-02-12 14:25:03.000'),(82,1058,2019,'MCNo10582019','FormTypeMISC','Padma Aggarwal ','dr_amanaggarwal@yahoo.co.in',9872192793,0,'33A SST Nagar, Sunam road, Sangrur','Mansahia Nagar development scheme of Sangrur Improvement Trust','Sunam road, Sangrur','Sangrur','Development Scheme called as Mansahia Nagar scheme was launched by Improvment Trust Sangrur on 8.2.2011 wherein all modern facilities such as wide roads, parks, water, sewerage, street lights etc were promised. Parks are far away from development, even the boundary walls and grills around parks are being fitted now in 2018-19. Skeletal roads have been built with the patchwork of interlocking tiles in 2018. What to talk of modern facilities the development scheme lacks basic things. There are many ongoing development works in the scheme. As such this development scheme must have registered under RERA as it had not completed development by the said date as envisaged in the RERA act that states\r\n\r\nProvided that projects that are ongoing on the date of commencement of this Act and for which the completion certificate has not been issued, the promoter shall make an application to the Authority for registration of the said project within a period of three months from the date of commencement of this Act \r\nProvided that projects that are ongoing on the date of commencement of this Act and for which the completion certificate has not been issued, the promoter shall make an application to the Authority for registration of the said project within a period of three months from the date of commencement of this Act .\r\n\r\nNon Construction Fee of Rs 320861 has been charged from me for delay in construction despite the fact that the development scheme still lacks basic facilities that were promised. Even the approach road to the development scheme had remained blocked due to parking of autorikshas and taxis owing to arbitrary decision of the developer to handover the common space of shopping complex to Bus stand without taking two third allotees into confidence. Improvement Trust Sangrur.\r\n\r\nA loan of Rs 8 crore was unauthorizedly given to Municipal Committee out of the funds collected from allottees.\r\n\r\nI have lodged an online complaint against non registration by developers on RERA website of Punjab government too, but owing to some technical issue I couldn\'t get acknowledgment of the complaint.\r\n\r\nI request you to please take note of the flouting of rules and investigate the matter, order refund of the NCF thus collected from me with interest, impose penal action on the developers.\r\n','Brochure','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','695825','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\27f964ca-f1d1-4232-bb33-d3fa54edb89b\\','Doc20190312515c0b89-01f4-412e-a30e-5a76a10e988b.pdf',0,0,'Lay out plan and terms ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','695825','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\27f964ca-f1d1-4232-bb33-d3fa54edb89b\\','Doc201903120a7ef77d-1aed-474b-b6f7-13ed428ccffb.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-03-12 15:17:20.000','','','','1058',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-03-12 15:17:20.000','MiscComplainant','2019-03-12 15:17:20.000'),(83,1059,2019,'MCNo10592019','FormTypeMISC','Baljinder Kaur','amanwaliaus@gmail.com',9243251888,0,'A 304 , Ranjit Avenue , Amritsar, PIN 143001','IT CITY  --  GMADA ','Plot number 3315 , IT CITY,  Sector 82 A, Mohali . ','Mohali ','GMADA allotted  me a plot number 3315, 82 A , Mohali , in IT city. The plot and surroundings are 30 Ft deep and not livable. Need help to resolve this issue. The plot is not livable. please help','Letter written to GMADA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','108710','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1c18ce0e-fbd0-4355-85a7-9f781421fea9\\','Doc20190312871686e8-5ce0-4492-806b-113ae670b666.pdf',0,0,'Letter written to GMADA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','108710','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1c18ce0e-fbd0-4355-85a7-9f781421fea9\\','Doc201903124d4da90f-71f1-46f2-9b9e-6b68b824b3bf.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-03-12 22:07:02.000','','','','1059',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-03-12 22:07:02.000','MiscComplainant','2019-03-12 22:07:02.000'),(84,1060,2019,'MCNo10602019','FormTypeMISC','Mohammad Akram','akram7786@gmail.com',8628003786,0,'# 1142,\r\nSector - 68,\r\nMohali, Punjab.\r\nPin 160062','Sky Rock City Welfare Committee','Behind Chandigarh group of colleges, Landran, Mohali','Landran, Mohali, Punjab','Myself Mohammad Akram along with my brother Mr. Mohammad Azam booked two plots in sky rock city, landra - mohali measuring 150 sq yards each. Hence we have give around 40 lakhs in installment for plots for which we got the allotment letter but till date no possession has been given. Also the President of the Society is in Jail for fraud. Pls look for either giving possession of plot or giving us the money back.','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','79944','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1a955226-7a70-42d5-ae3f-2d68de19f66d\\','Doc20190313e54e67f0-37cb-4be2-9873-1c19259f607f.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','79944','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1a955226-7a70-42d5-ae3f-2d68de19f66d\\','Doc20190313f42d62ab-3fcf-4ddc-a07c-2af5a7745481.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-03-14 12:21:38.000','','','','1060',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-03-14 12:21:38.000','MiscComplainant','2019-03-14 12:21:38.000'),(85,1061,2019,'MCNo10612019','FormTypeMISC','Bhag Singh','harish635@rediffmail.com',9855623729,0,'R/o Village Lakhnour, Post Office Sohana, Tehsil & Distt. SAS Nagar, Mohali','Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, Mohali','Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, Mohali adjoining to Sector 88-89, Mohali','Tehsil & Distt. SAS Nagar','Complainant is LOI holder of the plot measuring 500 Sq. Yds, 300 Sq. Yds and 300 Sq. Yds and other commercial property as well. One of the LOI No. is 40509 dated 21/9/2015 of 500 Sq. Yds. But till date no development work has been started despite 3.5 years already lapsed.','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','132139','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\de3b6fcc-e55f-4c11-9f5f-25ccca6ec95b\\','Doc20190325f8050903-dea4-4206-aae1-bee20d89eba3.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','132139','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\de3b6fcc-e55f-4c11-9f5f-25ccca6ec95b\\','Doc201903252015e54e-6f55-40c4-8f9c-8bd6e8a7d6cf.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-03-25 19:20:00.000','','','','1061',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-03-25 19:20:00.000','MiscComplainant','2019-03-25 19:20:00.000'),(86,1062,2019,'MCNo10622019','FormTypeMISC','Satish Kumar Sethi','ashishchauhan@akassociates.org.in',9999468603,0,'502, Sethi Bhawan, Rajendra Place, new Delhi 110008','DLF GALLARIA','Jalandar','Chandigarh, Punjab','The Complainant wanted to open a restaurant in order to generate a regular income and carry out its livelihood after retirement and so came in contact with the OP\'s for the purchase of retail units to be used for the aforesaid stated reason whereby the Ops assured the complainant of their upcoming and most promising project by the name of DLF GALLARIA (hereinafter to be referred to as the project\'\') which was being developed in Jalandhar, Punjab\r\nAfter much persuasion by the OPs the complainant agreed to purchase plot JLM no. 222 of the project and paid a sum of Rs.31,84,200/- towards the booking\r\nThereafter, the Ops offered the complainant to purchase retail units JLM NO.216-219 as the combined space of the said units was larger than the earlier booked plot JLM no.222 thereby the complainant trusting the floor plan of the project of the Ops agreed to purchase JLM No.216-219 in place of JLM No.222 and the amount paid by the complainant towards the booking of JLM No.222 was appropriated towards JLMNo.216-219\r\nOPs intimated the tentative cost for the units in lieu of the transfer including the basic sale price, service tax, property registration charges for a sum of Rs. 2,64,71,257.92/-\r\nInitial booking of plot JLM No.222 by the complainant was converted into allotment of four unit i.e. JLM No. 216-219 vide expression of interest.\r\nThe complainant was asked to clear the dues of payment and accordingly the Complainant vide cheque no. 909652 and cheque no.909653 dated 27.12.2012 made the payment of Rs. 63,30,120/- and Rs. 19,72,000/- respectively. Consequently the booking of plot JLM no.222 by the complainant was converted into allotment of four unit i.e JLM no. 216-219 and same was confirmed by the OP\r\nAgreements qua the unit JLM no. 216-219 was executed between the complainant and the OPs whereby the OPs was to hand over the possession of the plot within36 months from the date of execution of the agreement\r\nThe complainant repeatedly approached the OPs to hand over all the necessary documents such as no. objection certificate, completion certificate, certificate of occupation if any issued by the competent authority along with sanction plan amongst others but the OPs never furnished the same which as mandate under transfer of property act\r\nThe OPs instead of furnishing the aforesaid relevant documents, furnished a mere offer of possession letter of the plots\r\nThe complainant had already paid a sum of Rs.2,21,89,720/- till date. Aggrieved by the aforementioned the complainant served a legal notice dated 26.07.2016 to the OPs thereby calling the OPs to furnish the abovementioned necessary documents. However to the dismay of the complainant no reply was received by the complainant on the above stated legal notice. Accordingly, the complainant preferred another legal notice dated 18.11.2016 whereby calling the OPs to furnish all the relevant documents which are mandate under transfer of property act or furnish with the amount paid by the complainant, failing which the complainant is not liable to continue the aforesaid agreement and has liberty to terminate the agreement in light of clause 11(4) whereby the OPs become liable to refund the amount paid by the complainant along with simple interest of 9% p.a. for the period the amount paid by the complainant is under the custody of the OPs.\r\nHowever, no reply was received by the complainant to the aforementioned notice. Consequently, the Complainant vide legal notice had to terminate the agreement and seek the amount paid by the complainant towards the plots of the project of the OPs.\r\nHowever, no reply whatsoever was received by the complainant to the said notice neither the OPs furnished the relevant documents nor the amount paid by the complainant. Hence, the present complaint.\r\nBeing Aggrieved, the Complainant approached to the Hon\'ble National consumer Dispute Redressal Commission vide filling the Complaint bearing No. in C.C. No. 2335 of 2018 titled \"Satish Kumar Sethi Vs DLF Limited.\"\r\nThat the Hon\'ble Commission vides its order dated 03.01.2019 directed the complainant to move Hon\'ble RERA for speedy remedy.\r\nThe Present Complaint Under RERA against Promoter for non compliance of Section 3 of rera','Copy of payments receipts','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','300280','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0a7d3870-9cc7-4d92-a57d-235b90d913f3\\','Doc20190408d354312e-6f99-4a9b-b7e5-d3f6eb564c50.pdf',0,0,'allotment letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','197694','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0a7d3870-9cc7-4d92-a57d-235b90d913f3\\','Doc2019040869b53c88-3fa5-4c43-b9cb-6e1dd819c845.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-04-08 15:31:33.000','','','','1062',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-04-08 15:31:33.000','MiscComplainant','2019-04-08 15:31:33.000'),(87,1063,2019,'MCNo10632019','FormTypeMISC','Dukhi Ram','luckyman@gmail.com',8888855223,0,'Bhott bade khet ban gye veerane, Lapata ganj, Punjab','Bana hi nahi','Mera khet jo ban gaya veerana','Lapata Ganj','Dukhi Ram se waada kiya gaya tha ki khet ko badal k project banega, durhi ram tu crorepati banega. Khet se bhaise bhaga di. Khet me ret hi reh gyi','Dukhi Ram Banjar khet','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','17261','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\34360f02-deb5-44a5-992e-e44d214435c1\\','Doc20190419da570dda-568d-4b74-b4c1-43415db28b40.pdf',0,0,'Dukhi Ram Banjar khet doosra trikon','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','17261','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\34360f02-deb5-44a5-992e-e44d214435c1\\','Doc20190419d1cd703d-c1f8-425b-89f4-827344eddc5c.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-04-19 15:09:01.000','','','','1063',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-04-19 15:09:01.000','MiscComplainant','2019-04-19 15:09:01.000'),(88,1064,2019,'MCNo10642019','FormTypeMISC','Dalip Chauhan','myvakil2016@gmail.com',9991333228,0,'H. No. 1073, Sector 21 B, Chandigarh ','Celebrity Suites, in CITY CENTRE','Sector 115, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Kharar - Landran Road, Punjab','Sector 115','That in year 2013 Mr. Gurdeep Singh applied for the allotment of an apartment in the proposed project \"Celebrity Suites\" in CITY CENTRE, Sector 115, SAS Nagar, Mohali, Kharar - Landran Road, Punjab. The apartment no. C-443 was allotted to the complainant and the allotment letters were issued by the Company. It is important to note that as per the terms of the allotment letter, the possession had to be delivered within 18 months of the allotment.\r\n\r\nIn year 2014, the original allottee transferred the apartment in the name of the Complainant. Till date, there is no construction at the site and there appears to be no willingness on part of the company to deliver the project. The Complainant has visited the Company again and again but nothing positive has yielded till date. In consequence thereof, the complainant has also sent legal notice for refund of the amount deposited along with the interest of 18% but no response has been received till date. Therefore, it is respectfully prayed that direction may kindly be given to the company to register the project with the punjab real estate authority and to decide the claims of the Complainant.','Transfer Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','680829','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b416b99d-8e52-48fb-af75-67a7bd158a1d\\','Doc201904196590322e-e1db-4cbe-bfa2-0b05aa69cc59.pdf',0,0,'Allotment Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','506431','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b416b99d-8e52-48fb-af75-67a7bd158a1d\\','Doc2019041996e6ec45-6495-4370-99e4-1048fef021be.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-04-19 15:39:38.000','','','','1064',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-04-19 15:39:38.000','MiscComplainant','2019-04-19 15:39:38.000'),(89,1065,2019,'MCNo10652019','FormTypeMISC','Bhag Singh ','harish635@rediffmail.com',9855623729,1722217635,'Village Lakhnour, PO Sohana, Tehsil SAS Nagar, Mohali','Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, Mohali','Sector 90-91, Opposite Sector 88-89, SAS Nagar, Mohali','Sector 90-91, SAS Nagar, Mohali Tehsil Mohali Distt. Mohali','GMADA issued LOI in favour of complainant vide LOI No.40509 dated 21/09/2015 to allot a 500 Sq. Yds. Plot under Land Pooling Scheme. As per condition No.6 of LOI possession of plot is to be given after development on the spot. But GMADA has not started the development of the project till now. Now complainant wanted to file complaint against GMADA under the provisions of RERA Act, But came to know that the present project is not registered. Whereas other similar project for Sector 88-89, under land pooling scheme is registered having registration No.PBRERA-SAS81-PM0121.','LOI in favour of Bhag Singh','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','138130','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2f418281-e2f4-4608-a063-6e3483c7fd41\\','Doc20190430bffaf502-10be-49bc-9acf-ad0395643098.pdf',0,0,'Another LOI in favour of Bhag Singh ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','138976','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2f418281-e2f4-4608-a063-6e3483c7fd41\\','Doc20190430a8a9a162-c404-468e-bdc1-a5fa763707e0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-04-30 18:55:24.000','','','','1065',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-04-30 18:55:24.000','MiscComplainant','2019-04-30 18:55:24.000'),(90,1066,2019,'MCNo10662019','FormTypeMISC','adarsh bhatia','rexfzr@yahoo.co.in',9888535888,0,'H.No 43 sector 8 Panchkula','Parsavnath Mall metrix','GF-46 on Ground Floor at Mall Matrix, Site no. 2, Phase VIII B, Industrial Focal point, Mohali, Punjab','Phase 8 b Industrial area mohali','This is to bring to the notice of the Hon\'ble Punjab Real Estate Regulatory Authority that PARSVANATH MALL MATRIX has not registered itself with the PRERA as per section 3 of the RERA and has violated the same. That I booked GF-46 on Ground Floor at Mall Matrix, Site no. 2, Phase VIII B, Industrial Focal point, Mohali, Punjab with PARSVANATH MALL MATRIX but the possession has not been delivered on time. When I proceeded to file a complaint with PRERA for a refund with compensation and interest, I was informed by the staff of the Hon\'ble authority that before proceeding with that complaint, I should file a complaint regarding the registration as the same project is not registered with the PRERA. It is a humble submission to the Hon\'ble authority that an appropriate action is taken against the same. I would be highly obliged.','provisional allotment','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','180418','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7a191350-e3f4-427c-b277-4a01cf18505f\\','Doc2019051022a3790f-3c99-430e-a4c7-f8d069a5af0c.pdf',0,0,'provisional allotment','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','180418','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7a191350-e3f4-427c-b277-4a01cf18505f\\','Doc201905100adce225-f85b-4e4a-86aa-74e6fc24fc97.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-05-10 14:16:39.000','','','','1066',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-05-10 14:16:39.000','MiscComplainant','2019-05-10 14:16:39.000'),(91,1067,2019,'MCNo10672019','FormTypeMISC','khushwinder singh','khush.panesar@gmail.com',9815049779,0,'2169 A Block No 6 Sector 63 Chandigarh','Gulmohar Residency Sector 116','Plot 78 Sector 116 Gulmohar Residency Mohali','Chhapar Cherri Sector 116','We have bought the Plot No 78 , Sector 116 , Mohali from Punjab Empires on 02-Feb-15 also completed all formalities like registry , intkaal etc and property is currently on loan thru HDFC Ltd . but when we have approached for the possession and found that builder has done the fraud with us and plot 78 land is not with punjab empires and still with original owner . We have tried to contact Mr. Randhir Sood many times but hasn\'t received any satisfactory response from the builders request you to take intimidate action against Mr. Randhir Sood , Tehsildar and patwari who has involved in the fraud and done registry with wrong details fraudulently , also in compensation of cost and interest which we have paid to builder / bank','Registry Details','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','203870','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\34bc1efa-cec2-43fe-a060-40e17d7e04ff\\','Doc20190514490e530a-62a1-44af-9d9e-134d38244270.pdf',0,0,'Complaint Raised with consumer forum','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','26548','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\34bc1efa-cec2-43fe-a060-40e17d7e04ff\\','Doc20190514c2c1f84f-055c-44f5-9651-cfafa7bf60c7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-05-14 06:48:08.000','','','','1067',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-05-14 06:48:08.000','MiscComplainant','2019-05-14 06:48:08.000'),(92,1068,2019,'MCNo10682019','FormTypeMISC','RAKESH KUMAR','rakesh43246@gmail.com',9354657583,0,'434/11, near punjabi dharmshala, taraori (KARNAL), haryana','Gillco VAlley REsidential Plots','Vill. Sante Majra','TEHSIL KHARAR  (Sector-127)','they are selling plots with EDC charges & IDC charges (without approval) , municipal kharar also demanding extra charges against EDC for approval of const. plan','1','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','8103','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d2b2a393-3021-485b-bd32-d29f9dbbc5a2\\','Doc2019060228185ce0-33a7-4956-a1f0-ead0dcf39171.pdf',0,0,'2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','8103','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d2b2a393-3021-485b-bd32-d29f9dbbc5a2\\','Doc20190602faa99bdd-fb5f-4772-b95d-2af0d036c5dc.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-06-02 13:03:48.000','','','','1068',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-06-02 13:03:48.000','MiscComplainant','2019-06-02 13:03:48.000'),(93,1069,2019,'MCNo10692019','FormTypeMISC','MANDEEP SINGH','MANDEEP.SINGH837@YAHOO.COM',8054481441,0,'#82/1-F, ST. NO. 3, PRATAP NAGAR, PATIALA','Construction of MIG Flats (Block 1 & 2) in Maharaja Yadvindra Enclave, Patiala (Punjab) under self-financing scheme./Improvement Trust, Patiala','MAHARAJA YADVINDRA ENCLAVE, NABHA ROAD, NEAR PRTC WORKSHOP, PATIALA, PUNJAB.','PATIALA.','I want to invite your kind attention to the fact that MIG Flat No. 3 SF Block-2 (under construction) in Maharaja Yadvindra Enclave, Patiala (under self-financing scheme) has been allotted to Mr. Mandeep Singh via. Letter No. PIT/17/3681 dt. 22-12-17. Barrel draw for this scheme was conducted at Improvement Trust Patiala office dt. 23-12-16.\r\n\r\nThe construction work was in progress after one month from the date of Inauguration of this scheme i.e. 23-12-16 by Sh. Vishnu Sharma (Ex-Chairman, Improvement Trust, Patiala).\r\n\r\nIt has to be noted that from the past one year, the construction work has been stopped/ halted by the contractor for the unknown reasons.  The estimated time of completion of this project as mentioned in the brochure was two and half years (21/2 yrs). It means, if we calculate 21/2 yrs from the date of allotment letter i.e. 22-12-17 (one year later from the date of commencement of work i.e. 23-12-16), the date of completion works out to be 23-06-2020.\r\n\r\nAt present, only 20% work has been done at site. As Construction of Structural Elements such as Columns, Beams and Slabs have not been completed. The photographs from site has also been attached for your reference. By no means, it seems that construction work will be completed within one year or by due date of completion i.e. 23-06-2020. \r\n\r\nAlso on site visit or from the photographs (as attached) it is seen that, quality of work done by the contractor is not up to the mark or as per Indian Standard Specifications. Please refer site photographs (as attached) for information regarding flaws or imperfection in workmanship.\r\nTherefore, I request you to kindly look into this matter and do the needful regarding the same. I hope that, necessary action will also be taken against promoter/department regarding delay in construction work as well imperfection in workmanship.\r\n\r\nAs per the Schedule of Payments as mentioned in Allotment Letter, the Details of payment which has been done till date are specified below-\r\n1. Rs 50,000/- (Earnest Money)\r\n2. Rs. 9,91,000/- (25% of Total Cost + Security + 6% Cess + Misc. Charges) dt. 21-01-18\r\n3. Rs. 2,51,250/- (Ist Installment) dt. 19-06-18\r\n4. Rs. 2,51,250/- (IInd Installment) dt. 19-12-18\r\nTotal Amount- Rs. 15,43,500/- (Rs. Fifteen Lac Forty Three Thousand and Five Hundred)\r\n\r\nI once again request you to kindly help me in this regard.\r\n\r\nThe copy of news (regarding the same issue) is also published in Dainik Bhaskar dt. 11-06-19 (Patiala Version).\r\n\r\nThanking you.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nMandeep Singh\r\nContact- 80544-81441\r\nAddress- #82/1-F, St. No. 3, \r\nPratap Nagar, Patiala.\r\n\r\n\r\n','SITE PHOTOGRAPHS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','630939','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\55ebc062-2227-49ef-8462-d97aaa186afd\\','Doc20190620702a0a86-807b-462c-a7cc-73b1ec557e6e.pdf',0,0,'LAYOUT PLAN','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','69869','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\55ebc062-2227-49ef-8462-d97aaa186afd\\','Doc20190620767536a8-5b44-4776-86fd-9a898a5a4f1d.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-06-20 13:12:35.000','','','','1069',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-06-20 13:12:35.000','MiscComplainant','2019-06-20 13:12:35.000'),(94,1070,2019,'MCNo10702019','FormTypeMISC','Manvendra Jain','manvendra_jain@yahoo.co.in',9818090014,0,'H. No. C-1/05, Sector-36, Noida, U.P., 201303','Industrial Knowledge Park','sector-90, Mohali','S.A.S. Nagar, Mohali','On 02.11.2006, complainant booked a unit in INDUSTRIAL KNOWLEDGE PARK, sector-90, Mohali, floated by GMADA and paid an amount of Rs.1092675. Developer buyer\'s agreement was executed on 12.01.2007 between the complainant and developer for designer studio number 13 measuring 874.14 square feet. Parties also executed a lease agreement for 09 years on 12.01.2007 and as per clause 4 of this agreement, complainant was entitled to assured lease rental of Rs.30,000 to Rs.45,000 subject to certain conditions.\r\nConstruction of project started on 19.07.2007. Complainant availed loan of Rs.22 lacs from HDFC Ltd and a tripartite agreement was executed between complainant, developer and HDFC Ltd. However, HDFC Ltd. did not disburse any instalment to Respondent as there was no sign of progress at site. Possession got due on 18.01.2010. \r\nOn 16.03.2010 complainant was paid Rs.76450 for period 19.01.2010 to 31.03.2010. Later on 29.06.2010 respondent sent a letter to complainant admitting delay in possession and assuring him compensation as per buyer agreement.\r\nOn 13.02.2015, complainant sent a legal notice demanding delayed payment interest and assured rental as promised in lease agreement. Till date complainant had paid Rs.3185350 to respondent, however the construction at site is not progressing and therefore complainant through this complaint is claiming refund along with interest, compensation and assured rental.','complaint with annexures','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','246549','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\23cc4335-65c0-476b-a412-1e205b0cb578\\','Doc201907123c2b82d4-f5c7-4b4d-81b8-e19262b3026c.pdf',0,0,'COMPLAINT','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','246549','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\23cc4335-65c0-476b-a412-1e205b0cb578\\','Doc201907120320b452-8e84-4c57-bc42-5b5d2afd8a66.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-07-12 16:48:07.000','','','','1070',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-07-12 16:48:07.000','MiscComplainant','2019-07-12 16:48:07.000'),(95,1071,2019,'MCNo10712019','FormTypeMISC','Karanbir Singh','hundgen.k@gmail.com',9815998984,0,'Flat No. 302 Tower -9 Palm Royal Estate, Green Model town  Jalandhar','Palm Royal estate by AHR Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd',' Palm Royal Estate, Green Model town, Wadala Road   Jalandhar','jalandhar','I am resident of Palm Royall Enclave. I booked a flat in this housing project in 2009 and get flat in 2011 the project at that time is partial built. After some time the construction work of rest of this project stopped due to a court case regarding irregulaties in project vide  case no CWP NO. 21578 of 2011in Punjab and Haryana high court and court gave direction to builder and to municipal corporation Jalandhar to sort out irregularties. Which were till not sorted out. Builder has not obtained NO OBJECTION CERTIFICATES from concern authorities so far. As builder has not even form a society on his behalf to run day to day work. Due to which we resident are suffering a lot. As per RERA laws a project which has not obtained NO OBJECTION CERTIFICATE should registered him self with RERA. But AHR promoters and developers have no applied for registration with RERA so far. Builder has even not started work to built flats for weeker section so far which were approved under this project.\r\nI hereby bring your kind notice that the AHR PROMOTERS AND DEVELOPERS   PVT LTD  is not REGISTERED  WITH RERA so far despite not getting No Objection Certificate FOR THEIR project\r\nPALM ROYAL ENCLAVE , \r\nGREEN MODEL TOWN,\r\n JALANDHAR-144003\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is requested you to take necessary action  to register the AHR Promoters and Developers Pvt. Ltd  with RERA so residents can raise  Complaint their grievances  to you\r\nthe detail of present directors and flat offered by builder is attached\r\n','AHR DETAIL','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','121778','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8fcd1bd-2fcc-4d4d-afd4-25b78c52991f\\','Doc2019072213c67adb-741f-492e-b7a7-7e81a7470d27.pdf',0,0,'Project Brochure','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','847569','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8fcd1bd-2fcc-4d4d-afd4-25b78c52991f\\','Doc20190722c969b446-0628-487c-8ca8-1456b0a45c59.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-07-22 11:11:48.000','','','','1071',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-07-22 11:11:48.000','MiscComplainant','2019-07-22 11:11:48.000'),(96,1072,2019,'MCNo10722019','FormTypeMISC','Shiv Singh','shivshiv.19@gmail.com',7676712638,0,'6C, Drishti Homes, Near Vaishano Devi mandir, Landran Road, Swaraj Enclave, Kharar','Drishti Homes','Drishti Homes, Near Vaishano Devi mandir','Landran Road, Swaraj Enclave, Kharar','Many families in this society are facing internal construction issues like poor wooden work, plumbing and paint. I would like Rera to notice all above problems and resolve these on the behalf of builder by taking appropriate action against builder Property Finderz, Builderz and Developerz Ltd. Please find the attached documents.','Complaint Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','46757','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6a7bd83f-4717-4830-89fd-a03a23c8e740\\','Doc20190729aeadc958-2d55-4afb-aed2-897ac708a4b6.pdf',0,0,'Pictures','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','379564','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6a7bd83f-4717-4830-89fd-a03a23c8e740\\','Doc20190729b0bf2850-497d-4de4-81c7-881ccaef8aac.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-07-29 14:25:15.000','','','','1072',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-07-29 14:25:15.000','MiscComplainant','2019-07-29 14:25:15.000'),(97,1073,2019,'MCNo10732019','FormTypeMISC','Arif Siddiqui','arifsiddiqui1310@gmail.com',9871996147,0,'House NO. 260-C, Regal Shipra Society Indirapuram, Ghaziabad (UP)','KSB Royal Heights','K.Soni Builders and Promoters, Sector 126, Kharar, Mohali','Sector 126','the builder failed to get the OC even till today and the construction is still going on. Moreover, the project was not even registered with the authorities.','Payment Receipt','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','319862','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1f3f0da9-5cc2-4c46-8d35-b6708b35ffe6\\','Doc20190908aa871a99-53cc-4c84-92be-a8166f6e61cc.pdf',0,0,'Photograph','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','127917','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1f3f0da9-5cc2-4c46-8d35-b6708b35ffe6\\','Doc201909081a1e6897-b004-4d72-bc8e-39cd2798af05.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-09-08 08:23:30.000','','','','1073',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-09-08 08:23:30.000','MiscComplainant','2019-09-08 08:23:30.000'),(98,1074,2019,'MCNo10742019','FormTypeMISC','SUKHWINDER SINGH','SUKHWINDER_SINGH_MEHNDIRATTA@YAHOO.CO.IN',9815728500,0,'25 GOLDEN AVENUE AMRITSAR','CITY CENTRE MALL, BATHINDA','CIVIL LINES BATHINDA 151001','NEAR SECRATERAT,BATINDA','OUR HARD EARNED MONEY WAS INVESTED IN THE CITY CENTRE MALL BATHINDA  AND IT WAS PROMISED BY SATYA DEVELOPERS  TO GIVE FIXED\r\n AMOUNT .BUT NOW THEY ARE DENYING TO GIVE POSSESSION OF THE SHOP AS WELL AS  MONEY .WE HAVE REGISTERED THE COMPLAINT BY POST. \r\nWE HAVE RECEIVED LETTER FROM YOUR SIDE(MENO NO RERA/PB/2019/LEGAL/AM(L)5185 DATED 5-9-19 WITH AUTHORITY VIDE DIARY NO4016 \r\nDATED 02.9.19) TO REGISTER COMPLAINT ONLINE BUT WE ARE UNABLE TO FIND THE REGISTER NUMBER OF THE PROJECT.ALSO ATTACHMENT \r\nHAS BEEN ATTACHED OF SAID REGISTERED COMPLAINT (BY POST) .PLESE DO THE NEEDFUL','COMPALINT AGAINST SATYA DEVELOPERS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','39845','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\921b8b25-3bf3-4999-975f-f1359db0b0da\\','Doc2019091756fa89da-9d3d-4c58-b5fc-33305aecd28a.pdf',0,0,'COMPALINT AGAINST SATYA DEVELOPERS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','72400','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\921b8b25-3bf3-4999-975f-f1359db0b0da\\','Doc20190917406dc6fd-4193-4de0-ad3f-27930141ffbf.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-09-17 18:41:10.000','','','','1074',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000','MiscComplainant','2019-09-17 18:41:10.000'),(99,1075,2019,'MCNo10752019','FormTypeMISC','Anonymous','rera_complaint@protonmail.com',1234567890,0,'Kharar, Mohali','Gulmohar city','Kharar-Badala Road, Near Railway station, Kharar, SAS NAGAR (Mohali)','Kharar-Badala Road','Hello Sir\r\nI would like to bring to your kind attention that builder of Gulmohar city has only registered half of his project with RERA other half is still not registered with RERA despite so many reminders by people of society. He takes hefty charges in the name of EDC even though there are no basic facilities like road etc. If anyone opposes to pay EDC fees he brings in his local goons and makes life difficult of every person. \r\n\r\nMoreover if someone asks him to give receipt of those EDC charges he doesn\'t give them that in writing. All of the people are very scared of him. We request you to take urgent action against him since it\'s mandatory to register \'entire\' project under RERA and not partial area only.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to your action on this complaint.\r\n\r\nP.S I have given wrong phone number due to fear from him however you can always reach out to me over my email ID listed above.','Basic info about complaint','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','47183','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\428d4e8f-7db3-4fcb-8659-8d0758998bb5\\','Doc20190921964e974e-f08f-4565-9ac4-af388198e611.pdf',0,0,'Basic info about complaint','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','47183','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\428d4e8f-7db3-4fcb-8659-8d0758998bb5\\','Doc20190921731afeee-0dc8-4890-97e4-967cbdf90635.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-09-20 23:56:29.000','','','','1075',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000','MiscComplainant','2019-09-20 23:56:29.000'),(100,1076,2019,'MCNo10762019','FormTypeMISC','MOHIT  TANEJA ','tanejam14@gmail.com',9356714557,0,'34 PHASE 09 MOHALI PUNJAB ','YUDVIR SINGH FRIENDS ENCLAVE VILLAGE GHOLU MAJRA DERRA BAASI ','FRIENDS ENCLAVE GHOLU MAJRA DERRA BASSI DISTT SAS NAGAR MOHALI','GHOLU MAJRA ','Dear Sir we had purchased a plot no 142 in Friends enclave village gholu majra distt derra bassi the dealer sold us wrong plot where ht cable passing on also no water system and faculty till date we have tried to approach so many time to dealer but he is neglecting the same request with kindly support us KINDLY TAKE A LEGAL ACTION ALL OF DEALER THOSE ARE ENVELOPED IN THIS. DEVELOPMENT ','WRITTEN ACKNOWLEDGEMENT BY DEALER ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','28581','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d9b3f67a-fb50-4fbf-8dd1-bf1269d96337\\','Doc20190927f3a63c47-73fd-4f72-8e7f-bee27c0b885d.pdf',0,0,'WRITTEN ACKNOWLEDGEMENT BY DEALER ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','265376','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d9b3f67a-fb50-4fbf-8dd1-bf1269d96337\\','Doc201909272cc1361d-a023-4c19-bcc1-c7ab635534f8.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-09-27 16:16:25.000','','','','1076',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000','MiscComplainant','2019-09-27 16:16:25.000'),(101,1077,2019,'MCNo10772019','FormTypeMISC','President, RWA Sohi Heights','sohiheights@gmail.com',9780448334,0,'Flat No. 205, Sohi Heights, Gazipur Road, Zirakpur, Distt. SAS Nagar (Mohali) Punjab 140603','Sohi Heights','Gazipur, Road','Zirakpur','Sir\r\n1.	That Ms. SOHI BUILDERS 207 Industrial Area Phase I Panchkula left the site without completion of numbers of works and without obtaining Completion Certificate to be issued by competent authority by affixing an undated Notice that SOHI BUILDERS will not maintain essential  services after 30.4.2019. Copy enclosed as Ann. A1.\r\n2.	We, all the residents of this premises i.e. SOHI HEIGHTS have set up an Association \r\nw.e.f. 1st May, 2019 so as to attend the essential services like security, electricity, water and Gen. set etc.\r\n3.	 That Residents Welfare Association Sohi Heights requested Ms. SOHI BUILDERS vide Regd. Letter No. 01SHRWA dated 06.5.2019 Copy enclosed as Annexure A2\r\nto complete the following works as agreed upon in the meeting dated 28.4.2019 \r\n\r\ni)	Documents of Fire Fighting System STP Gen Set etc.\r\nii)	Payment of Property Tax till possession.\r\niii)	Completion Certificate.\r\niv)	Maintenance charges of Vacant flats at Rs.2000 per month.\r\nv)	Clearance of electricity bill till date.\r\nvi)	Proper Earthing of Building.\r\nvii)	Provision of proper drainage of water in stairs.\r\nviii)	Fire fighting system is not in working condition.\r\nix)	STP is not in working condition.\r\nx)	Holes in the boundary wall at rooftop to be filled.\r\nxi)	Barbed wire fencing of main boundary wall to be done.\r\nxii)	Proper drainage of rainwater on Rooftop.\r\nxiii)	Cleaning of underground Water Tank.\r\nxiv)	Cleaning painting of Grills Railings of Stairs and Balconies.\r\nxv)	Flat Number Parking Number of all flats with proper earmarking.\r\nxvi)	Wall paper in rooms or payment of Rs. 5000 per flat.\r\nxvii)	Cutting of extra steel bars in staircases and walls.\r\nxviii)	Proper grinding finishing of stairs.\r\nxix)	All the four lifts need to be checked Inspected by the Company.\r\nxx)	Heavy seepage in outer walls all over the building.\r\nxxi)	Aviation lights Red beacons not affixed.\r\n\r\nDespite several reminders to Ms. Sohi Builders no work has been attended to by them.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n4.	 That to complete the process of registration of the RWA  following   documents are required to be completed supplied by the Builder for which Ms. Sohi Builders was requested to supply the following documents vide Regd. Letter dated 09.7.2019 \r\ni)	Tower wise Flat wise list of owners duly signed sealed by the builder.\r\nii)	List of vacant flats duly signed sealed by the Builder.\r\niii)	Valid Fire Safety Certificate issued by the Fire Officer.\r\niv)	Completion Certificate by M.C.\r\nMs. Sohi Builders have not provided the required documents which shows non cooperative attitude of the Builder.\r\n5.	Some photographs of building are enclosed herewith showing work is incomplete and number of patch on external paint work. \r\n6.	That SOHI HEIGHTS comes under ongoing Projects as on the date of commencement of this Act i.e. 01.4.2017 as Completion Certificate has not been issued by the M.C. Zirakpur as evident  from M.C. letter No.152 dated 20.9.2019 Photo copy enclosed as Annexure A3.\r\n	It is therefore requested that Ms. SOHI BUILDERS may be directed to complete the works as mentioned above and maintain all essential services till Completion Certificate is issued by the competent authority or take appropriate action against Builders. \r\n\r\nYours faithfully\r\n\r\nPRESIDENT\r\nRWASOHI HEIGHTS\r\nGAZIPUR ROAD\r\nZIRAKPUR PUNJAB\r\n\r\n','Photographs','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','56113','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c7fdf2dc-3b1b-4058-bcfa-2efc30255f4c\\','Doc20191031a83f0a86-ba97-45f8-8a85-223d6fd9e6d4.pdf',0,0,'Annexures 1,2,3','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','935029','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c7fdf2dc-3b1b-4058-bcfa-2efc30255f4c\\','Doc201910319c7d726a-17ae-46d3-8c47-173c0a40ae4b.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-11-01 11:51:51.000','','','','1077',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-11-01 11:51:51.000','MiscComplainant','2019-11-01 11:51:51.000'),(102,1078,2019,'MCNo10782019','FormTypeMISC','KEWAL KRISHAN MITTAL','mittalkewal@yahoo.com',9417775910,0,'32, GURJIWAN VIHAR , DHAKOLI, ZIRAKPUR, DISTT. S.A.S.NAGAR, PUNJAB. P.C. 160104','S.C.O. SHOPPING CENTER/ SHOW ROOM PLAZA/ MUNICIPAL COUNCIL ZIRAKPUR','OLD KALKA ROAD, NEAR SEWRAGE BOARD BUILDING OPP. BIG BAZAR ZIRAKPUR','ZIRAKPUR/ PROJECT ADJACENT TO GOLD MARK PHASE I  (PBRERA-SAS79-PR0117)','\r\nRespected Sir/ Madam, Your Honor the Commercial Project was advertised on 21.04.2013 (Copy of advertisement enclosed). Project is not registered till date with the Honorable Real Estate Regulatory Authority, Punjab.\r\nLay out Plan of Show Room plaza have not been sanctioned /approved by competent authority.\r\nOccupation Certificate have not been obtained.\r\nEight plots have been sold out of thirty plots till date.\r\nChange of land use not obtained.\r\nCopy of Lay out Plan of Showroom plaza is enclosed as attachment, which is not prepared by architect, not approved by any competent authority.\r\nProject not registered with PUDA.\r\nThe developer again put the property/ plots for sale on 19.07.2013 through advertisement.\r\nTill date development not done.\r\n\r\nThe location details of the project, with clear demarcation of land\r\ndedicated for the project along with its boundaries including the\r\nlatitude and longitude of the end points of the project not available.\r\nDemarcation of plots not done as per law.\r\nYour honor a prayer is being made to take action as per law in case of \"Unregistered Projects.\r\n\r\nPlease acknowledge.  Your good offices are requested to provide me the information on the action being taken on my information.\r\nRegards\r\nKEWAL KRISHAN MITTAL','ADVERTISEMENT ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','906613','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\26faf5ae-5a42-4f27-90ca-c4b18c75b8c6\\','Doc2019110568cf611a-e058-415a-9ae8-59a6249a987d.pdf',0,0,'LAY OUT PLAN ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','704879','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\26faf5ae-5a42-4f27-90ca-c4b18c75b8c6\\','Doc20191105ea825a97-5dff-467a-8706-50f6932df8d6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-11-05 13:35:49.000','','','','1078',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-11-05 13:35:49.000','MiscComplainant','2019-11-05 13:35:49.000'),(103,1079,2019,'MCNo10792019','FormTypeMISC','KRISHAN KUMAR CHAUDHARY','kkchaudhary025@gmail.com',9316208023,1752361244,'H.NO.36, ST.NO.24, TRIPURI TOWN, PATIALA','MULTI-TECH TOWERS-2 (THE CROWN)','MULTI-TECH TOWERS-2, SECTOR 90, MOHALI','SECTOR 90, MOHALI','I have booked a 3 bhk luxury flat in Multi-Tech Towers-2 (Now called The Crown) to be built at Sector 90, Mohali by builder  i.e. Multitech Towers Pvt. Ltd. (Group company of Manohar Singh and Co., Sec.17, Chandigarh) in January, 2011.  The total cost of plot was to be RS.62.50 lacs.  This flat was to be completed in 3 years.  I have paid 10 percent of the cost of plot i.e. RS.6.20 lacs at the time of pre launch booking of flat.  An amount of RS.6.98 lacs was paid within 6 months of booking.  Hence total amount of RS.13.18 lacs has been paid.  Not even a brick has been laid by the builder for construction of flats despite lapse of 8 years.  I have visited office of the builder at least 200 times during these 8 years.  Every time I get false promise that construction is being started very soon.   The project was never got registered with RERA by the builder.  The builder is also not refunding my amount.  I filed complaint with RERA, Punjab in Nov., 2018.  Notice under Section 59 was issued by RERA to the builder.  RERA has informed us vide its letter dated 18.4.2019 (copy attached) as follows -\r\nThat the builder has replied to the notice that few bookings were accepted, but because of poor response the project was shelved.  No bookings were made after enactment of RERA Act.  The project is no longer an ongoing project as such registration is not required.  As per version of builder they have not violated any provisions of the act.  As perversion of builder the process of refund has started.  \r\nEven now, more than 6 months have passed to this reply, nothing has been received from builder in refund.  In total nine years have elapsed.  It shows builder is intentionally defrauded and has no intention to refund the amount.  I should be refunded my amount with 12 percent interest.  Please, help me getting my amount back.','LETTER NO.RERA/PS/CP/2481 dated 18.4.2019','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','71513','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e292084b-227b-4c0d-84b5-4634c427caf2\\','Doc201912126038002d-b7bf-4658-98c1-5cb90684b4b0.pdf',0,0,'Letter issued by Company','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','66384','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e292084b-227b-4c0d-84b5-4634c427caf2\\','Doc2019121253935d2a-f374-4d88-9448-15218f8cd31a.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2019-12-12 15:57:42.000','','','','1079',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000','MiscComplainant','2019-12-12 15:57:42.000'),(104,1080,2020,'MCNo10802020','FormTypeMISC','Karanbir Singh','hundgen.k@gmail.com',9815998984,0,'Flat No. 302 Tower-9 Palm Royale estate green model town Jalanadhar','Palm Royale Estate flats by AHR promoters and Developers pvt ltd',' Palm Royale estate green model town  wadala roadJalanadhar','jalandhar 144003','Reference no to my earlier application   MCNo10712019 I had reported about Builder AHR promoters and Developers pvt ltd who has not registered himself with RERA so far despite not getting NOC for his housing project till date I have not got any communication from yourside whether my application was considered or not\r\n\r\n,','company advertisement','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','847569','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\62df207a-fc66-4ed3-a97e-be1359a3f52b\\','Doc202001094e6ae5ab-7e84-4083-8fca-59fb70376dcd.pdf',0,0,'company detail','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','121778','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\62df207a-fc66-4ed3-a97e-be1359a3f52b\\','Doc202001093e6092ed-3c79-48fa-baa6-2ca1d2b44eb7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-01-09 17:13:54.000','','','','1080',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000','MiscComplainant','2020-01-09 17:13:54.000'),(105,1081,2020,'MCNo10812020','FormTypeMISC','SAAHIL SINGLA','saahil@scl.gov.in',7404205752,0,'PTDD -DPG Group, Semi-Conductor Laboratory, Dept of Space,Govt of India \r\nSector 72- SAS Nagar-160072\r\nPhone- 0172-2296254 ','Preet City','Sector 86 Mohali','Sector 86 Mohali','The land in Sector 86 was allotted to Preet City promoters with layout approval in 2009.  However, the layout plans has lesser number of plots than the exact number sold by the promoters. The plot numbers like 511, 736-1 do not exist in the approved layout map but are however being sold by Preet City promoters. Many plots do not have layout and approval to get registry done and start construction . Please provide the latest Sector 86 zoning and layout plan to the public to ascertain the exact details and approved plots.  You are requested to take strict action against Preet City for selling more number of plots than actually approved. \r\nThe details of Preet City promoters and contact are in the attached file.','Page1','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','202567','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\15a03893-9437-4fc7-b6