y project to use the same for their own purpose . It seems that M/s GBP is running a fraud/scam whereby grabbing the money from people for such dummy projects and using the same for their purpose. Management of M/s GBP is involved in this well organized scam. They are not providing the documents related to their application for approval of said project under RERA and its present status.   M/s GBP is also not responding to return the money back deposited for this project for appx. last two years.\r\n','Agreement','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','961366','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b57a09b1-e2eb-41ae-a823-b2b57e281858\\','Doc2020031435adc0ca-4b54-4fa2-8688-bce7c4ba2565.pdf',0,0,'Project Plan given by M/s GBP','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','648646','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b57a09b1-e2eb-41ae-a823-b2b57e281858\\','Doc20200314f33f4e2c-f59f-42f8-a324-8bbc17ad0b09.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-03-14 13:48:50.000','','','','1083',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-03-14 13:48:50.000','MiscComplainant','2020-03-14 13:48:50.000'),(108,1084,2020,'MCNo10842020','FormTypeMISC','k l ghai','vishalghaig@gmail.com',9418290200,0,'sai sadan opposite jasbir oberoi nursing home,jodhamal bagh ,pathankot-145001','0.46 acre balmiki chowk shopping complex','balmiki chok pathankot','pathankot','it is hereby submitted that improvement trust Pathankot has auctioned shops on dtd 7-11-2016 ,we have purchased shop no -9 during auction,and paid all the amount of rs 77,00,000( approx)(seventy  seven lac approx),with stipulated time frame 7-8-2017,but after that almost nil construction in that shopping complex,almost more than 10 shops are auctioned and amount deposited till date but improvement trust pathankot has stopped construction due to unknown reasons,till date no electricity arrangment has been made and toilet block is uncomplete .many other works are lingering on since last three years,Hence all the hard earned money we have paid to improvement trust is seems to be in vain,as at present it is not possible to open any kind of shop  or office in that area','full and final payment receipt submitted to improvement trust pathankot','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','145835','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d5ac9e1c-2375-480a-9ba8-5450c2b3c91e\\','Doc20200316ca3d300e-33fe-404e-beea-6551b7c119fa.pdf',0,0,'allotment letter by improvement trust pathankot','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','97779','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\d5ac9e1c-2375-480a-9ba8-5450c2b3c91e\\','Doc2020031671a36b01-ad27-4b39-96f6-6763810413c9.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-03-16 08:29:11.000','','','','1084',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-03-16 08:29:11.000','MiscComplainant','2020-03-16 08:29:11.000'),(109,1085,2020,'MCNo10852020','FormTypeMISC','Paramjeet Singh','paramjeet@emergency247.in',9717193702,0,'Wz 100 a/2, sant garh, mbs Nagar','Star City','Vill. Gharuan, near Chandigarh University, Chd-ldh highway.','Gharuan','We were planning to buy land in Star City and after asking for orders from PUDA, the builder has failed to produce any document. I am filing this requisition to know if Star City, Gharuan is an approved project by PUDA or not. ','None','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','88660','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a9d0b24d-70e9-47d8-a0ab-f08a1020bba9\\','Doc202003226ea24e17-e1e4-4e07-9c7a-953793e3c313.pdf',0,0,'None','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','88660','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a9d0b24d-70e9-47d8-a0ab-f08a1020bba9\\','Doc202003224ed241e9-a8e0-4644-a442-a8815ce55e54.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-03-22 15:44:32.000','','','','1085',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-03-22 15:44:32.000','MiscComplainant','2020-03-22 15:44:32.000'),(110,1086,2020,'MCNo10862020','FormTypeMISC','Navdeep singh','bnkamboj@rediffmail.com',7009482918,0,'dushera ground rai sikh bhawan fzr city','Gobind Enclave   unregistered colony',' opposite govt veterinary hospital Gol Bagh Road,near RSD College, Ferozepur city','Ferozepur city',' Dear Sir, Complaint against Balwinder singh, Raghuishwar nath,Harjinder Singh, Surinder Singh sons of Daualt Singh s/o Ram Chand, resident of dulce ke road Kamboj Nagar, Ferozepur City and M/s J.S.R.Enterprises, Balniki Chowk,OPposite PUDA Market, outside Delhi Gate, Ferozepur City and partner Rajesh Chawla s/o Satish Chawla s/o Dharam chand residents Mall road near I.T.I Ferozepur City for violating the statue and its rules by illegally carving out colony name (Gobind Enclave Near R.S.D College FZR City)without obtaining change of land use, and without any legal permission by the authorities.2).That Balwinder Singh and others, all son of Daulat Singh, without obtaining any change of land use and without seeking permission from PUDA carved out unapproved colony and had started alienating different plots to their vendees. They have sold approximately 50 kanal 10 marla to M/s J.s.R.Enterprises referred to above and have also sold other land to Several vendees.Till date they have sold away approximatelyy 68 kanals of land in different parcels in the form of plots, 3) Further the Property Dealers and various other Persons who may be the vendee/BUYERS are hurriedly executed sale deeds and in case they sell the entire colony area in shapes of plots and they succeed in their illegal act then it will be the GRAVE VIOLATION of the Law.AS BY LAWS NO COLONY CAN BE MADE OR PLOTS CAN BE SUB-DIVIDED WITHOUT THE PERMISSION OF APPROPRIATE AUTHORITY.Which is a grave violation of the statue and the rules and is also a great loss of state Ex-chequer. It is therefore requested that immediate action may kindly be taken against Balwinder Singh and others and their vendees to prevent them from violating the law of the land and loss to the state. Thanks. To, The chief Administrator office, Puda, Dear Sir, Complaint against Balwinder singh, Raghuishwar nath,Harjinder Singh, Surinder Singh sons of Daualt Singh s/o Ram Chand, resident of dulce ke road Kamboj Nagar, Ferozepur City 