m',9463117101,0,'432 KSB ROYAL HEIGHTS CHHAJU MAJRA ROAD','K Soni Builders and Promoters, KSB Royal Heights','CHHAJU MAJRA ROAD','Kharar , Sector 126 Greater Mohali, Punjab','Subject Non registration of project named as K Soni Builders and promoters with RERA.\r\nWe are resident of KSB Royal heights society behind KSB marigold homes chhaju majra coloney at khara 126 sector wants to inform you that the Ks Soni builder and promoter floated a scheme for the allotment/sale of flats 2 BHK, 3 BHK since last 10 years and were allured by the promises floated by the builders like huge parks, ample parking space, clubs, open area, lush greenery, wide roads, security arrangements, swimming pool, lifts and many more world class facilities.\r\nThat the residents has paid all the installments as per schedule fixed by the builder and are not at the default at all. The most of the residents are living in the society as builder gave the posession to the residents on diffrent dates, but builder has failed to deliver the basic amenities like installation of lifts with backup facility, proper internal roads, marked parking area, boundary walls and security. Security of all the residents are at high risk as there is no facility of security guards. Please help us on this issue. \r\nWe are attaching a scanned copy of the complaint with the signature of all the residents.','Complaint Document','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','601176','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5fc2a9ac-9fdf-4001-bd04-321f9fa42071\\','Doc20200706d26f2267-bfbb-4809-8ade-ab153dbceefa.pdf',0,0,'Complaint Document','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','601176','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\5fc2a9ac-9fdf-4001-bd04-321f9fa42071\\','Doc2020070669dd1a10-c3ff-4f6c-9098-ad38756ad1c5.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-07-06 16:38:58.000','','','','1092',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-07-06 16:38:58.000','MiscComplainant','2020-07-06 16:38:58.000'),(117,1093,2020,'MCNo10932020','FormTypeMISC','Karanbir singh','hundgen.k@gmail.com',9815998984,0,'flat no. 302, Tower-9, green Model Town Jalandhar','Palm Royal Estate',' Palm Royale Estate, Green Model Town,\r\nNr. GTB Nagar, Wadala Road, Jalandhar','Nr. GTB Nagar, Wadala Road, Jalandhar','The project which was started around 2010 and till date it was not completed so far. Builder has not obtained completion certificate from concern department so far. Already lodged  information regarding this by no MCNo10802020. but no reply from your side so far. i may please be intimated whether my request has been accepted or not  or if any  documents required in this concern i will try to provide you. thanks and regards , karanbir singh ','brochure issued by promoter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','847569','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f7ad6ddc-1ca7-4e99-b8d6-62b2cee32e54\\','Doc20200708890cfd9f-60e3-40fa-b7f5-a113132353d0.pdf',0,0,'promoters','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','221852','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f7ad6ddc-1ca7-4e99-b8d6-62b2cee32e54\\','Doc20200708ed0f1411-1af9-465c-ac98-3ab496b747a2.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-07-08 12:34:10.000','','','','1093',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-07-08 12:34:10.000','MiscComplainant','2020-07-08 12:34:10.000'),(118,1094,2020,'MCNo10942020','FormTypeMISC','Harpreet Singh Bhatia','hemenaggarwal@yahoo.com',7587101674,0,'Main Road, Chandeni Bhata, Dalli Rajhara, Durg, Chhattisgarh - 491228.','Director, Regent Land Holdings Pvt. Ltd.','Blessings City, Adjacent Hotel Radisson Blu, Airport Road, Amritsar, Punjab - 143001.','Airport Road, Amritsar','That the brief facts of the case are as under \r\n1. That the complainant is citizen of India and is residing at the address,  Main Road Chandeni Bhata, Dalli Rajhara, District Durg, Dalli Rajhara, Chhattisgarh, 491228. \r\n2. That the Complainant booked a 4 BHK Flat in the project named Blessings City, Amritsar, Punjab to be developed by Regent Land Holdings Pvt. Ltd., Adjacent Hotel Radisson Blu, Airport Road, Amritsar. Against the said booking complainant had paid the sum of Rs 2,40,000 as a booking amount on 05.09.2011.\r\n3. That on 28.06.2012 complainant was allotted Unit No. C7, 4 BHK, 300 Ebony, Blessings City, Airport Road, Amritsar having area of 1954 Sq. Ft. at the rate of Rs 2250 approximately per Sq. Ft. Thus, the total price of the flat was Rs.44,00,000.\r\n4. That total amount paid by complainant to the respondent company is Rs.15,87,586.\r\n5. That on 23.09.2011 respondent company i.e. Regent Land Holdings Pvt. Ltd. issued a letter for due installment and the said amount of Rs. 4,40,000 was paid by the complainant on dated 24.12.2011. No further letter was issued by the company.\r\n6. That the complainant paid the last amount on dated 16.11.2012 and after that company not issued any demand letter to the complainant and more than seven years have passed and nor any construction raised by the company nor they are returning the money paid by the complainant.\r\n7. That complainant anxiously booked the floor from his hard earned money but by seeing the attitude or dealing of respondent company, complainant is not at all willing to purchase the said floor. In fact it has now been more than 8 years since the booking of floor was made and now situation and circumstances have changed due to which complainant is not willing to proceed with the present agreement.  \r\n8. It is brought to the kind notice of this honourable forum that the complainant has never received letter containing offer of possession and the respondent company be put to strict proof of the same.\r\n9.It is further submitted that in view of Section 3 of RERA, 2016, it is mandatory for every builder and promoter to registered its project with the Authority. In the present case, Respondent failed to registered the present project with this honourable authority. Therefore, it attracts penalty as per Section 59 of the Act.','Allotment Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','740336','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\36acd3a8-7ac7-48e3-a900-a613b6bdf8dc\\','Doc20200806c0dcd4f3-1ac1-4c62-a533-401d54d24c9e.pdf',0,0,'Payment Receipts','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','838970','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\36acd3a8-7ac7-48e3-a900-a613b6bdf8dc\\','Doc2020080661173cae-b84a-4f87-b763-877732832063.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-08-06 12:00:53.000','','','','1094',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000','MiscComplainant','2020-08-06 12:00:53.000'),(119,1095,2020,'MCNo10952020','FormTypeMISC','Varun Goyal','adv.jindaldimple@gmail.com',9872578325,0,'S/o Sh. Krishan Kumar Goyal,  Kothi No. - 32, 16 Acre scheme Barnala','Improvement Trust Barnala','Maharaja Aggarsain Enclave, 18.3 Acre Scheme, MIG/ LIG flats','Near ITI Chowk, Barnala.','Facts of the case\r\n\r\na  That Improvement Trust Barnala hereinafter referred as respondent have start construction of LIG flats and MIG flats at Barnala under the scheme name Maharaja Aggarsain Enclave and the project is still under construction\r\n\r\nb  That the sewerage connections are still pending at the site and pipeline of sewerage connection is still under construction\r\n\r\nc  That as per Rera guidelines the said project is under construction and still not surveyed by any local authority and therefore no completion certificate is issued by the local authority to the respondent for the said project till now\r\n\r\nd  That respondent have lost a lot of cases in Distt Forum state forum and National forum for the charges of default in basic amenities promised to provide the consumers and all forums have given various judgments from the period of 2015 to 2020 to refund the consumer money along with interest to them. Different Forums have found the project under construction in these judgments and gave the said judgments after taking a lot of evidences in consideration These all evidences are on record and may be called for your further verification\r\n\r\ne   That there are still many consumers getting harassment from the negligent services by the respondent and waiting for relief from a long time\r\n\r\nf     That as per Rera guidelines every promoters was bound to register all under construction projects and to provide all the facilities to the consumers as per the act. Promoters are also bound to abide by the Rera Act failing which would attract the penalties under the same Act. As the project Maharaja Aggarsain Enclave is well covered under Rera Act, but the promoters are at fault since the promoters have failed to get themselves registered under the RERA Act, and have violated the statutory provision as provided under section 3 of the Act.      \r\n\r\ng    That the respondent is regularly disobeying the RERA Act since its enforcement as the respondent have not got itself registered under the RERA Act because the project was not complete on the day of enforcement of RERA Act. Because of non-registration under the Act, the consumers could not avail their rights as provided under the Act.  Hence the consumers are attended with negligent services by the trust, misbehaved by their officials and prevented from basic amenities upon which they have several constitutional and statutory rights.\r\n\r\nh    That the said project is still not complete, and the concerned authority may also inquiry the same.\r\n\r\ni      That a complaint in this regard was made to Punjab Govt. in 2018, in affirmative action of which, Govt. had suspended some officials in 2018, which supports to the allegations made in this complaint also.\r\n\r\nRelief and Interim Relief Claimed\r\n1. Relief Claimed\r\nA prayer is being made here to take action against the respondent in non-compliance of RERA Act, Rules and Regulations as stated in the above complaint under the provisions of RERA Act, as they have not registered themselves under the RERA Act and thereby they have violated statutory provisions of the Act which results in denial of rights to consumers which are provided under the RERA Act to them. So, in plain words they have omitted to perform their legal obligation as casted upon them by the statutory provisions of the RERA Act, for which appropriate penalty has to be imposed upon them in the interest of the justice and they are directed to get themselves registered under the RERA Act, so that legal rights of consumers as provided under the Act could be secured in future.\r\n\r\n2. Interim Relief Claimed\r\na.       May this authority give directions to register the respondent under RERA Act, 2016 immediately.\r\n\r\nb.      May this authority give interim orders/directions the respondent to fulfill their duties as cast upon them by the statutory provisions of the Act.\r\n\r\nc.       May this authority give directions to the respondent to get register their all other pending projects falling under their jurisdiction under the RERA Act, 2016 for the purpose of removing all ambiguities and to provide relief to the public in the greater interest of them.','Sewarage Disconnection reports','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','496719','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7f60d792-06fa-4345-83ec-1be38267e8fd\\','Doc2020080806a5950c-be0a-499b-96c1-bba7868ba8d0.pdf',0,0,'order of national commission dated 19.03.2019 against same developer and same project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','602877','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7f60d792-06fa-4345-83ec-1be38267e8fd\\','Doc202008088fc8e118-d3e9-430b-ac89-b351f7370eb0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-08-08 16:37:18.000','','','','1095',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000','MiscComplainant','2020-08-08 16:37:18.000'),(120,1096,2020,'MCNo10962020','FormTypeMISC','Krishna Rani','narenderkailash707@gmail.com',9417114432,0,'SCF 78, Givind Vihar, Baltana','Nature Heights Infra Ltd','9, Sundar Nagar, Abohar, Punjab','Abohar','Complainant has booked a Duplex for an amount of 25 Lac with the Nature Heights Infra Ltd. and paid an amount of Rs 17,25,000/-. The above said project has handed over the possession of the Duplex without finishing the work of Cupboard, Kitchen, Paint & POP, Door, Washroom and railing  to the complainant in March 2013 and asked to  complete the finishing of the duplex and the amount which will be  expended on finishing will be deducted from the total amount and  further he has promised that he will transfer the ownership of the Duplex on the name of the complainant as and when he paid the total amount. The complainant has given various reminder to the above said project but till date the above said project has not come back to get the registered deed or ownership on the name of the complainant. The complainant is now facing problem of electricity and water etc. due to act and conduct of the above said project.','Receipt','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','928300','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\bacc2692-1de3-4455-b2fd-2b96b6dbb640\\','Doc202008180a72cefe-1cbc-4f10-a94b-4d5542296e50.pdf',0,0,'Photo showing finishing and possession of Duplex with complainant','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','153879','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\bacc2692-1de3-4455-b2fd-2b96b6dbb640\\','Doc20200818dd8296c0-bb20-4415-a824-b7bb28a8d3f0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-08-18 12:43:06.000','','','','1096',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-08-18 12:43:06.000','MiscComplainant','2020-08-18 12:43:06.000'),(121,1097,2020,'MCNo10972020','FormTypeMISC','Manoj Narang','mr_narang43@yahoo.co.in',9855046462,0,'House No. 74, Friends Enclave, Abohar Road, Fazilka','Friend Enclave ','Friend Enclave, Abohar Road, Near Attam Vallabh School, Fazilka','Friend Enclave, Abohar Road, Near Attam Vallabh School, Fazilka','Mr. Ravi Kumar S/o Subash Chander O/o Shop No. 73, New Grain Market, Shri Muktsar Sahib, as Colonizer  he started a project to setup residential colony at Fazilka with the Name of FRIEND ENCLAVE PVT. LTD. Abohar Road, Fazilka. They are selling plot/residence/flat since from 2010 under the Friend Enclave without convert Agriculture land to Commercial Land. Friend Enclave does not meet the requirement of PUDA or any other Authority, As per rules the colonosier not left 35% land for park/roads. They occupied 80% land for plot/flat/residence house and selling to customer. Even after 10 year establishment of Project they did not provide basic facility like Canal water, Sewerage, Lighting and Park till date. Friend enclave have not pay their colony approval feeses to municipal council, fazilka. In result of till date they did not have permission to set up this project. Even though they are selling Plot/Residential House/Flat to customer and doing Registries / Jamabandi to buyers (This is also a matter of investigation, how tehsildar and other authorities approving  Registries/Jamabandi of  illegal project). Icing on the Cake is that Colonizer did not take any approval from RERA but continuously doing registry by hook or crook. That is not only defraud to RERA and Punjab/Central Government, even also a cheating to Excise/Finance Department. Dear Sir, My Humble Request is please look into this matter very seriously and take the necessary/legal action against faulty colonizer and justice to Resident. ','Map of Friend Enclave, Abohar Road, Fazilka','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','933280','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\56a5866a-d551-4044-ad4c-28c3f2057a5b\\','Doc202009106f92d1e0-6702-4958-9d95-d36384e390e3.pdf',0,0,'Registry Copy on 10-01-2017 without RERA Permission','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','718158','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\56a5866a-d551-4044-ad4c-28c3f2057a5b\\','Doc2020091037f930c2-ec88-4a55-ae31-f72e00b93906.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-09-10 18:23:01.000','','','','1097',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-09-10 18:23:01.000','MiscComplainant','2020-09-10 18:23:01.000'),(122,1098,2020,'MCNo10982020','FormTypeMISC','ASHWANI KUMAR VASHIST','BLACKWHITEASSOCIATE@GMAIL.COM',9417868341,8360909274,'413/3 SBP NORTH VALLEY, SANTE MAJRA, LANDRAN KHARAR ROAD, SECTOR 127 MOHALI','SBP NORTH VALLEY','SBP NORTH VALLEY, SANTEMAJRA, LANDRAN KHARAR ROAD, SECTOR 127 MOHALI','SANTE MAJRA, KHARAR SECTOR 127 MOHALI','Duly certified Completion Certificate, Occupancy Certificate of the project SBP North Valley  was demanded from the Singla Builders and Promoters but provided only partial completion certificate issued from the Office Municipal Council Kharar  which was subject to conditions, which are not fulfilled by the said builder. Our demand to complete the entire project as approved by the authorities is till date pending. Where as a case is also pending the same in the Kharar Courts. We hereby request to take action against such defaults made by the said Builder, i. e. Singla Builders and Promoters (P) Limited for the Project of SBP North Valley.','Partial Completion Certificate ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','904190','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e1d0b5da-366f-4117-b77a-a1ce2a638209\\','Doc20200914e73a9c28-4874-4b3f-bd0c-33e8bc115166.pdf',0,0,'SBP North Valley HALF YEARLY COMPLIANCE REPORT','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','534601','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e1d0b5da-366f-4117-b77a-a1ce2a638209\\','Doc2020091412c6a49a-0a54-4835-afb1-56524e6ca9b2.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-09-14 15:56:53.000','','','','1098',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-09-14 15:56:53.000','MiscComplainant','2020-09-14 15:56:53.000'),(123,1099,2020,'MCNo10992020','FormTypeMISC','Sanat Kumar Padhi','sanatpadhi1971@gmail.com',8837858502,0,'House No.73, GBP Astra, Opposite National Dental College, Gulabgarh Mahiwala Road, Derabassi, Mohali (Punjab), Pin-140507','GBP Astra','Gulabgarh Mahiwala Road, Derabassi ','Dera Bassi, Dist- Mohali, Punjab','Services committed at the time of purchase of plots by builder (Gupta Builders and Promoters pvt. ltd.) like swimming pool, parks, club house, safe boundary wall , sufficient water supply, Sewage , rainwater drainage , street lights etc has not been completed yet after 4 years of possession  of plots. We are facing big problems due to lack of services and builder not responding after 4-times written complaints and reminder letters.\r\nPlease do the needful to resolve the issue.  We will be highly grateful for your kind consideration in the above regard..\r\n','BROCHURE OF BUILDER','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','384114','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\42a2d083-936f-4eba-9e6a-d3a065ad4656\\','Doc202009271b6c50d5-90d1-40d9-b27c-5cf342dcbe54.pdf',0,0,'Brochure & Written complaints and reminder letter to Builder.','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','384114','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\42a2d083-936f-4eba-9e6a-d3a065ad4656\\','Doc2020092740f2a5aa-fd44-44c2-8a60-d55eff363f3e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-09-27 19:42:04.000','','','','1099',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-09-27 19:42:04.000','MiscComplainant','2020-09-27 19:42:04.000'),(124,1100,2020,'MCNo11002020','FormTypeMISC','Ravinder Pal Singh','ravichawla.universal@gmail.com',9216750005,0,'Satnam Niwas, Issapur, Dera Bassi, Distt. SAS Nagar, Punjab - 140507','3 Projects - Issapur Colony, Basant Vihar and An Un-named Colony','Issapur, Ward 16 & 17, Dera Bassi, Distt. SAS Nagar, Punjab - 140507','Issapur, Ward 16 & 17, Dera Bassi, Distt. SAS Nagar, Punjab - 140507','This is to bring to your attention that a number of unapproved / unauthorized colonies have been developed in the past couple of years and some are currently under development in full swing, in Ward 16 and 17 of Dera Bassi, Distt. S.A.S. Nagar, Punjab, making a complete mockery of all the rules and regulations set by RERA and Department of Housing and Urban Development (DHUD).\r\n\r\nThese colonies do not fulfil any criteria required for such a project as per the requirements set by RERA in terms of (including but not limited to) Roads, Water Supply and Harvesting, Parks, Sewage Treatment Plant etc. Despite all these glaring omission, many plots have been developed and many are under development as the layouts / maps such development are being blindly approved by M.C officials due to their collaboration with these developers for their mutual benefit. In fact, these colonies have been given illegal Water and Sewage connections from Municipal Council Dera Bassi Lines.\r\n\r\nMoreover, Instead of registering the project as a whole with the concerned authorities by completing all the permissions, formalities, paperwork with RERA and paying the applicable tax and fees, the land mafia of these developers of unapproved / unauthorized colonies, which are developed on agricultural land, is selling the individual plots by registering the land from previous owner of the agricultural land, without any registry of the land in the name of developers themselves, in order to evade taxes, thereby, causing huge loss to Government Tax Revenue.\r\n\r\nThese developers include few ex-municipal councillors of Dera Bassi and the main Planner and Dealer of these colonies is ex-Sarpanch (Issapur) Basant Singh (Azad Property Consultant, Issapur Colony, Issapur, Dera Bassi), who along with his close associate Davinder Singh a.k.a. Binder (ex-municipal councillor, Ward 17), undertake the development of these illegal colonies.\r\n\r\nList of the colonies is as follows.\r\n\r\n1.	Issapur Colony (Ward 17, Dera Bassi)\r\n\r\nOpposite the house of Charanjit Bahia, Issapur, Dera Bassi. The office of the dealer of these colonies is located here.\r\n\r\n2.	Basant Vihar (Ward 16, Dera Bassi)\r\n\r\nDeveloped adjoining my house in Ward 16, Issapur, Dera Bassi. Near Issapur Colony, on the other side of the road. \r\n\r\nComplaints regarding this have already been made to local authorities but due to the involvement of municipal councillors and the corrupt staff at MC Dera Bassi, no action has been taken. Instead, government funds are being misused for the personal benefit of the developers of these unapproved / unauthorized colonies.\r\n\r\n(Note- Colony Name not mentioned at the actual location. The name of the colony was told by E.O., Muncipal Council, Dera Bassi but due to the complaints, the name might have been changed)\r\n\r\n3.	New Un-named Colony under development (Ward 16, Dera Bassi)\r\n\r\nApart from the above two, the development work for another colony is in full swing since the COVID lockdown period. Opposite Gurudwara Sahib (BIG), Corner of Issapur Phirni. This development for this happened after our complaint to the local authorities regarding the previous colony and that too at full pace in the lockdown period. Instead of taking action, the MC Dera Bassi has turned a blind eye towards this, confirming their partnership with these developers.\r\n\r\nAdditionally, the Town Planning department has projected an 80 feet road in the master plan of Dera Bassi on the location where the colony Basant Vihar is located. A copy of the master plan is attached for your reference.\r\n\r\nYou are, therefore, requested to kindly look into this matter with utmost attention at your earliest and initiate a thorough inspection of these colonies and the plots developed in these colonies.\r\n\r\nRavinder Pal Singh (Senior Citizen)\r\nSatnam Niwas, Issapur, Dera Bassi\r\n+91-9216750005','Master Plan Copy','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','733297','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6f890931-cfde-49dd-b232-63897cedae7a\\','Doc20201026c096138e-66c4-49ec-9fc1-133aabd98090.pdf',0,0,'Master Plan Copy','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','733297','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6f890931-cfde-49dd-b232-63897cedae7a\\','Doc20201026e906f57d-3c62-412f-9614-47bd82b47e86.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-10-26 18:58:35.000','','','','1100',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-10-26 18:58:35.000','MiscComplainant','2020-10-26 18:58:35.000'),(125,1101,2020,'MCNo11012020','FormTypeMISC','Som Parkash','parkashsom777@gmail.com',9417591407,0,'Peer Khane Wali Gali, Near Baba Chajju Ram Ashram Gidderbaha, Teh. Gidderbaha Distt. Sri Muktsar Sahib -Punjab (152101)','DD Chandigarh Enclave \'DD Enclave\'','Near Mata Sahib Kaur Nursing Institute, Village Husner, Tehsil-Gidderbaha, Distt. Sri Muktsar Sahib-Punjab (152101)','Village Husner, Tehsil-Gidderbaha, Distt. Sri Muktsar Sahib-Punjab (152101)','That Jatinder Kumar S/o Yashpal R/o Roop Nagar, opp. Cinema wali gali, Gidderbaha Distt. Sri Muktsar Sahib is trying to develop a residential colony by adopting the illegal methods at Village Husner, Tehsil-Gidderbaha, Distt. Sri Muktsar Sahib in the name of DD Chandigarh Enclave DD Enclave.\r\n	\r\nThat Promoter has also put hoardings near the colony to attract the investors and the genuine buyers without registering the Project with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority Punjab.\r\n\r\nThat it is pertinent to mention here that Promoter has taken Regularization Certificate from the competent authority and has flouted all the applicable norms and procedures while obtaining it.\r\n\r\nThat Promoter by not registering with the authority is selling the plots and might also lure other genuine buyers with their false assurances which would deprive them of the basic amenities.\r\n\r\nThat if timely action is not taken against the Promoter it would cause irreparable loss to many of the genuine buyers and the very much object of the Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016 would not be achieved.\r\n\r\nTherefore it is requested before the Real Estate Regulatory Authority to issue appropriate directions against the Promoter. Further, for more corroborative evidences and information Municipal Council Gidderbaha may also be contacted though I am attaching herewith sufficient evidences with this complaint to proceed further.\r\n','Compounding Certificate','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','689933','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1a335da4-a55b-44d1-9267-a85223e074fb\\','Doc20201218754f8050-76a3-430a-a1df-61095751e2fd.pdf',0,0,'NOC alongwith Sale Deed','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','680846','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\1a335da4-a55b-44d1-9267-a85223e074fb\\','Doc20201218b536e493-f50c-4d88-b837-ad4806bcd2d0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2020-12-18 11:24:18.000','','','','1101',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000','MiscComplainant','2020-12-18 11:24:18.000'),(126,1501,2021,'MCNo00012021','FormTypeMISC','Multitech Residents Welfare Association','multitech.members@gmail.com',8146466722,0,'Appt-164, Tower-G, Multitech Towers, Sector-91 S.A.S  Nagar, Mohali-140308','Multitech Towers, Multitech Tower Pvt Ltd, Manohar Singh and Company, SCO-139-141, Sector-17C Chandigarh','Multitech Towers Sector-91 Mohali','S A S Nagar, Mohali, 140308','1.	Representation for taking Multitech Towers Complex Project (Behind Manav Mangal Smart School) Sector-91, Mohali, S.A.S Nagar, Punjab-140308 under the Domain of RERA Act -2016.  \r\n2.	Taking Administrative and Criminal Action against the Builder for wilful Defaults with Mala fide intention, Deceptive & Unfair Practice under various Sections of IPC.\r\n3.	 Penal Actions against builder for violation of Punjab Apartment & Property Regulation Act 1995,  Punjab Urban Planning & Development Rules 2018 and other Relevant Rules, Regulations including Notifications  of Department of Housing & Urban Development Punjab, No. 4966 CTP (Pb.) / SP -458 dated 02.09.2014 to keep an uncompleted Real Estate project out of the Domain of RERA.  \r\n','Complaint Against Builder','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','946928','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9f0f1209-ef2c-43a9-8b2c-4f786a3b636c\\','Doc20210208bc3c4d7b-df12-45ae-bff5-d023cc095807.pdf',0,0,'Complaint Against Builder','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','946928','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9f0f1209-ef2c-43a9-8b2c-4f786a3b636c\\','Doc202102080ae9898c-de39-4469-a572-42b3ddc6b222.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-02-08 14:35:52.000','','','','1',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-02-08 14:35:52.000','MiscComplainant','2021-02-08 14:35:52.000'),(127,1502,2021,'MCNo00022021','FormTypeMISC','Ruchit Garg','ruchitgarg@gmail.com',7009428167,0,'Homeland heights\r\nFlat No 121\r\nTower 5, Mohali 160071','Homeland Heights ','Site No 5, Sector 70','Mohali','BEFORE THE REAL ESTATE REGULATORY AUTHORITY, PUNJAB\r\nComplaint against the promoters of Home Land Build well Pvt Ltd Site No 5 Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali for non-registration of the project and for violating and non-compliance the various provisions of the Punjab Apartments Act read With The Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016 .\r\nRespectfully Showeth \r\n1.	The present complaint is being filed and preferred by the residents of Homeland Heights, Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali against the Promoters of Home Land Buildwell Pvt. Ltd. who have developed and sold the above-mentioned project at Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali.\r\n2.	That promoters have failed to comply with the provisions as laid down under section 3 of the RERA Act,2016 and have not got the project registered with authority. As the completion certificate has not been issued till date hence the promoters were bound to get the project registered with the authority as laid down under the above mentioned provision. \r\n\r\nThe builder has an Occupation Certificate as of 24-04-2017 just 3 days before RERA ACT came into effect. Where as project is still incomplete and expansion of project applications with Pollution department and GAMADA have been filed in 2018 without any required consent of residents under RERA, PAPRA ACT and Punjab Apartment Ownership ACT 1995.  ANNEXURE -1\r\n\r\nAs per RERA ACT, Section 3 -1  Provided further that if the Authority thinks necessary, in the interest of allottees, for projects which are developed beyond the planning area but with the requisite permission of the local authority, it may, by order, direct the promoter of such project to register with the Authority, and the provisions of this Act or the rules and regulations made thereunder, shall apply to such projects from that stage of registration.\r\n\r\n2 Notwithstanding anything contained in sub-section 1, no registration of the real\r\nestate project shall be required\r\na. where the area of land proposed to be developed does not exceed five hundred square meters or the number of apartments proposed to be developed does not exceed eight inclusive of all phases\r\nUnder Section 3 -1 -2both the promoters have failed to register the project under the RERA ACT 2016. The letter from GAMADA dated  11-01-2021 confirm that Under 2018 compounding policy the number of flats have been increased from 276 to 303 and commercial area has been allowed outside complex under 2018 policy. ANNEXURE 2\r\nThe approval of expansion is for  more than 8 apartments and builder is required to register under Section 3 -1 of RERA ACT. The letter of approval from GAMA dated 1-11-2018 increasing flats from 276 to 303  is attached Annexure 3. No consent of residents was taken in this regard as per RERA ACT.\r\nSimilarly the Builder has increased the number of commercial shops from 4 to 18 vide approval dated 30-11-2018 claimed in filings with Pollution Control Board. Annexure 4 and Annexure 5 This is also more than 500 Sq meter and approved by local body in November 2018 required builder to register the project with RERA. The submission of Builder with Environment authorities on 07-09-2017 and 22-09-2020 clearly established that Homeland Heights project is perfect case of project to be registered under RERA. This also proves that project is not approved by Environmental Authorities for expansion.\r\nFurther more builder the promoters have encroached upon club house and Banquet Hall converted to n house restaurant . The green areas in area under Tower I, II,  III, in front of Tower IV, play area near tower IV and green area near the transformers has been converted into car parking. This again has been done without taking into confidence the unit owners/ residents and without the approval of the unit owners. The Brochure promised 70 percent green are and we have now only 15 percent green area left. \r\nIFMS amount of residents has not been transferred to RWA.\r\nThe RWA has no single document of transfer like plans, revised plans, Parking plans and other project related documents. \r\nThe project is still incomplete and detailed request from RWA from time to time is attached. \r\n\r\nThat the promoter has failed to comply with the provisions of the RERA Act as laid under section 3- 1,2 11 -4b g, Section 12 and section 14, hence have made themselves liable for appropriate action as postulated under the act.  \r\n\r\nWe request the Authority to take notice and register the project under RERA on urgent basis.\r\n','Letters from GAMADA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','585918','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\40a7e6a6-faae-412d-b20c-c450a97ac229\\','Doc202104034aa8be8a-8887-436d-ba6c-0f455f862c56.pdf',0,0,'Builder Applications to Pollution Control Board for expansion -2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','456318','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\40a7e6a6-faae-412d-b20c-c450a97ac229\\','Doc20210403d148de17-c736-4d37-a82f-cde10c467083.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-04-03 18:21:40.000','','','','2',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:21:40.000','MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:21:40.000'),(128,1503,2021,'MCNo00032021','FormTypeMISC','Arvinder Singh Lamba ','amandeep.diplast@gmail.com',8872228880,0,'Homeland Heights, Flat 161, Tower 2, Sector 70, Mohali 160071','Homeland Heights ','Site No 5, Sector 70, ','Mohali','BEFORE THE REAL ESTATE REGULATORY AUTHORITY, PUNJAB\r\nComplaint against the promoters of Home Land Build well Pvt Ltd Site No 5 Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali for non-registration of the project and for violating and non-compliance the various provisions of the Punjab Apartments Act read With The Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016 .\r\nRespectfully Showeth \r\n1.	The present complaint is being filed and preferred by the residents of Homeland Heights, Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali against the Promoters of Home Land Buildw