DA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','585918','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\069dacb8-ac48-420c-af38-f268cb78b207\\','Doc20210403d64a0259-4ab1-4ef2-97f9-d3b7dbbba067.pdf',0,0,'Builder Applications to Pollution Control Board for expansion -2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','456318','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\069dacb8-ac48-420c-af38-f268cb78b207\\','Doc20210403e48f19fe-ec22-4de2-9918-7f974f784ba1.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-04-03 18:30:35.000','','','','3',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:30:35.000','MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:30:35.000'),(129,1504,2021,'MCNo00042021','FormTypeMISC','Yashpal Ahuja','kashishahuja33@yahoo.in',9915048150,0,'Homeland Heights, Flat No 11, Tower 4, Mohali 160071','Homeland Heights ','Site No 5, Sector 70','Mohali','BEFORE THE REAL ESTATE REGULATORY AUTHORITY, PUNJAB\r\nComplaint against the promoters of Home Land Build well Pvt Ltd Site No 5 Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali for non-registration of the project and for violating and non-compliance the various provisions of the Punjab Apartments Act read With The Real Estate Regulation and Development Act 2016 .\r\nRespectfully Showeth \r\n1.	The present complaint is being filed and preferred by the residents of Homeland Heights, Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali against the Promoters of Home Land Buildwell Pvt. Ltd. who have developed and sold the above-mentioned project at Sector 70, S A S Nagar Mohali.\r\n2.	That promoters have failed to comply with the provisions as laid down under section 3 of the RERA Act,2016 and have not got the project registered with authority. As the completion certificate has not been issued till date hence the promoters were bound to get the project registered with the authority as laid down under the above mentioned provision. \r\n\r\nThe builder has an Occupation Certificate as of 24-04-2017 just 3 days before RERA ACT came into effect. Where as project is still incomplete and expansion of project applications with Pollution