ing contained in sub-section 1, no registration of the real\r\nestate project shall be required\r\na. where the area of land proposed to be developed does not exceed five hundred square meters or the number of apartments proposed to be developed does not exceed eight inclusive of all phases\r\nUnder Section 3 -1 -2both the promoters have failed to register the project under the RERA ACT 2016. The letter from GAMADA dated  11-01-2021 confirm that Under 2018 compounding policy the number of flats have been increased from 276 to 303 and commercial area has been allowed outside complex under 2018 policy. ANNEXURE 2\r\nThe approval of expansion is for  more than 8 apartments and builder is required to register under Section 3 -1 of RERA ACT. The letter of approval from GAMA dated 1-11-2018 increasing flats from 276 to 303  is attached Annexure 3. No consent of residents was taken in this regard as per RERA ACT.\r\nSimilarly the Builder has increased the number of commercial shops from 4 to 18 vide approval dated 30-11-2018 claimed in filings with Pollution Control Board. Annexure 4 and Annexure 5 This is also more than 500 Sq meter and approved by local body in November 2018 required builder to register the project with RERA. The submission of Builder with Environment authorities on 07-09-2017 and 22-09-2020 clearly established that Homeland Heights project is perfect case of project to be registered under RERA. This also proves that project is not approved by Environmental Authorities for expansion.\r\nFurther more builder the promoters have encroached upon club house and Banquet Hall converted to n house restaurant . The green areas in area under Tower I, II,  III, in front of Tower IV, play area near tower IV and green area near the transformers has been converted into car parking. This again has been done without taking into confidence the unit owners/ residents and without the approval of the unit owners. The Brochure promised 70 percent green are and we have now only 15 percent green area left. \r\nIFMS amount of residents has not been transferred to RWA.\r\nThe RWA has no single document of transfer like plans, revised plans, Parking plans and other project related documents. \r\nThe project is still incomplete and detailed request from RWA from time to time is attached. \r\n\r\nThat the promoter has failed to comply with the provisions of the RERA Act as laid under section 3- 1,2 11 -4b g, Section 12 and section 14, hence have made themselves liable for appropriate action as postulated under the act.  \r\n\r\nWe request the Authority to take notice and register the project under RERA on urgent basis.\r\n','Letters from GAMADA','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','585918','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\75f98820-7b30-44ac-8995-717a6e853fba\\','Doc202104037ebaac95-b7b2-48ed-8f4b-dd49745cb50c.pdf',0,0,'Builder Applications to Pollution Control Board for expansion -2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','456318','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\75f98820-7b30-44ac-8995-717a6e853fba\\','Doc202104033d1f7564-9bad-41dc-8a5e-f82a21fe803e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-04-03 18:38:14.000','','','','5',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:38:14.000','MiscComplainant','2021-04-03 18:38:14.000'),(131,1506,2021,'MCNo00062021','FormTypeMISC','NARENDER KUMAR','narendershrm57@gmail.com',9017144927,0,'#3101 lig flat sec 70 mohali  Punjab ','DARA KINGDOM ','VILLAGE KHOONI MAJRA KHARAR','SEC 115 ','Hi Respected Sir/Madam,\r\n\r\n I had paid amount Rs.57500/- to Dara Group  for 1BHK at given Project address. but still not any update by Dara Group. Please help on it. ','Agreement ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','324554','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7683a739-63c7-4f18-8789-90115ada6ce8\\','Doc20210503f1ff2c27-ceb7-4147-88b1-32602c8b2665.pdf',0,0,'BOOKING CERTIFICATE ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','69925','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7683a739-63c7-4f18-8789-90115ada6ce8\\','Doc20210503ae98903f-84ec-42f5-bfa5-934f37f0b6fd.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-05-03 14:08:30.000','','','','6',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-05-03 14:08:30.000','MiscComplainant','2021-05-03 14:08:30.000'),(132,1507,2021,'MCNo00072021','FormTypeMISC','Mayank Jain','mayank.jain288@gmail.com',9988688688,0,'Paras Panorama\r\n7004, 7th Floor, Tower B2 ','Prince Developer Homes','plot no. 2119, near arista resort, sector 123 Kharar','Kharar','I have booked a flat in Prince homes which is is Chirag Homes. Initially I paid 50K as a token money and later I came to know that the project is not registered with RERA. I asked the builder to initiate a refund as the project is not approved by RERA. The promoter for this project is Primary Estates (PBRERA-SAS80-REA0374). Please help me in getting my hard earned money back.','Booking Form','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','256333','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\53a6b3b4-336c-4747-9cb5-d3d29dd99f2a\\','Doc20210602829f2904-32d3-41c9-904c-91fe175a9f88.pdf',0,0,'Brochure','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','406870','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\53a6b3b4-336c-4747-9cb5-d3d29dd99f2a\\','Doc20210602f0ca8b32-5a92-40dd-986e-e98816df6eb9.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-06-02 18:49:08.000','','','','7',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-06-02 18:49:08.000','MiscComplainant','2021-06-02 18:49:08.000'),(133,1508,2021,'MCNo00082021','FormTypeMISC','JIT PAL SINGH','jitpal63@yahoo.com',9855102406,0,'House No -1456 , Sector -60 , Mohali','TDI GOLF LINK , Sector 118 , Mohali.  Developed by TDI INFRATECH LIMITED','TDI GOLF LINK , Sector 118 , Mohali.','TDI GOLF LINK , Sector 118 , Mohali.','The TDI Infratech Ltd.is coming up with a new plotted project GOLF LINK in Sector 118 Mohali on a land of approx. 20 Acres and in this regard, they have filed an application for registration of this project with the office of RERA Punjab. Currently this project continues to be not registered with the RERA Punjab as per serial number 41of the list of pending applications for project registration.This information has been taken from the list of pending projects uploaded on the RERA Punjab website on 4th June 2021. \r\nThis project of Golf Link requires certain approvals from the GMADA and also requires registration of the same with RERA Punjab before the developer commences booking or sale of the plots.  However,the TDI Infratech booked certain plots for sale without getting the said project first registered with RERA Punjab in contravention of the provisions of Rule 3 of RERA Act 2016.  My complaint against the TDI Infratech is based on the following facts which are duly supported with the documentary evidences\r\n1.	The TDI Infratech filed an affidavit dated 08.03.2021 before the Supreme Court of India in response to my SLP C No 244 of 2021 Jit Pal Singh Versus TDI Infratech Pvt. Ltd.  In Para No. 16 of this affidavit the developer company has admitted that Plot Nos. GL 183 GL 184 and GL 188 have been earmarked in favor of third parties.A copy of affidavit dated 8th Mar 21 is attached as annexure C 1. Thus, this action of TDI Infratech is in gross violation of the provisions of Section 3 of RERA Act which provided that the developer cannot book or sell plots without the registration of the project by RERA Punjab.  The Para No 16 is reproduced below \r\n\r\nPara 16\r\n\r\nI say that as stated by the Petitioner that Plot No.183, 184 and 188 in the Golf Links Project, Sector 118 Mohali as sought for by the Petitioner in the Interim Prayer have also been earmarked for other buyers as per prior commitments and the same are not available with the Respondent any longer\r\n\r\n2.	I deputed my son Rajan Paul to the office of the TDI Infratech posing as a prospective buyer of a plot in Golf Link project in order to extract information regarding availability of the plots.  My son was informed by Mr. Bodh Raj Thakur AGM Sales & Marketing  that the plot Nos 183 184 and 188 of 250 Sq. yards are available by highlighting these plots in red. The company official confirmed that the plots which are not highlighted in red have already been booked for sale.Therefore,the action of the TDI Infratech by booking plots without registration of the Golf Link project is again an act in violation of the aforementioned provisions of RERA Act 2019. The concerned documents are attached herewith as annexure C2\r\n\r\n3.	The TDI Infratech has uploaded an advertisement in its website for booking of plots in Golf Link project, Sector 118, Mohali ingross violation of the said provisions of RERA Act. A copy of this advertisement is attached herewith as a proof Annexure C 3.\r\n\r\n4.	The agents of TDI Infratech are sending SMS and WhatsApp messages for booking of gated plots of various sizes near Airport Road.  The Golf Link project is the only gated project near the Airport Road.  A copy of this advertisement SMS WhatsApp message is attached herewith as a proof Annexure C4.\r\n\r\n\r\nIt is therefore requested that a detailed enquiry may kindly be conducted to find out the facts regarding unauthorized and illegal booking of plots in Golf Link Sector 118 Mohali without registration of project. The TDI Infratech may also be directed to cancel all the illegal booking of plots made so far without registration of the project and to make refund of the amounts so collected from the concerned persons besides imposing penalty equal to 10 percent of the total cost of the project as provided under section 59 of the RERA Act 2016 \r\n','Affidavit filed by TDI Infatech Ltd before Supreme Court of India','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','499349','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\353cce75-3be0-4117-af3a-2cc5c2a1a746\\','Doc202106082c27aab5-7e8e-4680-8fd2-53961a4d7b96.pdf',0,0,'Annexure C 2 , C 3 & C4','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','689818','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\353cce75-3be0-4117-af3a-2cc5c2a1a746\\','Doc20210608f26c91c4-e88a-4d5b-92fb-8eff2d737eda.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-06-08 13:21:07.000','','','','8',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-06-08 13:21:07.000','MiscComplainant','2021-06-08 13:21:07.000'),(134,1509,2021,'MCNo00092021','FormTypeMISC','Satish Mehta','satishmehta.kd@gmail.com',9814024118,0,'Homeland Heights \r\nFlat No 141, Tower 3\r\nSector 70, Mohali ','Homeland Heights by Homeland Buildwell Pvt. Ltd','Site No 5, \r\nOpposite Sohana Gurudwara','Sector 70, Mohali ','The project  has no completion certificate as of date and no Environment clearance for changes made to the project after RERA came into effect on 1-06-2017. The builder has  increased the area of development from increasing covered area from 50,837.34 to 77,758.53 Sq. mt. on 07-09-2017, again to 85111.50 Sq mt in 22-09-2020 in its application to Environment Ministry. Flats have been increased from 276 to 303 and shops from 4 to 18 after RERA came into effect. The permission to built Shopping center of 18 shops in place of 4 convenience was obtained from GAMADA on 30-11-2018 as per Maps submitted by the builder with Environment Ministry. The increase in number of Flats permission was obtained from GAMADA on 1/11/2018 . This was done under new GAMADA compounding Policy 2018 well after RERA came into effect. The Shopping center is built on the encroached common area out of the boundaries of Society without consent of residents. The area for shops has been increased from 162 Sq Mt to 839.16 Sq meter. All this has been done without any consent from the residents living in the society as per RERA, PAPRA and The Punjab Apartment Ownership Act 1995 .\r\n\r\nThe project needs to be registered under Sec 3 of the RERA ACT . We submit that this project is perfect case to be registered with RERA we shall also give evidence to show that why this project is  Ongoing project even as of date. \r\n\r\nGAMADA has approved the change in plans on 1/11/2018 increasing Flat from 274 to 303 without taking any consent of the resident. All these flats were sold after RERA ACT came into existence on 01-06-2017.  So approval  for 29 flats was taken on 1/11/2018 and sold against the provisions of RERA ACT. \r\nAlso during same time builder again without any consent from the residents against provisions of RERA, PAPRA ACT and Punjab Apartment ACT in connivance with GAMADA officials took  approval for 18 shops in place of 4 convenience shops on the common area of the society on 30-11-2018. Builder has since built  19th shop further reducing  the Green Area illegally without any consent. All these shops were built In 2019 and still being sold without any registration with RERA.\r\nI would request the RERA Authorities to take Suo moto notice and register the project asap. I also understand that many residents have filed cases or filed complaints with RERA on the matter.\r\n','Gamada approvals for extension of projects for flats and shops','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','311041','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\412c8b85-3af8-42be-bf0f-489e447bd204\\','Doc20210619796a54c9-107a-489a-9275-10b6cc81b0b4.pdf',0,0,'RWA mails to builder for Non Completion of project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','123826','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\412c8b85-3af8-42be-bf0f-489e447bd204\\','Doc20210619904aae4c-efdd-411d-af1c-4bd1818fc8f1.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-06-19 16:45:55.000','','','','9',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-06-19 16:45:55.000','MiscComplainant','2021-06-19 16:45:55.000'),(135,1510,2021,'MCNo00102021','FormTypeMISC','Rakesh Sharma','rakesh342@gmail.com',9817754338,0,'Durgi Ludhiana','PALM GARDEN','National Highway 1, sahnewal, adjoining red, mango, Ludhiana, Punjab 141120','National Highway 1, sahnewal, adjoining red, mango, Ludhiana, Punjab 141120','project not registered','Palm Garden Project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','331371','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9a5bb6fd-47cd-4da7-9daa-e7556941a7c7\\','Doc2021062800c51317-f3bc-4ca8-bc4d-1c746995bbf0.pdf',0,0,'Palm Garden Project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','331371','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9a5bb6fd-47cd-4da7-9daa-e7556941a7c7\\','Doc20210628e55f5d75-fffe-4ccf-a84c-cf6c1a4d38e2.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-06-28 05:38:16.000','','','','10',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000','MiscComplainant','2021-06-28 05:38:16.000'),(136,1511,2021,'MCNo00112021','FormTypeMISC','Karan Luthra','karanraja0505@gmail.com',9300032600,0,'D 30 Silver heights near wadala chowk Jalandhar 144001','No name','in Village Kot Kalan Google Coordinates- 31.2752779,75.6651985 and another erecting on Jamsher dhina road behind Indian oil petrol Pump Google Location-31.2546967,75.6124384','Tehsil Jalandhar',' Complaint against illicit colonies Erecting in Village Kot Kalan Google Coordinates 31 2752779 75 6651985 and another erecting on Jamsher dhina road behind Indian oil petrol Pump Google Location 31 2546967 75 6124384 in Jalandhar Development Authority jurisdiction \r\nRespected sir \r\n\r\nThrough this Letter your kind Attention is being brought towards an Unapproved illegal colony being cropped by some wrongdoers and also a huge loss has occurred to the public exchequer due to such illicit Acts done by the wrongdoers \r\n\r\nThat the developer has violated the PAPR Act 1995 and has divided the land into plots and are setting up a colony over an area of land which is more than one thousand sq meter without obtaining a license from the competent authority and has violated section 3 5 8 9 14 15 18  21 of the Act ibid also fraud has been done to the general public by selling them plots in the illegal colony and the promoter of the colony has also violated Central Govtb guidelines by violating section 3 of RERA Act That this undeveloped and illicit colony will cause a huge loss to the public exchequer as no development charges have been paid by the developer to the competent authority hence no internal  external development will properly be carried out in this colony therefore the buyer gullible people  buying a plot in the illicit colony will suffer\r\n\r\n That it is the responsibility of the concerned department to save the general public and gullible people from such types of scammers and The Government has enacted Punjab Apartment and Property Regulation Act 1995 which was amended in the year 2014 Section 36  1which deals with the offenses by promoters or estate agent provides that any person or promoter or his agent registered under this act without reasonable cause fails to comply with or contravenes the provisions of sections 3 5 6 9 or 15 shall on convention be punished with imprisonment for a minimum term of three years which may be extended to seven years and with a minimum fine of rupees two lac which may extend to rupees five lac and concerned Registrar should have been told to stop the sale, purchase of the plots in the Unauthorized colony under section 20(3) of PAPR Act, 2014 (amendment) but no such action has been taken against the wrongdoers by the concerned officers. which points towards the conspiracy of corruption therefore it is requested to look into the matter and take appropriate action against the wrongdoers and also demand an answer from the appointed officers for such negligence. \r\n\r\nThat Government has empowered Competent Authorities to remove/demolish the construction of unauthorized buildings and colonies. In view of the aforesaid fact, you are hereby requested to direct the officers to demolish the above-said colony and also place a notice board to aware the general public not to buy any plot in such illicit colony.','Photo of colony ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','331879','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c1a32d01-3f04-4eb1-882e-783552fadf17\\','Doc202107010ad2dd03-aca4-4fb7-940c-9cb8b9bd83e0.pdf',0,0,'Photo of colony ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','620350','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c1a32d01-3f04-4eb1-882e-783552fadf17\\','Doc202107018fe5048d-a456-4d53-8e2a-6119a6b60f5f.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-07-01 11:40:58.000','','','','11',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000','MiscComplainant','2021-07-01 11:40:58.000'),(137,1512,2021,'MCNo00122021','FormTypeMISC','Abhishek Malhotra','abhishekmalhotra5050@gmail.com',9876588844,0,'SBP Homes 3, Flat no 177/2, Sector 126, Tehsil Kharar, District Mohali, Punjab - 140301','SBP Homes 3','SBP Homes 3, Sector 126, Tehsil Kharar, District Mohali, Punjab - 140301','Village Chajjumajra, Tehsil Kharar, Near Mansa Devi Mandir','That the complainant Abhishek Malhotra (Law Student), S/o Ashok Malhotra, R/o SBP Homes 3, Flat no 177/2, Sector 126, Kharar, mohali, Punjab - 140301 do hereby states as follows- \r\n\r\n1. That u/s 3 of the RERA Act 2016, i.e. Prior Registration of Real Estate Project, If the Authority thinks necessary, in the interest of allottee, for the projects which are developed beyond the planning area but with requisite permission of the local authority, it may, by order, direct the promoter of the project to register with the authority, and the provisions of the Act or Rules, and Regulations made thereunder, shall apply to the projects from that stage of registration.\r\na. It is relevant to note that in the Project of SBP Homes 3, situated at Village- Chajju Majra, Teh- Kharar, DIst- SAS Nagar Moahli, the construction of the road is not shown in the map which is issued by Competent Authority. The same is annexed herewith and marked as Enclosure A1.\r\nb. It is relevant to note that their is illegal Construction of RWA Office in the Common Area as well which is also enclosed as Enclosure A2.\r\nc. It is relevant to note that only Partial Completion Certificate has been taken by the Competent Authority on 19.12.2016, that is after the commencement of the RERA Act 2016 i.e. 01.05.2016. The copy of the same is annexed herewith and marked as Enclosure A-3.\r\n\r\n2. That u/s 14 of the RERA Act 2016, i.e. Adherence to the Sanctioned Plans, it is stated that the proposed project shall be developed and completed by the promoter in accordance with the sanctioned plans, layout plans and specifications as approved by the competent authorities.\r\na. Moreover u/s 14(2)(ii), the promoter shall not make any additions/deletions in the sanctioned plan cannot be made without the previous consent of allottees.\r\nb. And u/s 14(3)(iii), the promoter shall not make any other alterations or additions in the sanctioned plans, layout plans and specifications of the buildings or the common areas within the project without the previous written consent of at least two-thirds of the allottees, other than the promoter, who have agreed to take apartments in such building.\r\nTherefore, as per the alleged construction of the RWA Office in Common Area, the promoters had contravened the provisions of the RERA Act 2016.\r\n\r\n3. That u/s 35 of the RERA Act 2016, i.e. Powers of Authority to call for information, it is hereby requested to conduct investigation, and the Authority may considers it expedient on this complaint relating to this Act / Rules / Regulations made thereunder, to call upon the promoter to furnish in writing such information / explanation. it is further requested to kindly make an inquiry in relation to these alleged violations of the RERA Act 2016.\r\n\r\n4. That u/s 37 of the RERA Act 2016, i.e. Powers of Authority to issue directions, it is requested to the Authority for the purpose of discharging its functions under the provisions of this Act or rules or regulations made thereunder, to kindly  issue directions to the promoter as it may consider necessary, in this present case.\r\n\r\nPRAYER\r\nIn the interest of justice, the complainant further prays as the following\r\na. That this Hon\'ble Authority may be pleased to issue order / notice / direction to the promoter to register the project as per the RERA Act 2016.\r\nb. That this Hon\'ble Authority may be pleased to issue order / notice / direction to the promoter to call for the records from the promoter in the present case.\r\nc. That this Hon\'ble Authority may be pleased to levy fine as per section 59 of this Act, if the violations are met in the investigation.\r\nd. That this Hon\'ble Authority may be pleased to issue any order / notice / direction in the facts and circumstances of this present case.','Enclosures','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','400364','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2c8e9610-6ada-4ce4-acdd-f10a562ae81f\\','Doc2021070403785a49-8244-4cbc-bcaf-89c2ba45e896.pdf',0,0,'Approved Map','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','165437','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2c8e9610-6ada-4ce4-acdd-f10a562ae81f\\','Doc20210704df3daeee-75f6-4aaa-9843-2b9fd50e79f6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-07-04 14:16:01.000','','','','12',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000','MiscComplainant','2021-07-04 14:16:01.000'),(138,1513,2021,'MCNo00132021','FormTypeMISC','Rajinder Kumar Sareen','rajindersareen09@gmail.com',9650622641,1614417390,'790-G, SBS NAGAR, Ludhiana 141013','Coral Floors','Ireo waterfront pvt. Limited, Village Devatwal, off canal road, Ludhiana.','Village Devatwal, Ludhiana.','This project has been sold but no possession except  of one or two flats has been given to the buyers. This project named coral floor doesn\'t appear in list of registered projects on rera punjab site.\r\nThe party has also not informed its investors of its rera registration number. No body in promoters office at Devatwal meet the investors nor did they attend investors\' phone calls. They also give wrong information on phone. Inspite of my asking by email about registration number of coral Floors, they didn\'t respond to my email. Hence the project coral floor is unregistered.','Request for regd no. of coral floor','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','11931','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\98154e89-44c8-467c-afb6-bf1f8666d315\\','Doc2021070748db161b-fb9a-495d-9724-890b8dae144a.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','11931','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\98154e89-44c8-467c-afb6-bf1f8666d315\\','Doc20210707bb6fb0df-7212-41c2-8a10-b5d88da30499.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-07-07 01:23:25.000','','','','13',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000','MiscComplainant','2021-07-07 01:23:25.000'),(139,1514,2021,'MCNo00142021','FormTypeMISC','Gurnam Singh','gs9245045@gmail.com',9855784497,0,'Rajpura','Satkar Vihar','Extension Satkar Vihar GT Road Main Delhi Amritsar Highway NH 1 Near Eagle Motel Rajpura','Near Eagle Motel Rajpura','That the said promoter has not developed this project and took money from us in 2011. He had done ikrarnama with us for the plots but no registry has been executed. His whereabouts are not known to us and our money is stuck since 2011. we request the authority to issue notice against him. ','Site photos ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','916361','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e9858d80-e9c2-48fd-995f-d08754e614ae\\','Doc20210722177e07b5-e02f-41ed-aa3f-750544f51586.pdf',0,0,'Ikrarnama Signed','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','860962','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e9858d80-e9c2-48fd-995f-d08754e614ae\\','Doc20210722d89439ae-6d44-40f6-a4fe-0ab5954fa205.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-07-22 15:08:04.000','','','','14',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000','MiscComplainant','2021-07-22 15:08:04.000'),(140,1515,2021,'MCNo00152021','FormTypeMISC','Pankaj Sharma','pankaj.01sharma@gmail.com',8728916066,0,'E203, Industrial Area\r\nPhase 8b mohali','Shivalik Vihar, Promotor SHIVALIK VIHAR STRCTURAL BUILDERS','shivalik vihar homes, near shivalik city, chhajumajra, kharar','Sector 127, Kharar','Dear Sir/Mam\r\nGreetings!\r\n\r\nI am a resident of the Shivalik Vihar homes since 2016. It was committed by the Builder that road will be constructed in next few months. But it\'s been 4 years and the road was never built from House no. 38 to 48. In these 4 years, we have made several requests to the builder and he kept delaying and giving excuses. Now he has completely denied building the road. \r\n\r\nThere are 15+ families suffering from such irresponsible behavior of the builder. In monsoons, it is impossible to step out of houses.\r\nThis request is on behalf of all residents of Shivalik vihar homes- Kharar, kindly take any action so that this road can be constructed asap. \r\n\r\nAdditional Details - Builder\'s RERA application is still pending, please check the attached PDF (Sr. No. 84 ).','Rera Pending Application List','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','85342','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\efecbb32-cd6d-4653-bb12-901bc7727794\\','Doc20210726878e53db-0c64-4456-95d4-bbc7e4bbf778.pdf',0,0,'Condition Of Road','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','197493','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\efecbb32-cd6d-4653-bb12-901bc7727794\\','Doc202107269f16efb6-39e1-431d-a6c0-b3a111bdf610.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-07-26 09:28:11.000','','','','15',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-07-26 09:28:11.000','MiscComplainant','2021-07-26 09:28:11.000'),(141,1516,2021,'MCNo00162021','FormTypeMISC','Gian Singh kamboj','gainsingh@gmail.com',7009600701,0,'Village Chajumajra tehsil Kharar ','Zumirah Homes by Amrik Singh 8567033346, Balwinder Singh Billu 9781665995','Behind Kapco Floors in JTPL city, Sector 115, Kharar \r\nopposite Railway Station Kharar. ','Village Khunimajra tehsil Kharar','Incidents of fraud by builders are increasing day by day. Innocent consumers who are not aware of the RERA registration and benefits of buying property in RERA registered project are being lured and duped by this builder. \r\nHeavy penalty should be imposed so that it has a deterrent effect on other builders using the same modus operandi. \r\nBalwinder Singh Billu and Amrik Singh Kamboj are selling 19 plots and 63 flats/apartments without RERA registration because they have not obtained any project approval from MC, local government or PUDA. They are selling plots and flats in sector 115, village Khunimajra tehsil, Kharar. Their office address is Zumirah homez, KB Tower, Sector 74, Mohali.\r\nI have attached the olx advertisement and map of colony being sold without RERA registration and without approval from Municipal committee or PUDA.\r\nKindly take strict action against them.','19 Plots advertisement sector 115.','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','652876','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6e1e20fe-c6d7-4e29-aa0c-0b23d898c631\\','Doc20210805e658a975-be69-41f4-9626-d1138453c177.pdf',0,0,'63 flats apartments advertisement ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','973348','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6e1e20fe-c6d7-4e29-aa0c-0b23d898c631\\','Doc202108054a4be1ef-7577-4cee-a781-d02c38c74a4f.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-08-05 19:55:41.000','','','','16',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-08-05 19:55:41.000','MiscComplainant','2021-08-05 19:55:41.000'),(142,1517,2021,'MCNo00172021','FormTypeMISC','TDI RESIDENTS RIGHTS PROTECTION & WELFARE SOCIETY','trrpwa117@gmail.com',9988621046,0,'905, TDI City, Sector 117, SAS Nagar Mohali','Tdi City Sector 117','TDI City, Sector 117, Airport Road, SAS Nagar Mohali','TDI City, Sector 117, Airport Road, SAS Nagar Mohali','TDI Infratech Ltd. is developing a Mega Housing Project which includes various Sectors like Sector 74A, 92, 116, 117, 118, 119. The Residential Plots part at Sector 117 which includes almost 100 Acres is not registered with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority. Builder has taken the Partial Completion Certificate from the GMADA in the year 2017 but failed to provide the basic facilities in this area. A strict action of non registration shall be taken against the TDI Infratech Ltd.','Inspection Report Of Committee made by GMADA for Partial Certificate','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','983847','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3203eb80-7285-40eb-a28a-73fe78846eac\\','Doc20210903eafe5d46-3d27-4080-872f-fa03e95d7aff.pdf',0,0,'Partial Completion Certificate','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','491712','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3203eb80-7285-40eb-a28a-73fe78846eac\\','Doc202109033f436f59-e4e4-4297-b78b-1f1022839f86.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-09-03 20:34:11.000','','','','17',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-09-03 20:34:11.000','MiscComplainant','2021-09-03 20:34:11.000'),(143,1518,2021,'MCNo00182021','FormTypeMISC','Neetika Sharda','Sunny.oct29@gmail.com',9914328130,0,'4097 A, Sector 125 Sunny Enclave, Kharar','ECO Floor-II','ECO Floor-II, Jhungian Road, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar 140301','Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar','Flat No. 8431 C ECO Floor-II, Sunny Enclave purchased from Bajwa Developers Ltd registered Vasika No. 2019-20/15/8733  dated 16/10/2019. Still company not ready my flat and they not give me a possession of the same. I have already paid a interested to Bank from the date of registry as mention above amount of Rs. 10301/-  Per month. I request to give me a possession of my flat as soon as possible.','Registry of the Flat','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','733240','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\dfdf6b40-606b-49aa-ab79-82a10ed34ba4\\','Doc20210921790828ef-7fc1-433a-a8d3-4d107f3b6dbb.pdf',0,0,'No Due Certificate from Bajwa Developers','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','256328','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\dfdf6b40-606b-49aa-ab79-82a10ed34ba4\\','Doc2021092129369e14-0016-4558-9fe7-9a3dc3921a56.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-09-21 13:31:28.000','','','','18',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-09-21 13:31:28.000','MiscComplainant','2021-09-21 13:31:28.000'),(144,1519,2021,'MCNo00192021','FormTypeMISC','Neetika Sharda','Sunny.oct29@gmail.com',9914328130,0,'4097 A, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave Kharar','ECO Floor-II','ECO Floor-II, Jhungia Road, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave','Sector 125, Sunny Enclave, Kharar','ECO Floor-II this project layout pass in Highway City, Sector 125, Sunny Enclave. But Plot of the highway city is not as per Layout approved plan. And In Highway City approved plan Bajwa Developers launch a project name of ECO Floor-II without RERA Number and they had sold all the flats and done the registry without RERA Number. Approx 02 Years passed away my registry done but still my flat is not delivered to me. From date of registry i was paid the loan interest of Rs. 10301/- Per Month for the same flat.  ','No Dues Certificate','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','256328','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\45d4b772-d43d-4c53-9748-de873fd7f4e1\\','Doc20210921d74dfb9f-755b-45f8-8054-969e3d5643ed.pdf',0,0,'Registry of the Flats','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','733240','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\45d4b772-d43d-4c53-9748-de873fd7f4e1\\','Doc202109215ea292a8-08bc-4a8d-bfcb-4b4fdf1855dd.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-09-21 13:51:14.000','','','','19',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-09-21 13:51:14.000','MiscComplainant','2021-09-21 13:51:14.000'),(145,1520,2021,'MCNo00202021','FormTypeMISC','Madho Singh Bisht','msbisht1873@gmail.com',9216114488,0,'Flat No 36C Highland Park Home Highland Marg Zirakpur 140603','Gupta Builders And Promtoers Private Limited','SCO 196 197 Sector 34A Chandigarh-160022','Sector 34A','Sir,\r\nThis is for your kind information I have booked plot number 298 dated 07.12.2018.When i ask developer for Rera number but developer said we will give you Rera number later.\r\nI paid Rs. 5,17,372.00 booking amount dated 07.12.2018 Rs.1,00,000/-& 01.01.2019 Rs 4,17,372.00.After four months builder demand me more payment.I told builder first provide me your Rera number then i will give you more payment otherwise refund my booking amount.\r\nBut developer not provide me Rera number an nor refund my booking money till date I will also visits developer office at sector 34,Chandigarh many time since 01.01.2019 and meeting with your CRM Sachin Arora of  company for a solution since 09.09.2020 nothing was done .\r\nAlso called New CRM Mrs.Sakshi Luthra 16.02.2021 at 17.17 but she didn\'t attend my call .I again sent a text message at 17.43  it was very urgent. Again she didn\'t attend my call.\r\nTherefore you are requested to take action immediately.\r\n','Application Form','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','202163','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\28aa0868-a71a-4b8f-8679-ddec05676889\\','Doc2021092343b36bae-22a8-438a-82cc-6f7436a9a49e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','182023','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\28aa0868-a71a-4b8f-8679-ddec05676889\\','Doc20210923bd28322d-6b4e-4625-b9e0-b226e2aecd22.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-09-23 17:51:25.000','','','','20',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-09-23 17:51:25.000','MiscComplainant','2021-09-23 17:51:25.000'),(146,1521,2021,'MCNo00212021','FormTypeMISC','Arvind Chopra','arvind.chopra@yahoo.com',9650005292,1149093330,'RA-47, Second floor, Front Side, Inderpuri\r\nDelhi -110012','ATS Golf Meadows Derabassi ','ATS Golf Meadows, Ambala - Chandigarh Highway, Opp. Sada-Shiv Complex, Dera Bassi - 140507','ATS  green  Meadows  Project  in  Derra  Bassi,  village  Madapur & Sadhemajra Tehsil Derrabassi district SAS Nagar, Mohali, Punjab',' We Arvind Chopra and Bhavna Chopra resident of RA-47, Second Floor, Front Side, Inderpuri -110012, New Delhi purchased  a  plot  in  Derra  Bassi  in  Green  Meadows extension -2 measuring 145.83 sq mts. Unit No. 160 in ATS  green  Meadows  Project  in  Derra  Bassi,  village  Madapur,  Punjab.  The  parcel  of  land admeasuring 145.83 sq. yards.  Bearing  plot no. 160  falling  within  the said project  situated  at Villages Madhopur & Sadhemajra Tehsil Derrabassi district SAS Naga, Mohali, Punjab as per approved layout thereof by the competent Authority. The plot was registered in our name in 2015. The honorable High  court of Punjab and Haryana has passed an interim order for maintaining status quo on the project in which our plot is located.  Due to this, we are unable to construct a house from last two years. The builder did not responds to any emails and even to legal notice  and the competent authority did not  approve the building plan stating the Stay imposed by the  High  Court.  My old parents live in Rahon Dist. Nawashahr and we want to shift them to  Chandigarh in wake of covid for better medical facilities. We had purchased the plot for building a house  for my old parents. However due to fraud conducted by the Builder, we are unable to construct the house.\r\nEnclosed is the Legal notice that we sand to the builder\r\nCopy of order of the honourable high court of Punjab and Haryana\r\n','Legal Notice send to builder with all facts','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','218400','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\66046e56-2d8d-4f51-8d2b-43802bd56d1c\\','Doc20210929c78182e4-2564-4bfd-ba59-b203676ecd26.pdf',0,0,'Order copy of High court','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','105283','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\66046e56-2d8d-4f51-8d2b-43802bd56d1c\\','Doc20210929d93d2cd6-784e-4738-907a-963a2a48ecc1.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2021-09-29 23:59:38.000','','','','21',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2021-09-29 23:59:38.000','MiscComplainant','2021-09-29 23:59:38.000'),(147,1522,2021,'MCNo00222021','FormTypeMISC','Suresh Kumar Sharma','sharma.da.gr8@gmail.com',9855890233,0,'New Sharma Furniture,Partap Bazar,Chhehartta,Amritsar,Punjab','RS ENCLAVE','National Highway,Opposite Dera Baba Darshan Singh,Kala Ghanupur,Chhehartta,Amritsar','Amritsar 2','RS Enclave is unauthorized colony developing since July 2021.Complaint has been submitted to Commissioner MC Amritsar in the interest of Public and state. But due to connivance between promoters and officers of MTP Department they failed to protect interest of state and public.KIndly register my complaint and issue directions to Local Bodies Department Punjab for take action as per PAPRA ACT-1995 and Punjab Municipal Corporation Act 1976. ','Copy complaint submitted to MC Amritsar','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','327955','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\4ab6f0de-1a74-4684-ae3a-d1265b340e95\\','Doc202110281f7f13fc-4bc2-4c0c-89d5-ffb5a8192941.pdf',0,0,'Photos of ongoing development','0