301','MEGA RESIDENTIAL PROJECT SECTOR 74A, 92, 116 117, 118 & 119 TDI CITY SAS NAGAR, Mohali, Punjab - 140301','M/s TDI INDFRATECH LTD has not registered TDI MEGA HOUSING PROJECT SECTOR 74A, 116, 117, 118 & 119 TDI CITY MOHALI, area 177.746 acre under Punjab RERA. As per RERA ACT read along with Para 33,37,45,46,47 of the Hon\'ble Supreme Court of India Judgment in case of M/s NEWTECH PROMOTERS & DEVELOPERS PVT LTD. All ongoing projects that commence prior to the Act and in respect to which completion certificate has not been issued are covered under the Act. But till date even after 4.5 years, promoter has not applied for the RERA Registration for the above mentioned 177.746 acre. Same is clear from the information obtained under RTI from GMADA vide memo no GMADA/STP/A-1/2022/129 dated 17/01/2022 and RTI received from your office file no RERA/2018/4027,dated 09/05/2018, Page no. 188,  that the promoter has not obtained any Completion Certificate for the above-mentioned Project','RTI GMADA not obtained CC , RERA RTI & Partial CC TDI','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','650528','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ae601876-7519-4e83-b50f-d78a1b5a68f7\\','Doc2022020776570c2d-6918-454f-b13f-72b737dafbb5.pdf',0,0,'ABSTRACT OF JUDGMENT OF Newtech Promoters and Developers Pvt Ltd','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','112578','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ae601876-7519-4e83-b50f-d78a1b5a68f7\\','Doc202202078f2e785b-4a03-4de4-b593-c922f0555229.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-02-07 16:41:25.000','','','','2',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-02-07 16:41:25.000','MiscComplainant','2022-02-07 16:41:25.000'),(156,1553,2022,'MCNo00032022','FormTypeMISC','Raseel Thakur','raseel988thakur@gmail.com',9888696249,0,'#2382, Jal Vayu Vihar Society\r\nSector 67, S.A.S. Nargar(Mohali)','My Homes Society','My Homes Society, Sec 127 Kharar. \r\nLandmark - Near Shivalik City gate number 8 & Acme Alvist - Smart Homes.','Sector 127, Kharar.','I purchased a residential plot dated 15-0