00.000','93551','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\fe5eed69-f98b-45c7-81ba-919a7cc55fa5\\','Doc2022031437bb8edb-3b0c-4655-a211-99d21c0ee8b6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-03-14 16:22:44.000','','','','7',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000','MiscComplainant','2022-03-14 16:22:44.000'),(161,1558,2022,'MCNo00082022','FormTypeMISC','Surinder Singh','nattsurinder@gmail.com',9636361749,0,'R/o Block B, Flat No-  1203, Sector 124, Jalvayu Tower , Sunny Enclave Kharar.','Janta Land Promoters Pvt. Ltd.','Sector 82 SAS Nagar Mohali','Sas Nagar Mohali','I purchased SCO in Sector 82 from JLPL and paid sum of Rs. 84 Lakhs on 06.06.2014 vide Receipt No. 6721(full and final payment).  The LOI dated 30.04.2019 issued against the said payment. On date of issuing of LOI project was ongoing one and registration with RERA was mandatory as per law. By not doing so the developer made themselves liable for action as per section 59 of the RERA Act 2016. Developer was also liable for action for receiving full amount of the SCO without executing agreement.','Payment Receipt','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','63362','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b7a9a969-b77d-403f-91d6-77514ed73bd2\\','Doc20220315e70e0e09-f560-4fbe-97b8-f795056d932b.pdf',0,0,'LOI','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','102605','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b7a9a969-b77d-403f-91d6-77514ed73bd2\\','Doc2022031548790378-69ce-45c6-b5c7-de32e2e23a76.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-03-15 13:22:33.000','','','','8',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000','MiscComplainant','2022-03-15 13:22:33.000'),(162,1559,2022,'MCNo00092022','FormTypeMISC','Bithal Hari Sharma','bithalhari@gmail.com',8146990099,0,'H. No. HM-10, Phase 3-B-I, Sector 60, SAS Nagar (Mohali)','PCL Greenways of Innovative Housing and Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. ','at village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh ','at village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh ','I beg to state that  I had filed Complaint ADC No 1352 2019UR titled as Bithal Hari Sharma versus Innovative Housing and Infrastructure Private Limited for refund of Principle amount along with interest as the respondents have totally failed to give possession of residential plots measuring 150 square yards each to complainants even after the lapse of 10 years i.e since the years 2011. This complaint was accepted by the Honable Adjudicating Officer, RERA Punjab vide order dated 28.10.2021 and directed the respondents to pay the amount to complainants within 60 days from the date of passing of the orders i.e. w.e.f. 28.10.2021. It is submitted that project II PCL Greenways of Innovative Housing and Infrastructure Pvt. Ltd. at village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh measuring 20 acres of land was not got registered by Respondents from RERA, Authority Punjab as mandatory under section 3 and 4 of RERA Act despite collecting 37 crores from 179 buyers in the year 2011. This has been proved in the judgment dated 28.10.2021 passed by Honable Adjudicating Officer, RERA, Punjab in above complaints. A copy of the same is enclosed herewith. Now Respondents have already sold the land of project 2 at village Rani Majra and Bhagat Majra, New Chandigarh for Rs. 30 crores which has been proved as per minutes of meeting of the Society, copy enclosed. But payments to both complainants as ordered by RERA, Punjab have not been refunded till date even after enjoying with our hard earned money since the last 11 years by Respondents. Hence, Respondents have violated the provisions of Section 3 and 4 of RERA, Act. 	\r\nIt is, therefore, respectfully prayed that punitive action against respondents may kindly be taken under section 59 and 60 of RERA, Act and penalty up to ten percent of estimated cost may kindly be imposed upon them so that they may not dare to fleece the innocent buyers in future. Their undergoing another project PCL Gateway at village Togan and Teera, New Chandigarh is registered with RERA, Punjab.\r\n\r\n','Judgment dated 28.10.2021','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','946609','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8709ded8-f234-4c22-868c-b60b8a9a3a17\\','Doc20220317407f5344-3e8a-4920-ab0f-9669a0682e25.pdf',0,0,'Minutes of meeting of society','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','693050','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\8709ded8-f234-4c22-868c-b60b8a9a3a17\\','Doc20220317b63f7af3-105a-4e25-a177-8ececb342a06.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-03-17 10:46:17.000','','','','9',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000','MiscComplainant','2022-03-17 10:46:17.000'),(164,1560,2022,'MCNo00102022','FormTypeMISC','Vivek Sehgal','viveksehgalldh@yahoo.com',9216988774,0,'42/3, Nirmal Enclave, Basant City, Post Office DAAD,Ludhiana','Dream City, Ludhiana, Sector 4B','Adjoining to Ireo Waterfront Pocket 3','Spread over Village Dewatwal, Gahaur, Birmi, Issewal, Dakha 1 & 2','A new 56.56 acre project is being marketed by AIPL Group, which has recently taken over the Project Ireo Waterfront without approval/consent from allottees and RERA. Some pages from the brochure, designed by Oasis Designs Inc is enclosed along with the bank account details in which the booking proceeds are deposited. Payment plan - Total 3 years time for payment, 10% Booking, 15% at RERA approval, 2 years development link plan with 8 quarters. More info can be provided whenever required. ','Brochure as being shown to prospective allottees and bank account details','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','843119','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0f72c63d-0de0-4020-a9e1-6992db18fbbc\\','Doc202203207cc9f949-44f2-47d1-a716-260666d31ae1.pdf',0,0,'Some more pages from brochure','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','889160','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0f72c63d-0de0-4020-a9e1-6992db18fbbc\\','Doc20220320c2347d7d-504c-4cea-8605-7a7b16483822.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-03-20 11:28:24.000','','','','10',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-03-20 11:28:24.000','MiscCompla