mposed as per Section 59 of Act and on failure to pay penalty, imprisonment be ordered. Meantime, stay on further sale be also ordered.\r\n','sale deed dated January 18, 2022','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','236542','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3665683a-7e03-46eb-a8cc-f778e905cc6f\\','Doc2022050357f2c693-56f7-4938-8475-90947bab8042.pdf',0,0,'sale deed dated February 4,2022','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','257874','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3665683a-7e03-46eb-a8cc-f778e905cc6f\\','Doc2022050357e00134-072c-4a59-b4df-520c43b6cfcb.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-05-03 12:37:32.000','','','','16',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-05-03 12:37:32.000','MiscComplainant','2022-05-03 12:37:32.000'),(171,1567,2022,'MCNo00172022','FormTypeMISC','Gurinder Pal Singh ','jagtardhaliwal13477@gmail.com',8360380893,0,'son of Mohinder Singh resident of Vikas Colony Patiala','PDA Omax City Patiala ','The project is located at Sirhind road village Baran Patiala','Tehsil and District Patiala','The project was started in April 2010 and it is still ongoing and far away from completion as even basic amenities are not available at the site. so it must be registered with RERA Punjab u/s 3 of RERA Act, 2016. Allotment letter was issued to complainant on 30-Dec-2010 vide memo 3168 and the possession was to be delivered within three years from allotment as per condition no 6 of allotment letter but despite full payment possession has still not been offered.','Scheme','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','793532','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ceb9555e-8d14-449d-b5af-b17ba381ef24\\','Doc202205070e4404ac-6cbf-4d6b-b038-e620c6e036e0.pdf',0,0,'Allotment letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','952448','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ceb9555e-8d14-449d-b5af-b17ba381ef24\\','Doc20220507745a25be-0420-4eb0-80a5-8c6b4d34a283.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2022-05-07 14:40:47.000','','','','17',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2022-05-07 14:40:47.000','MiscComplainant'