'','','','',0,0,1,'2023-02-14 17:46:44.000','','','','2',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-02-14 17:46:44.000','MiscComplainant','2023-02-14 17:46:44.000'),(192,1588,2023,'MCNo00032023','FormTypeMISC','Manish Kumar','manishgupta10193@gmail.com',9463590050,0,'House No. 729, Sector 43A, Chandigarh - 160022','Rishi Apartment (Gee City Builders Pvt Ltd)','Ambala-Chandigarh Road','Zirakpur','I respectfully submit that I had purchased flat No. E502 in the Rishi Apartments Zirakpur from Gee City Builders Private Limited in 2010 along with one four wheeler parking. The said parking was also earmarked by the builder to all the allottees including me. I am a salaried employee residing at Chandigarh and the said flat was kept locked. \r\nHowever sometime back when I visited my flat I saw that my parking space was occupied by the owner of Flat No. G401. When discussed with the owner of Flat No. G401 he informed that the said parking was allotted to him. \r\nIn view of this shocking development the matter was immediately taken up with the Rishi Apartment Welfare Association who advised me to bring the map of parking (with my parking earmarked on it) from the builder. Instantly I approached the builder and requested them to provide me the said map. But they showed their inconvenience stating that it would require time to search the records.On a subsequent visit with the same request they refused me saying that it would take some time as records have been shifted to Bathinda.For the last 3 years I have been running pillar to post to obtain the requisite map but they did not provide me the same. I was informed that the MD of the company was staying at Bathinda.I approached him and talked to him on many occasions and as per his advices also sent him the relevant pics / documents through WhatsApp but to no avail. He subsequently stopped taking my calls. \r\nHonourable Sir, I am a salaried employee and purchased this flat with my hard earned money and due to ignorance this being my first property purchase I was not aware and I did not take the parking map. I even tried to contact the then Marketing Manager of the company Mr Gurpeet Saini but he was not reachable and I am told that he has already migrated abroad. I am now feeling cheated by the company. This non-cooperation and dissuading behavior of the company officials including its MD is creating lot of discomfort mental agony as well as stress to me. The trauma of losing my asset and myself not being able to peacefully enjoy its comfort which was acquired with my hard-earned savings is haunting me and is also impacting my health. \r\nI therefore request your honor to kindly intervene in the matter and issue orders to the builder to provide my parking without any further delay. I attach here with my request letter to the builder alongwith the delivery confirmation and the photo of the parking space allotted to me property earmarked with paint by the builder itself. I have not received any reply to my letter so far.','Copy of letter to Builder alongwith delivery confirmation','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','804567','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3bf76530-f5e4-43cb-a3be-c31c72bf2749\\','Doc20230221cb3d69eb-b449-4812-aef0-0524d62ed3ee.pdf',0,0,'Parking as earmarked by the Builder','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','111189','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\3bf76530-f5e4-43cb-a3be-c31c72bf2749\\','Doc20230221d03271a4-15e4-4326-bf26-7102fae12807.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-02-21 12:58:57.000','','','','3',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-02-21 12:58:57.000','MiscComplainant','2023-02-21 12:58:57.000'),(193,1589,2023,'MCNo00042023','FormTypeMISC','Seema Devi','avinashnath84@gmail.com',9041407160,0,'2201, CHIRAG HOME 2, NEAR ARISTA PALACE, SUNNY ENCLAVE SECTOR 123, MOHALI','CHIRAG HOME 2','CHIRAG HOME 2, NEAR ARISTA PALACE, SUNNY ENCLAVE SECTOR 123, MOHALI','CHIRAG HOME 2, NEAR ARISTA PALACE, SUNNY ENCLAVE SECTOR 123, MOHALI','On 09/02/2023, I WENT TO PSPCL MOHALI OFFICE