bcf06\\','Doc2023052410103990-64a8-4dd9-baf2-857238dad5f9.pdf',0,0,'PRICE LIST','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','784164','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\008b9fa6-f111-417f-ba79-c6db513bcf06\\','Doc20230524cdaaecc7-b181-463f-90c6-d4f70439e66b.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-05-24 18:56:19.000','','','','5',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-05-24 18:56:19.000','MiscComplainant','2023-05-24 18:56:19.000'),(195,1591,2023,'MCNo00062023','FormTypeMISC','PUNEET KUMAR','anujdublin@gmail.com',9780022478,0,'BANK COLONY, SUNDER NAGAR, DHANGU ROAD, PATHANKOT (PUNJAB) 145001','EMERGING INDIA INFRA AND DEVOLOPERS LTD.','SCO-46-47, SEC-9D, NEAR MATTKA CHOWK, MADHYA MARG, CHANDIGARH, 160009','SEC-9D','As per details furnished by the complainant in his complaint, the complainant has booked the SP 6year\'s Plan on 09/03/2012 and paid a amount of  Rs.50,000/-(Rupees Fifty thousand only) as per launch offer to the respondent  out of the total cost of the flat is Rs. 109749/-(Rupees One lakh nine thousand seven hundred fourth nine only) and entered into Registration Letter. After Maturity date of agreement the respondent refused to refund the money. This complaint is filled under Section 18 of RERA act against the project SP 6 year\'s plan, developed by EMERGING INDIA INFRA AND DEVOLOPERS LTD .This project has not been registered with RERA.\r\n\r\n','Registration Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','582775','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\80f05d88-e36c-4396-86a9-ee410dac58a6\\','Doc202305258736fd15-f0ad-4d54-93b0-6dce2c673203.pdf',0,0,'Company Details','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','375208','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\80f05d88-e36c-4396-86a9-ee410dac58a6\\','Doc20230525c29b3546-d627-401d-9927-59400b552fa2.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-05-25 17:09:36.000','','','','6',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-05-25 17:09:36.000','MiscComplainant','2023-05-25 17:09:36.000'),(196,1592,2023,'MCNo00072023','FormTypeMISC','LILLY','lillylil2023@gmail.com',6908100010,0,'mOHALI PUNJAB','ATULYAM THE BLISS','SITE 3A SECTOR 88 SAS NAGAR MOHALI','SITE 3A SECTOR 88 SAS NAGAR MOHALI','RERA PUNJAB\r\n\r\nSUBJECT - ADVERTISEMENT OF REAL ESTATE PROJECT \"ATULYAM THE BLISS\"  IN MOHALI, PUNJAB GIVEN IN NEWSPAPER\r\nWITH OUT OBTAINING RERA APPROVAL  IN CONTRAVENTION OF SECTION 3  OF RERA ACT 2016\r\n\r\n DEAR SIR\r\n\r\nAS PER section 3 RERA ACT 2016 , No promoter shall advertise , market, book, sell or offer for sale, or invite persons to purchase in any manner any plot, apartment or building, as the case may be, in any real estate project or part of it, in any planning area, without registering the real estate project with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority\r\n\r\nTHE PROJECT NAMED  \"ATULYAM THE BLISS\" IN MOHALI HAS BEEN ADVERTISED AND FLATS HAS BEEN SOLD IN 2022, THE ADVERTISEMENT AS GIVEN IN NEWSPAPERS \"CHANDIGARH TIMES\" AND CHANDIGARH TRIBUNE IS ATTACHED  HERE WITH.\r\n\r\nSUCH Violation or non-compliance of the provisions OF section 3, 11(2), 12 read/with section 2(b)   of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016  for issuance of advertisement   IS PUNISHABLE WITH  penal proceedings  under section 59, 61 and/or 63 of the  RERA Act 2016\r\n\r\nTHE ADVERTISEMENT  AS GIVEN IN NEWSPAPER IS ATTACHED','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','70642','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\92ebb892-9f10-4f32-94d9-3be9bd1ab40a\\','Doc2023061812526175-44a8-4163-b519-1818218fe7ad.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','60458','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\92ebb892-9f10-4f32-94d9-3be9bd1ab40a\\','Doc202306181015df43-01a7-41c9-a9c6-b5a5cada6341.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-06-18 14:40:27.000','','','','7',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-06-18 14:40:27.000','MiscComplainant','2023-06-18 14:40:27.000'),(197,1593,2023,'MCNo00082023','FormTypeMISC','lilly lil','lillylil2023@gmail.com',7678712345,0,'MOHALI PUNJAB','ATULYAM THE BLISS','SITE 3A  SECTOR 88 SAS NAGAR MOHALI','SECTOR 88 SAS NAGAR MOHALI','RERA PUNJAB\r\n\r\nSUBJECT - ADVERTISEMENT OF REAL ESTATE PROJECT \"ATULYAM THE BLISS\"  IN MOHALI, PUNJAB GIVEN IN NEWSPAPER\r\nWITH OUT OBTAINING RERA APPROVAL  IN CONTRAVENTION OF SECTION 3  OF RERA ACT 2016\r\n\r\nDEAR SIR\r\n\r\nAS PER section 3 RERA ACT 2016 No promoter shall advertise , market, book, sell or offer for sale, or invite persons to purchase in any manner any plot, apartment or building, as the case may be, in any real estate project or part of it, in any planning area, without registering the real estate project with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority\r\n\r\nTHE PROJECT NAMED  \"ATULYAM THE BLISS\" IN MOHALI HAS BEEN ADVERTISED AND FLATS HAS BEEN SOLD IN 2022, THE ADVERTISEMENT AS GIVEN IN NEWSPAPERS \"CHANDIGARH TIMES\" AND CHANDIGARH TRIBUNE IS ATTACHED  HERE WITH OUT obtaining RERA Registration.\r\n\r\nViolation or non-compliance of the provisions OF section 3, 11(2), 12 read/with section 2(b)   of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016  for issuance of advertisement   IS PUNISHABLE WITH  penal proceedings  under section 59, 61 and/or 63 of the  RERA Act 2016\r\n\r\nTHE ADVERTISEMENT  AS GIVEN IN NEWSPAPER IS ATTACHED\r\n','ADVERTISEMENT AS GIVEN IN TRIBUNE','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','70642','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\aca48500-648a-43e1-b61a-3cbecf807def\\','Doc20230618b972bdd1-9e60-46b8-b061-cbcae3296df6.pdf',0,0,'ADVERTISEMENT AS GIVEN IN CHANDIGARH TIMES','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','60458','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\aca48500-648a-43e1-b61a-3cbecf807def\\','Doc20230618eebb98cb-ef88-4e81-97c1-5ffdf6243791.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-06-18 16:53:03.000','','','','8',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-06-18 16:53:03.000','MiscComplainant','2023-06-18 16:53:03.000'),(198,1594,2023,'MCNo00092023','FormTypeMISC','Ramandeep Kaur','manmohit.msquare@gmail.com',8054518712,0,'#803, Block C-3, Kendriya Vihar-1, Sunny Enclave, Kharar, SAS Nagar, Mohali (Punjab)','Serenity Sky of Premia Realtors Private Limited (U63030PB2020PTC052296)','SCO 1034, Ground Floor, Springdale Market, Sector 123, Sunny Enclave, Kharar Punjab','Serenity Sky, Situated at Sector-123, Sunny Enclave, SAS Nagar Mohali, Punjab-140601 ','I have entered into an agreement with Premia Realtors Private Limited vide Agreement to Sell dated 24.05.2022, wherein it has been mentioned that M/s Premia Realtors Private Limited will hand over the Property Unit No- 45, Floor No. 3rd, Area approx. (1165 sq. ft.) situated at Sector-123, Sunny Enclave, SAS Nagar Mohali, Punjab 140601 in lieu of agreed consideration amounts to Rs. 41,25,000 (Forty-One Lakh Twenty-Five Thousand Only). However, against the aforesaid mentioned consideration payment of Rs. 8,25,000/- (Eight Lakh Twenty-Five Thousand Only) has been made and the balance to be paid according to Construction Linked Payment Plan. As per the Point No. 14 of the Agreement, the said handover of the Property shall be made on or before 31st March 2023 which extended to 30th April 2023 later on. Moreover, no such handover is made till date nor the money is refunded. \r\nIn addition to the above the company also required to get itself registered under RERA Act but no such information is provided to us by the company. \r\n','Site Image','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','607761','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7eb56725-8fdf-4336-bc23-aa9d10934c12\\','Doc20230628d00be145-dcf9-410f-822e-ffbbd67a8f1f.pdf',0,0,'ATS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','495798','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7eb56725-8fdf-4336-bc23-aa9d10934c12\\','Doc20230628edd26171-7db9-4985-bb34-ebe5d905bf70.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-06-28 11:08:44.000','','','','9',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-06-28 11:08:44.000','MiscComplainant','2023-06-28 11:08:44.000'),(199,1595,2023,'MCNo00102023','FormTypeMISC','Arun Kumar','legalworkshelp@gmail.com',9417016537,0,'House No- 38 Aastha Enclave, Dhanaula Road Barnala - 148101','Aastha Enclave through its Director Shri Deepak Kumar son of Shri Amarnath Bansal','Aastha Colony Dhanaula Road, Barnala','City Barnala Punjab','In Barnala Aastha Enclave was developed in 2005-06 and was completed and handed over to the local Authority. Now after the coming into force of the RERA Act, 2016 the said developer Barnala Builders Ltd. through its director Deepak Bansal is making extension to the said colony without geeting registering the project with RERA in utter violation of section 3 of RERA Act, 2016 is liable for action under section 59 of the RERA Act, 2016.','Complaint to DC Barnala','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','660344','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\eaad31f9-4c36-43fe-8f47-de3257fc8644\\','Doc202307242a5f25f2-a4a2-4a07-aa5f-b4809d619ca9.pdf',0,0,'Complaint to Punjab Pollution Control Board','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','951421','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\eaad31f9-4c36-43fe-8f47-de3257fc8644\\','Doc2023072471780b75-ce41-4a87-93f3-1f030ef5a69e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-07-24 01:03:52.000','','','','10',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-07-24 01:03:52.000','MiscComplainant','2023-07-24 01:03:52.000'),(200,1596,2023,'MCNo00112023','FormTypeMISC','Ravinder Kumar','ravinderthakur44@gmail.com',7355516944,0,'HOUSE NO 56-A Guru Fateh Town Bhagoo Majra Kharar ','GURUFATEH TOWN','HOUSE NO 56-A Guru Fateh Town Bhagoo Majra Kharar (Near GBP CRUST)','Vill.Bhagoo Majra Kharar Punjab ','Kindly Provide the information of Guru Fateh Town project .','Stamp Duty ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','103169','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ee08de20-ea6e-4f5d-a5bb-b9d6e938ea17\\','Doc20230805fc34a31c-98fd-4e73-94fd-6309e8ab4ae6.pdf',0,0,'Deed signature ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','154738','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ee08de20-ea6e-4f5d-a5bb-b9d6e938ea17\\','Doc20230805adb6099b-f8af-4d4f-a6b7-a087697a49a0.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-08-05 16:27:13.000','','','','11',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-08-05 16:27:13.000','MiscComplainant','2023-08-05 16:27:13.000'),(201,1597,2023,'MCNo00122023','FormTypeMISC','Aayush Chawla','aayushchawla24@gmail.com',7988808425,0,'2032-A huda sector 17 Yamunanagar Haryana','Dristhi Avenue','Dristhi Avenue chajju majra sector 126 mohali','chajju majra','The project is unauthorized, no sewage, no water, nothing as promised.','Registry copy flat 9a ground floor','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','631258','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\04852a05-499a-413d-afcf-03e515ef9348\\','Doc202308269247083e-f5ab-4ebd-8659-43428535549b.pdf',0,0,'Registry copy flat 9a ground floor','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','631258','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\04852a05-499a-413d-afcf-03e515ef9348\\','Doc20230826531a4869-28c2-4b72-ae6d-d6c7990749c8.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-08-26 20:55:10.000','','','','12',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-08-26 20:55:10.000','MiscComplainant','2023-08-26 20:55:10.000'),(202,1598,2023,'MCNo00132023','FormTypeMISC','PARWINDER SINGH','parwindertax@gmail.com',9463131150,0,'FLAT NO 1401 , BLOCK B5, PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS SECTOR-88 MOHALI PIN 140308','SECTOR 88-89 INCLUDING PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS','PURAB PREMIUM APARTMENTS SECTOR 88 MOHALI','SECTOR 88 MOHALI','GMADA HAD LAUNCHED SCHEME FOR SALE OF 550 FLATS IN JULY 2023 INSPITE OF THE FACT THAT REGISTRATION (NO. PBRERA-SAS81-PM0121) HAD ALREADY LAPSED WAYBACK IN 2018-19. I HAVE ALSO FILED COMPLAINT WITH RERA PUNJAB VIDE DIARY NO 5425 DATED 28.08.23 BUT NO ACTION IS TAKEN. 313 APPLICATIONS AGAINST ALLOTMENT OF 550 FLATS HAVE BEEN RECEIVED & GMADA IS IN THE PROCESS OF MAKING ALLOTMENTS. IMMEDIATE APPROPRIATE ACTION IS REQUIRED IN THE MATTER. ','BROCHURE FOR ALLOTMENT OF 550 FLATS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','820040','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8f293f0-5070-448b-8281-b7ce52b7b006\\','Doc20230920b1ab4dc2-0420-4e5e-828e-b42be3c6ada1.pdf',0,0,'CANCELLATION/ LAPSE OF REGISTRATION','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','86393','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8f293f0-5070-448b-8281-b7ce52b7b006\\','Doc2023092009a07722-b577-470d-8d71-07bdab572f7e.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-09-20 20:39:26.000','','','','13',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000','MiscComplainant','2023-09-20 20:39:26.000'),(203,1599,2023,'MCNo00142023','FormTypeMISC','Dev Kishan','dekshn@gmail.com',7899878809,0,'Flat No. 221 B Platinum Floors Royal Motia City Zirakpur Sas Nagar Mohali Punjab 140603','ATS Golf Meadows- GM 3','Unit/Plot Bearing No.-5 Vilage - Madhopur','Dera Bassi Mohali Punjab','ATS Golf Meadows-GM 3 under M/s ATS Estates Private Limited has grabbed money for this RERA expired project Unit/Plot Bearing No. 5 Village Madhopur Tehsil- Dera Bassi Mohali Punjab','RERA list of projects','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','1008692','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2c7ee358-79cc-4bdd-a554-9caaf19e4fd2\\','Doc2023092274182f87-9d66-47d6-a9e0-dff2011c4518.pdf',0,0,'Legal Notice to ATS  Estates Private Limited','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','96347','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\2c7ee358-79cc-4bdd-a554-9caaf19e4fd2\\','Doc20230922b095c808-f5e9-4d22-b668-ecc3748f4171.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-09-22 10:01:37.000','','','','14',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000','MiscComplainant','2023-09-22 10:01:37.000'),(204,1600,2023,'MCNo00152023','FormTypeMISC','GURUCHETAN VIRDI','virdi.guruchetan@gmail.com',9619669569,0,'4307/68 MOHALI','LANDCHESTER AERO BUSINESS PARK','LC 2\r\nSAS NAGAR MOHALI','NAGARI','THE PROMOTOER HAS ACCEPTED  MONEY VIA. CHEQUE FOR ALLOTMENT OF SURVYE DEPOSIT FOR COMMERCIAL LAND IN PROJECT NAMED LC 2.\r\nTHE CONFIRMATION OF RERA APPROVAL AND FURTHER REGISTRY IS AWAITED. THE SUPPORTING DOCUMENTS FOR THE SAME IS ATTACHED HEREWITH FOR YOUR PERUSAL PLEASE','RECIEPTS FOR CHEQUE PAYMENTS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','305547','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\be70caa5-02be-4201-9fef-7c646d0f77c1\\','Doc20231221dbb70fcd-917e-4927-9af7-8b653b763c0e.pdf',0,0,'RECIEPTS FOR CHEQUE PAYMENTS','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','305547','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\be70caa5-02be-4201-9fef-7c646d0f77c1\\','Doc20231221c638d8c5-1715-47e1-a950-2ce823fe2074.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2023-12-21 09:13:36.000','','','','15',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2023-12-21 09:13:36.000','MiscComplainant','2023-12-21 09:13:36.000'),(205,1601,2024,'MCNo00012024','FormTypeMISC','SUSHIL KUMAR','jaglansushil@gmail.com',8146485848,0,'F-622, ESCON ARENA, NAGLA ROAD, ZIRAKPUR, MOHALI','Deep Residency','Chandigarh Ludhiana Highway, adjoining GGS college of Modern Technology, khanpur, kharar','kharar','1	That in the month of Jan 2023 I came to know about the project Deep Residency by Singh builders & Developers in rakba Khanpur, Kharar, Punjab.\r\n2	That the project is passed as Plots under name of Exotic Apartment whereas the builder is constructing and selling independent units on these plots with name of Deep Residency which is not registered anywhere.\r\n3	That the builder is constructing total of 350 units comprising of 1 BHK and 2 BHK independent Floors\r\n4	That the builder is constructing these floors on plot size of 72 sq.yd and 112 sq.yd as Ground, First and Second independent units. As per my information the government has totally banned construction of G+2 floors on individual plots. The builder do not posses required approvals for construction of G+2 floors as per policy.\r\n5	That the builder is selling these floors as independent units and getting them registered also as independent units for which the builder does not have approvals as such.\r\n6	The builder is getting these units registered without having NOC from Electricity dept, STP, MC office and other depts.\r\n7	That as per my information no Occupation Certificate (OC) has been obtained by the said  builders \r\n8	That further as per my information nor the project is not registered with the RERA authorities \r\n9	That the payments from customers are taken by builder in account of Singh builders and developers whereas the registrations are done by individual persons.\r\n','broucher','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','106270','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b3165d5b-4cb7-462b-9236-351b5c0b5dff\\','Doc20240102093f6c93-9d8f-4e26-8c73-5a10b9bbdfe6.pdf',0,0,'layout','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','515669','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b3165d5b-4cb7-462b-9236-351b5c0b5dff\\','Doc202401020e895d7f-331f-4a8f-bf5c-0a57e7cebb90.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-01-02 19:47:02.000','','','','1',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-01-02 19:47:02.000','MiscComplainant','2024-01-02 19:47:02.000'),(206,1602,2024,'MCNo00022024','FormTypeMISC','Naresh Kumar','sandeepverma2@hotmail.com',9814006425,0,'328 sector 5 b new shasti nagar new mandi gobindgarh','Metro park/ A-Tech Infrastucture Pvt LTd','industrial zone sector 103 Mohali','industrial zone sector 103 Mohali','That the developer project has lapsed as per the list available on the website of Rera Punjab, as on 30th  of September 2023 and the developer had sought extension of the same under section 7 the act, which would imply that do the registration of RERA was given to the developer, but as of now the status of the project is in abeyance till further extension is granted to the developer for the purpose of advertisement, marketing, book, sale, or offer of sale, or invite persons to purchase in any manner, any plot, apartment, or building in any real estate project, or part of it in any planning, development or municipal area without registering the real estate project. The developer is regularly advertising the project on its own website  in question and advertising it on all social platforms which is annexed as enclosures with the complaint . ','ADVERTISING','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','151069','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\55746fdf-628c-4401-86c2-e2bd4f5fa6d6\\','Doc20240122051c937d-c45c-4eb1-bac5-ea4e41476be8.pdf',0,0,'project','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','151069','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\55746fdf-628c-4401-86c2-e2bd4f5fa6d6\\','Doc202401224d43ba29-d1bf-473f-8029-63315a135b23.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-01-22 15:22:33.000','','','','2',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-01-22 15:22:33.000','MiscComplainant','2024-01-22 15:22:33.000'),(207,1603,2024,'MCNo00032024','FormTypeMISC','SUSHIL KUMAR','jaglansushil@gmail.com',9996819902,0,'F-622, ESCON ARENA, NAGLA ROAD, ZIRAKPUR, MOHALI','Deep Residency','Singh Builder and Developers, Chandigarh Ludhiana Road (NH-5) adjoining CGS College of Modern Technology, vill. khanpur, Kharar 140501, Punjab ','vill. khanpur, Kharar 140501, Punjab ','1	That M/s Singh Builder and Developers is having a project namely (Deep Residency), Vill. Khanpur, Chandigarh Ludhiana Road (NH-5) adjoining  CGS College of  Modern Technology, Kharar 140501, Punjab  .\r\n2	That the project has been launched with much fan fare and there is large scale publicity of the independent floors and flats being sold by the builder and more than 300 flats are being builtup and sold by the builder.\r\n3	That however the above said builder has not got itself or the project registered under RERA Act 2016 which is in complete violation of Section 59 of RERA Act 2016.\r\n4	That the builder has also issued pamphlets for the sale of flats and is accepting money from the innocent buyers.\r\n5	That by violating the provisions of RERA Act 2016, the builder is liable to be summoned and heavy penalty be imposed and suitable action be taken as per law.\r\n6	That the builder has not received necessary approvals in respect to pollution, mining, electrical, builders liscence, completion certificate etc.\r\n','broucher','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','106270','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8a7041b-7a43-448c-860b-b0f79a6e9206\\','Doc20240213ade0db80-3a84-44a7-b5b5-ca8daf074346.pdf',0,0,'layout','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','515669','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e8a7041b-7a43-448c-860b-b0f79a6e9206\\','Doc20240213427b2b2e-55da-4631-9367-d54