,0,0,1,'2024-02-13 13:34:14.000','','','','4',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-02-13 13:34:14.000','MiscComplainant','2024-02-13 13:34:14.000'),(209,1605,2024,'MCNo00052024','FormTypeMISC','Deepak Sangwan','deepakjugnu99@gmail.com',9041555191,0,'Flat No. 45C, Motiaz City, zirakpur','Deep Residency','Singh Builder and Developers, (Deep Residency), Chandigarh Ludhiana Road (NH-5) adjoining CGS College of Modern Technology, vill. Khanpur, Kharar 140501, Punjab','vill. khanpur, Kharar 140501, Punjab ','The builder is constructing G+2 floors on plot size of 72 sq.yd and 112 sq.yd and selling them as Ground, First and Second independent units. As per my information the government has totally banned construction of G+2 floors on individual plots. The builder do not posses required approvals for construction of G+2 floors as per policy and has not registered in RERA','broucher','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','106270','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a70aa14b-0ac1-4176-880a-31a3caee5dcf\\','Doc202402159cf9cf2d-b7b2-445b-8d93-a9874e58278f.pdf',0,0,'layout','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','515669','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a70aa14b-0ac1-4176-880a-31a3caee5dcf\\','Doc2024021585d3e345-5ecb-48f4-9e2a-5666271d936b.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-02-15 17:42:48.000','','','','5',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-02-15 17:42:48.000','MiscComplainant','2024-02-15 17:42:48.000'),(210,1606,2024,'MCNo00062024','FormTypeMISC','Sai enclave dera bassi habbitpur road dera bassi','baljitkumar2689@gmail.com',7009455368,7009455368,'Sai enclave Socity dera bassi habitpur road all sai family ','Sai enclave ','Sai enclave Habitpur road dera bassi dist mohali punjab ','Dera bassi','Sir hamare jaha na sevrage h na pani na bijli ham bahut preshaan hai builder dhamki deta h kahi bhi complint karne jate hai.pehle hi builder ph kr deta hai sav mile huye u builder k sath builder or uske karinde  apni tana sahi ka rob dete h kehte h sav hamari jeb main h sav kharide huye h police kehte h hamare paiso se pal rahi hai please hame hamari basic faulty dilwai jaye bahut meharbani hogi aapki main pdf dal raha hu unki ','Sai enclave ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','123154','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9f59a237-5b6d-463d-bd79-60b06d3a019e\\','Doc20240328f83eb422-d9f1-4c81-94c0-db6905c5dee5.pdf',0,0,'Sai enclave ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','405389','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9f59a237-5b6d-463d-bd79-60b06d3a019e\\','Doc20240328e8fedd04-e50c-4971-ba4b-bbb3c35b365a.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-03-28 00:06:30.000','','','','6',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-03-28 00:06:30.000','MiscComplainant','2024-03-28 00:06:30.000'),(211,1607,2024,'MCNo00072024','FormTypeMISC','Vineet Mittal','adv@shriganpati.com',9833844000,0,'#725, Sushant City-2, Mansa Road , Jassi Pauwali, Bathinda, Punjab 151001','Sushant City-2, A mega project. (Promoter -VKM Township Pvt. Ltd.)','Sushant City-2, Mansa Road , Jassi Pauwali, Bathinda, Punjab 151001','Bathinda','I am writing to lodge a formal complaint against the promoter of the real estate project known as Suhant City-2, which is currently being marketed and sold under the management of VKM Township Private Limited, formerly known as Ansal Mittal Township Pvt. Ltd. The registered office of the promoter is located at 115, Ansal Bhawan, 16, Kasturba Gandhi Marg, New Delhi, 110001.\r\n\r\nDespite several requests for the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 (RERA) registration number of the said project, the promoter has failed to provide any such details. \r\n\r\nKindly take action if not registered and if the same is registered share rera number of project Sushant City-2 , A mega project.','scan1','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','599201','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\805f4601-de0d-4732-8716-7774ae467b21\\','Doc2024033162d226fc-bf91-485e-a3e6-65ee8bd14017.pdf',0,0,'scan 2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','852671','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\805f4601-de0d-4732-8716-7774ae467b21\\','Doc20240331f11a5d57-72aa-42f5-8d95-e770639b4c82.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-03-31 11:30:47.000','','','','7',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-03-31 11:30:47.000','MiscComplainant','2024-03-31 11:30:47.000'),(212,1608,2024,'MCNo00082024','FormTypeMISC','Ravinder Garg','SAACOUNSELORS@GMAIL.COM',9872628189,0,'1792, Nirwana Society , Sector 49 B, Chandigarh','Sahara India Commercial Corporation Limited (Sahara City Homes)','Sco. 1110 - 1111 , 2nd floor, sector 22 , Chandigarh - 160022 (Above LIC Office)','Sector 22, Chandigarh','That on 12.12.2004, A newspaper advertisement was first advertised vide Publication made vide The Tribune Newspaper at the 4th page of the mainstream newspaper which was published for the sale of Flats and penthouses against the deposits made by the Consumers  vis the same(Annexure A-1). Further the complainant had been lured by the builder , his agents and misleading advertisements and brochure to book a 3 BHK Pent House Type C measuring 168.34 sq. mt.The cost of which was fixed at Rs.38.88 lacs. The O.P. had advertised vide brochure the setup of its projects pan India and the facilities which it was going to provide. It had also provided the layout plans of the units along with the address  location of the units which it was going to provide. Further as per the recent advertisement the opposite party has been still involved in the process of transfer and sale without getting itself registered with the concerned authority as per the RER ACT and is liable to be punished u/s 59 of the act. The newspaper clips as annexed as annexure A2. About 9 projects have been advertised by the developer without license and registration (page 7)','AnnexureA1','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','648688','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ed7b1617-c7e4-4b8f-9315-d16f73eecf99\\','Doc202404078bb5890f-2c9f-4438-9fe3-dbb9fba0f2f4.pdf',0,0,'AnnexureA2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','413472','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ed7b1617-c7e4-4b8f-9315-d16f73eecf99\\','Doc202404077194d6fb-bd7e-4ad4-a4dc-24ccf7ba6a66.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-04-07 21:30:53.000','','','','8',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-04-07 21:30:53.000','MiscComplainant','2024-04-07 21:30:53.000'),(213,1609,2024,'MCNo00092024','FormTypeMISC','HIMANJIT KAUR','himanjitdhillon@gmail.com',9914522631,0,'GARHSHANKAR','FUN DESTINO MALL GARHSHANKAR','GARHSHANKAR, ADJOINING MARUTI SUZUKI SHOWROOM, HOSHIARPUR ROAD, GARHSHANKAR','PAROWAL','Non-Compliance with RERA Regulations and Unapproved Construction Activities\r\n\r\nTo whom it may concern,\r\n\r\nI hope this email finds you well. I am writing to bring to your attention a matter of grave concern regarding a construction project within fun destino mall, which falls under your esteemed jurisdiction.\r\n\r\nUpon recent observation, it has come to my attention that construction activities within fun destino mall have transpired without adherence to the regulatory standards set forth by the Real Estate Regulatory Authority . Additionally, it has been brought to light that the project in question is not registered under RERA, further exacerbating the non-compliance with legal obligations.\r\n\r\nThis egregious violation of RERA regulations not only jeopardizes the rights and interests of consumers but also undermines the integrity and efficacy of regulatory frameworks established to safeguard the interests of stakeholders within the real estate sector.\r\n\r\nFurthermore, it has been noted that the construction carried out is not in alignment with the approved site map sanctioned by local authorities, thereby compounding the regulatory infractions associated with this project.\r\n\r\nAs a concerned citizen committed to upholding the principles of transparency, accountability, and regulatory compliance, I urge the Real Estate Regulatory Authority to undertake immediate and thorough investigation into this matter. Swift and decisive action must be taken to address the non-compliance with RERA regulations, ensure the registration of the project under RERA, and enforce adherence to approved construction plans.\r\n\r\nI implore the Real Estate Regulatory Authority to exercise its regulatory oversight and enforcement powers to rectify this situation promptly. Failure to address these violations in a timely manner may result in adverse consequences for all parties involved and undermine public trust in regulatory institutions.\r\n\r\nThank you for your attention to this urgent matter. I trust that the Real Estate Regulatory Authority will take appropriate action to uphold the integrity of the regulatory framework and protect the interests of consumers and stakeholders within the real estate sector.\r\n \r\nI am also attaching the approved map but the construction is altered as per this map\r\n\r\nYours sincerely,\r\n\r\nHimanjit Kaur','approved map','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','480578','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\af0c8b68-0c4d-4399-85cf-12adb9e4f3e7\\','Doc20240425b95914be-f8e6-4c92-bb79-8b2a25300be7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','480578','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\af0c8b68-0c4d-4399-85cf-12adb9e4f3e7\\','Doc202404258207759a-8ead-4a41-ba85-e1592b257f82.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-04-25 14:40:18.000','','','','9',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-04-25 14:40:18.000','MiscComplainant','2024-04-25 14:40:18.000'),(214,1610,2024,'MCNo00102024','FormTypeMISC','AKASHDEEP','akash.gsmp@gmail.com',8847561500,0,'Deep Colony Garhshankar','HK DEVELOPERS','Fun Destino Mall, Adjoining Maruti Showroom, Hoshiarpur Road, Garhshankar. punjab - 144527','GARHSHANKAR','I am writing to bring to your attention a critical issue regarding the non-registration of the project MS HK Developer with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority.\r\n\r\nIt has come to my attention that the project developed by MS HK Developer, owned by Mr. Rajesh Khanna, located in Garhshankar, has not been registered with RERA as required by law. This lack of registration is a serious violation of regulatory norms and raises significant concerns regarding transparency, accountability, and compliance with legal obligations.\r\n\r\nAs a prospective buyer, I am deeply troubled by the non-registration of the project MS HK Developer with RERA. The absence of RERA registration deprives homebuyers and investors of essential protections and safeguards provided under RERA regulations, including access to accurate project information, grievance redressal mechanisms, and timely delivery of the project.\r\n\r\nTherefore, I urge the Real Estate Regulatory Authority to take immediate action to address this issue. Specifically, I request RERA to\r\n\r\n1. Investigate the non registration of the project MS HK Developer by MS HK Developer and Mr. Rajesh Khanna.\r\n2. Impose appropriate penalties and sanctions on MS HK Developer and Mr. Rajesh Khanna for failing to comply with RERA registration requirements.\r\n3. Ensure the immediate registration of the project MS HK Developer with RERA to protect the interests of homebuyers and investors and uphold the integrity of the real estate sector.\r\n\r\nEnclosed with this complaint are copies of relevant documents, including proof of payment, correspondence with the developer, and evidence of non registration, for your reference and investigation.\r\n\r\nI trust that the Real Estate Regulatory Authority will take swift and decisive action to rectify this matter and uphold the principles of transparency and accountability in the real estate industry.\r\n\r\nThank you for your attention to this urgent issue.\r\n\r\nSincerely\r\n\r\nAkashdeep','MAP','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','480578','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\24766381-9923-4522-9986-4db852c43003\\','Doc20240427ba0554d9-0f27-4dce-ba8b-a1e5f24a2d71.pdf',0,0,'REVENUE RECORD','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','810795','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\24766381-9923-4522-9986-4db852c43003\\','Doc202404278b5ee881-089a-486a-bb51-550c2b85a59d.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-04-27 13:41:59.000','','','','10',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-04-27 13:41:59.000','MiscComplainant','2024-04-27 13:41:59.000'),(215,1611,2024,'MCNo00112024','FormTypeMISC','RAVINDER GUPTA','ravinderguptaus@gmail.com',8828334712,0,'HOUSE NO 3551  ECTOR 38D CHANDIGARH 160036','SKYLAR HOMES / M/s Zilver Masions LLP','H.B. No. 290, Village- Nabha, MC Zirakpur , SAS NAGAR\r\nMohali , Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar (Mohali) , Punjab - 140603- PBRERA-SAS79-PR0634','Village- Nabha, MC Zirakpur , SAS NAGAR Mohali , Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar (Mohali) , Punjab - 140603','The project SKYLAR HOMES which is at Village- Nabha, MC Zirakpur , SAS NAGAR\r\nMohali , Sahibzada Ajit Singh Nagar (Mohali) , Punjab - 140603. RERA Regn no is-PBRERA-SAS79-PR0634.This project is approved for S+4 floors. Promoter of this project has given the roof right to the persons who are allotted 4th floor. At the same time the Promoter of this project has given the right to construct the extra floor or accommodation at the roof top floor.My question is whether the promoter can give the right to construct the extra floor which is not as per plan. Few constructions have already completed or are going on.Your office team can depute a person to check the unauthorised construction if any.','11-D','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','86070','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ddc05a74-1f70-4365-a687-e12df963b685\\','Doc2024051783973819-212c-4973-a678-b0375125f60d.pdf',0,0,'20-D','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','89810','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ddc05a74-1f70-4365-a687-e12df963b685\\','Doc20240517fd49c2e2-89e8-4a01-888f-af4c26ed56bb.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-05-17 20:30:29.000','','','','11',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-05-17 20:30:29.000','MiscComplainant','2024-05-17 20:30:29.000'),(216,1612,2024,'MCNo00122024','FormTypeMISC','Sumesh Malhotra','sumesh_malhotra16@msn.com',9718474827,0,'Unit No. 205, EMAAR Palm Square, Golf Course Extn. Road, Sector - 66, Gurugram, Haryana','Prime City','Bathinda-Ganganagar Road, Malout Rural, opposite Sky Mall, Malout, Punjab - 152107','Village Malout Rural, Malout','A residential plotted colony under the name and style of \'Prime City\', over 10 acres is being developed, without any approval, sanction or permission of any nature from any governmental authority and without obtaining RERA registration. The project has been sold to investors/allottees who have invested their hard earned money with the representation that the project has all necessary compliances and will be complete within 9 months as represented in 2021. However the project is far from complete and is now coming to light that the project has been sold to multiple investors/allottees without informing them that the land is mortgaged. The Developers are Mr. Babru Vahin and Mr. Abhay Bansal (father-son duo).','Photos with geotagging of the project location','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','901996','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f72f8bd1-4be4-413e-b62e-e90ab91f7d4e\\','Doc202405268ea6b033-aee4-4d32-98a9-d62016ed9be5.pdf',0,0,'Details of Promoters','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','32536','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\f72f8bd1-4be4-413e-b62e-e90ab91f7d4e\\','Doc20240526e7ac1221-c274-4f32-ac7d-b9f01f02cc6b.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-05-26 05:55:05.000','','','','12',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-05-26 05:55:05.000','MiscComplainant','2024-05-26 05:55:05.000'),(217,1613,2024,'MCNo00132024','FormTypeMISC','Sumesh Malhotra','sumesh_malhotra16@msn.com',9718474827,0,'Unit 205, Emaar Palm Square, Golf Course Extn. Road, Sector - 66, Gurugram (Haryana)','Alpha Residences','Alpha Residences, Old Court Road, Old Court Road (a.k.a. Green Valley Road), Village - Sekhu, Malout, Sri Muktsar Sahib, Punjab','Old Court Road, Old Court Road (a.k.a. Green Valley Road), Village - Sekhu, Malout, Sri Muktsar Sahib, Punjab','A residential plotted colony under the name and style of Alpha Residences, over 9 acres is being developed, without any approval, sanction or permission of any nature from any governmental authority and without obtaining RERA registration. The project has been sold to investors/allottees who have invested their hard-earned money with the representation that the project has all necessary compliances and will be complete within 1 year as represented in 2018. However the project is far from complete and is now coming to light that the project has been sold to multiple investors/allottees without informing them that the land is mortgaged and the project is not authorised. It is also reported that huge cash dealings/unauthorised dealings have been made in this project, causing loss to the state exchequer.','Photos with geotagging of the project location','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','881630','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b70ab6f2-a8d8-450f-8786-32e7a343e904\\','Doc2024052684377cde-f734-4621-b4d2-76fa36b63357.pdf',0,0,'Details of Promoters','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','32199','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\b70ab6f2-a8d8-450f-8786-32e7a343e904\\','Doc20240526a9eb6b47-054f-4f96-98ca-f8aab5e6f14a.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2024-05-26 06:25:24.000','','','','13',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2024-05-26 06:25:24.000','MiscComplainant','2024-05-26 06:25:24.000'),(218,1614,2024,'MCNo00142024','FormTypeMISC','Motiaz Royal Estate Private Limited','vashishtha.manoj@gmail.com',9876399913,0,'674 First Floor Kesho Ram Complex Sector 45 Chandigarh','Omaxe New Chandigarh Developers Pvt Ltd','Village Sainimajra Mohali','Sainimajra','The Promoter has, while alluring the complainant, entered into a Land Pooling Agreement by representing that it will allot residential and commercial plotted area after getting the approvals from the competent authority including RERA, but the promoter allotted provisionally some commercial plots without getting the approvals/RERA registration.  When notice issued t