Sale Deed No. 4702, dated 9.3.2023 in which show the allotment date 19.8.2017,  Plot No. 10 Area 377.33 Squre yards  vide Sale Deed No. 2468, dated 14.9.2023,  Polt No. 207 Area 300 Sq Yard Vide Sale deed No. 4702 Dated 9.3.2023, Plot No. 201 Area 300 Sq Yard vide Sale deed No. 1080 Dated 2.6.2023,SCO no. 3 aea 53.33 Sq Yards vide Sale deed No. 2623 Dated 6.10.2022, Plot No.208 Area 300 Sq Yards  vide Sale deed No.203 Dated 16.4.2021 has been sold. But the above said Promoter not Registered Project from RERA Punjab, Kindly penalized on the basis of Sale Deed.','Notification ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','177603','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e77d00d3-746c-4db0-8cb6-612c3b81b796\\','Doc2025032532868693-8ffe-4dd3-8898-7e59e74ffbe2.pdf',0,0,'Sale deed','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','675776','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e77d00d3-746c-4db0-8cb6-612c3b81b796\\','Doc20250325c19b13b2-d9e3-402e-958d-7a05307f85d7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2025-03-25 09:09:38.000','','','','4',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2025-03-25 09:09:38.000','MiscComplainant','2025-03-25 09:09:38.000'),(233,1629,2025,'MCNo00052025','FormTypeMISC','Davinder Singh','advnavdeepdhillon@gmail.com',9620300000,0,'VPO Mehna , Tehsil , Malout , District Sri Muktsar Sahib , Punjab Pin 152113','Suraya Enclave Extension  ','Surya Enclave Extention ,\r\nJalandhar Improvement Trust , \r\nGT road, MBD Market, Jalandhar\r\nPIN 144001','Jalandhar','The complainant had purchased the plot no. 239-D measuring 200 sq. yards in the Surya Enclave Extension project located at Jalandhar. The project is being developed by Jalandhar Improvement Trust Jalandhar. The allotment letter was issued to the complainant on 26.12.2011 via letter no. 2827. The project was never completed by the promoter. \r\nThe project detailed above is still an ongoing project as defined under rule 2(h) of the Punjab State Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Rules, 2017 and also Section 2(s) and Section 2(t) of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016. There is no Completion Certificate or Partial Completion certificate issued to this  project. \r\nHence as per the mandate of Section 3(1) of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016, the RERA registration of this project is mandatory. \r\nBy not registering, the Surya Enclave Extension project located at Jalandhar, the promoters have contravened the provisions of section 3 the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 and are liable to be punished under section 59 of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016.\r\nSo by filing this complaint the complainant prays that the necessary actions may kindly be taken against the promoters to ensure that the provisions of the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 are not violated and the interests of the complainant and other alloties are protected. \r\n','Aootment Letter','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','447102','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\25156809-b530-482d-bdb2-449921fd2d00\\','Doc202504129a3020bb-c1e1-40f1-9d70-a403bfc86816.pdf',0,0,'Project Status Report  ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','585947','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\25156809-b530-482d-bdb2-449921fd2d00\\','Doc202504122d2d3555-5405-49b1-8847-f0503e39a6a6.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2025-04-12 08:53:48.000','','','','5',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2025-04-12 08:53:48.000','MiscComplainant','2025-04-12 08:53:48.000'),(234,1630,2025,'MCNo00062025','FormTypeMISC','Hira','hirasingh0716@gmail.com',9815100716,0,'Opp. DAC Gate No.2 Handiaya Road Barnala','Dhaliwal Enclave Khudi Road Barnala','Dhaliwal Enclave Khudi Road Barnala situated with in the Revenue estate Handiya C Khewat No.1351 and 1359','Khudi Road Barnala Revenue state Handiaya C','Project voilate the Rera Letter No.Rera/PB/EG(R)/2023/12524 Dated 21.9.2023','Copy of Jamabandi','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','173664','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\7c589651-6ce9-4b8d-9a95-f3be452c95a7\\','Doc202