d32ff49.pdf',0,0,'Property docs 2','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','122611','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e891fb86-727c-45ad-b92e-b2c63f41aa11\\','Doc20251216fe22c66b-3538-4e0c-ab36-114f2c795a92.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2025-12-16 10:19:49.000','','','','20',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2025-12-16 10:19:49.000','MiscComplainant','2025-12-16 10:19:49.000'),(249,1645,2025,'MCNo00212025','FormTypeMISC','amanpreet singh','amanpreet13120@gmail.com',9041213120,0,'khamano, ward no.2, House no.146, tehsil khamano, fatehgarh sahib','Khamano City','ward no.1, tehsil khamano, near bus stand , fatehgarh sahib','tehsil khamano, fatehgarh sahib','The accused persons  Harpreet Singh, sharanjeet singh, Bikramjeet singh, Amarjit Kaur formed a colony named Khamanno City having total commercial area of 18008 approx sq yds commercial plot area 8847 approx sq yds road and parking area 8909 approx sq yds S.T.P. area 151 sq yds tubewell area 100 sq yds commercial sold area 5433 sq yds built-up area 1922 sq yds. The colony was formed in the year 2019. The complainant, along with his brothers Ardeep Singh, Amanpreet Singh, Sukhdeep Singh, Pawandeep Singh, purchased a shop measuring 0 kanal 2 marla 3 sarsahian on 21/06/2021 by registered sale deed. The mutation was sanctioned in favour of the complainant and his brothers. At the time of sale the accused persons advertised that they were registered under the RERA Act and held a licence from the Authority to develop and sell plots, shops in the colony, and further assured that they had obtained the completion certificate and complied with all rules and regulations of the RERA Act. \r\nViolation of law, Lack of licence registration. Under Section 3 of the Real Estate Regulation and Development Act, 2016, No promoter shall advertise, offer for sale, book, sell or invite persons to purchase, in any manner, any plot, apartment or building, in any real estate project or part thereof, without registering the real-estate project with the Real Estate Regulatory Authority. Under Section 4 of the Act, a promoter must apply for registration before undertaking a project. Under Section 9 of the Act, no real estate agent can facilitate a sale purchase in a real estate project without registration as an agent. Under Section 59 of the Act, contravention of the provisions attracts penal consequences. In the present case the accused persons neither had any valid registration licence under the RERA Act nor have they provided/documented it. They nevertheless sold shops plots, held out to purchasers that they possessed a licence, and thereby induced the complainant to purchase. Such conduct is in clear contravention of Sections 3 and 4 of the RERA Act. In view of the above, the complainant respectfully prays that the Authority may take appropriate action against the accused persons for violation of Sections 3 and 4 of the RERA Act and other relevant provisions, including Section 59 and any rule regulation made thereunder and compensation be given to the complainant.\r\n','khamanno city map Lay Out Plan','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','951278','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9fcc9f69-5183-4da2-9bc1-323d020becd9\\','Doc20251216dcf91b5a-9955-461f-9ed8-407fb5ccb506.pdf',0,0,'Lay out Plan','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','951278','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\9fcc9f69-5183-4da2-9bc1-323d020becd9\\','Doc20251216446cd1ec-a1d4-4a29-bcda-5cdfd2bb4803.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2025-12-16 13:06:05.000','','','','21',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2025-12-16 13:06:05.000','MiscComplainant','2025-12-16 13:06:05.000'),(250,1646,2025,'MCNo00222025','FormTypeMISC','Bhim Singh','rishabhror49@gmail.com',9417187290,0,'#85 Maheshpur sector 21 panchkula , PIN- 134112.','Om sai homes','Village Kishanpura, Zirakpur, SAS Nagar (Mohali) Punjab-140603 , Infront of Radha Enclave','Village Kishanpura, Zirakpur, SAS Nagar (Mohali) Punjab-140603 , Infront of Radha Enclave','The project in issue is a housing society named Om sai homes it has about 18 flats, I am the owner of one of these flats. The whole project is built with very poor infrastructure, not even basic amenities like drinking water and electricity are accessible and all are suffering due to this illegal act. I recently discovered that the project is not registered with RERA and therefore as a responsible citizen making an effort to complain about the said irregularity to the RERA. Kindly take action.','Project image in 2023','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','162379','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c7780fa1-061f-41cb-ba8c-d336b1eb366c\\','Doc202512218853c93a-d8eb-4307-b3e3-9b7f1c5d335e.pdf',0,0,'Project Image now','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','862457','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\c7780fa1-061f-41cb-ba8c-d336b1eb366c\\','Doc20251221eec4df1a-2891-48cb-8646-7164f849bfa7.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2025-12-21 17:52:26.000','','','','22',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2025-12-21 17:52:26.000','MiscComplainant','2025-12-21 17:52:26.000'),(251,1647,2026,'MCNo00012026','FormTypeMISC','Kapil Dev - President Council of Engineers','engineerscouncilindia@gmail.com',9872007872,0,'186-E, BRS Nagar, Ludhiana','Defence & Services Personnels Welfare Housing Society','Project Address not mentioned in advertisement published on 29-12-2025 in the Tribune Newspaper','As above ','AS PER FILE ATTACHED ','Complete Complaint ','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','415214','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\eef2b40c-81e3-4ea5-a1ba-1a9bdff93d8e\\','Doc2026010550ed4188-ecf9-410d-be63-78becb5aac72.pdf',0,0,'Tribune News 29-11-2025','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','318429','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\eef2b40c-81e3-4ea5-a1ba-1a9bdff93d8e\\','Doc2026010540487540-b6a2-43f5-b0d2-d5bc735e1238.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-01-05 19:16:36.000','','','','1',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-01-05 19:16:36.000','MiscComplainant','2026-01-05 19:16:36.000'),(252,1648,2026,'MCNo00022026','FormTypeMISC'