16:03.000'),(254,1650,2026,'MCNo00042026','FormTypeMISC','Harneet Kaur','gur.leisure@gmail.com',9041415071,0,'1c/45 Namdhari Colony, Kirti Nagar SAS Nagar Punjab 140301','Sushma Pristine','Village Chhar PR 7 Road Zirakpur Near Aerocity Light Point Mohal Punjab 140607','Mohali','That the complainant booked a flat and paid around 36 lakh and the promoter promise to deliver the possession in 2028 as per the agreement but the complainant got to know that there RERA registration has been lapsed in June 2024 and still they are demanding more money for the unregistered project. Because the Respondent has committed a flagrant violation of Section 3 of the RERA Act, 2016, which mandates that no promoter shall advertise, market, book, sell or offer for sale, or invite persons to purchase any plot, apartment or building in any real estate project without registering the project with the Authority.','Agreement to sell','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','1014295','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\319c8283-f070-4247-a4e7-fe29c1c30173\\','Doc202601218d817718-d5d7-4917-999c-3dbc48a0a490.pdf',0,0,'Rera lapsed','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','407183','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\319c8283-f070-4247-a4e7-fe29c1c30173\\','Doc2026012147bc6693-bada-4d2a-a44b-b2499f4fad3b.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-01-21 23:57:58.000','','','','4',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-01-21 23:57:58.000','MiscComplainant','2026-01-21 23:57:58.000'),(255,1651,2026,'MCNo00052026','FormTypeMISC','Gurpreet Singh','gur.leisure@gmail.com',9041415071,0,'105/3 Acme Heights chajju majra Kharar Mohali 140301','Sushma Pristine','Village Chhar PR 7 Road Zirakpur Near Aerocity Light Point Mohal Punjab 140607','Mohali','That the complainant booked a flat and paid around 24 lakh and the promoter promise to deliver the possession in 2028 as per the agreement but the complainant got to know that there RERA registration has been lapsed in June 2024 and still they are demanding more money for the unregistered project. Because the Respondent has committed a flagrant violation of Section 3 of the RERA Act, 2016, which mandates that no promoter shall advertise, market, book, sell or offer for sale, or invite persons to purchase any plot, apartment or building in any real estate project without registering the project with the Authority.\r\n','Agreement to sell','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','798730','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a7c477d9-c41b-4aa9-b802-7725c575b34a\\','Doc2026012282f98648-970d-4df9-8428-5f75d9310fb8.pdf',0,0,'Rera lapsed','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','407183','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\a7c477d9-c41b-4aa9-b802-7725c575b34a\\','Doc20260122ea7f99a7-0aa4-457e-a28c-c16a67248677.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-01-22 00:03:03.000','','','','5',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-01-22 00:03:03.000','MiscComplainant','2026-01-22 00:03:03.000'),(256,1652,2026,'MCNo00062026','FormTypeMISC','Naresh Kumar','234nareshkumar@gmail.com',9779049048,0,'Plot no 878, Industrial Area JLPL, Sector 82 Mohali 160055','BLP Group','Bhartmala Road, Banur Landra Highway','Banur','The company launched and advertised an unnamed project and took money from me without even having the registry in their name and cheated me of 14,37,500/- I have also filed a complaint with SSP Mohali and request you to please look into this. The builder has been cheating multiple people with this and issuing fake EOIs which have no legal say of purchaser. Please take a legal action against the BLP group for indulging in such practices.','Unregistered EOI','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','228108','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0c3336a6-fb5d-428c-9c61-a35a6e9c0fce\\','Doc20260130803c73a9-e8a4-4fbd-aaf0-aa3a4ce927e4.pdf',0,0,'Payment taken against it','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','29022','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\0c3336a6-fb5d-428c-9c61-a35a6e9c0fce\\','Doc2026013085919965-a0b1-4112-bd6f-57425f5128cb.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-01-30 17:23:37.000',