b and haryana highcourt chandigarh ','SHIVJOT RESIDENT ENCLAVE KHARAR ','TEHSIL KHARAR ','KHARAR DIST MOHALI','This housing project has started long back but was not completed by the builder and have looted the resident who purchased the houses as neither their is sewerage treatment plant nor sewerage facility nor Rain water nor lights nor roads and due to this Resident filed case in Rera court where builder was directed to file completion certificate so it is clear that this project is unregistered and therefore penalty may be imposed','ORDER OF RERA COURT','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','25279','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6558e04e-c053-4c28-9cf8-403a4fbc4370\\','Doc202603024cf19f2e-8725-4f36-b25a-1e8b789fc099.pdf',0,0,'ADHAR CARD','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','679680','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\6558e04e-c053-4c28-9cf8-403a4fbc4370\\','Doc2026030253d75d51-7649-4247-9efa-6ceff7d647c4.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-03-02 12:29:43.000','','','','11',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-03-02 12:29:43.000','MiscComplainant','2026-03-02 12:29:43.000'),(262,1658,2026,'MCNo00122026','FormTypeMISC','RS Realtors','blowerwhistle2684@gmail.com',9592005432,0,'ALC Market District One, Sector 68 Mohali, 160062','The Medallion Republic','IBC, PR9 Airport Road, Bharatmala Road','Mohali','Builder is collecting cash and entries in their escrow accounts as pre launch offers without registering the project with RERA which is clear violation. All transactions happening at their Medallion Aurum office Sector 67 Mohali. Please take action.','Ad','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','173363','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\53c47566-c91d-4517-a73c-441e2fe06f0e\\','Doc20260314d6932025-b863-4a31-8a17-a628669c0f4a.pdf',0,0,'Pre Launch','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','103382','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\53c47566-c91d-4517-a73c-441e2fe06f0e\\','Doc2026031453a554c0-f65f-4a51-8622-cd399b5b62c5.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-03-14 09:17:10.000','','','