This PCC was issued in pursuance of Govt. approval Dated. 04.08.2016. it was only for 487 Flats and for 58 additional flats and shops, it has been stated therein that separate case for Completion Certificate be filed after obtaining EC. Thus incomplete project has not been got registered required to be done.','Partial Completion Certificate MC No 8270 Dated 12.08.2016','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','247199','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\aab5bd3d-3439-4bab-9f55-b0771603120c\\','Doc202603205e2b694b-2de1-4343-989b-b478a2f839a1.pdf',0,0,'GOVT. LETTER DATED. 04.08.2016','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','253114','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\aab5bd3d-3439-4bab-9f55-b0771603120c\\','Doc2026032039a24102-e85d-4d16-9dd5-a973dfb212db.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-03-20 17:32:25.000','','','','14',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-03-20 17:32:25.000','MiscComplainant','2026-03-20 17:32:25.000'),(265,1661,2026,'MCNo00152026','FormTypeMISC','Vinod Kumar Bansal','svassociates8638@gmail.com',9803154738,0,'Flat No 557, J Block, New Generation Apartments, Dhakoli, Zirakpur ','SBP Southcity, Singla Builders and Promoters Ltd.','VIP Road, Zirakpur','VIP Road, Zirakpur','M/s SBP Ltd. has avoided the mandatory registration of its incomplete residential project named SBP Southcity at VIP Road Zirakpur by constructing a false document against Letter No 8270 Dated 12.8.2016, showing it as Completion Certificate issued by MC Zirakpur. Whereas, the real document of same number and date supplied by the MC authorities under RTI mention it as Partial Completion Certificate and has stated that letter of Builder is not in record. Matter may be got investigated and project be now registered.','PCC No 8270 Dated 12.8.2016 by MC Zirakpur under RTI','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','247191','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\ad5fbca8-1c35-490f-a3ce-72497dc2372b\\','Doc20260405ea6daa11-c083-48bc-a591-e27ec2c0c6c5.pdf',0,0,'alleged CC No 8270 Dated 12.8.2016 submitted by Builder','0001-01