 GROUP','Banur, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali (Punjab)','Banur, S.A.S Nagar, Mohali (Punjab)','The promoter has publicly advertised and marketed the said project through following multiple channels without obtaining mandatory registration from the Authority \r\n1. Launch of the project website namely www.irishtowntrishla.com displaying complete project details, screenshots attached. \r\n2. Wide publicity and promotion of the project through various FM radio channels in Tricity. \r\n3. Circulation and publication of a project brochure copy enclosed which is also hosted on the aforesaid website.\r\nIt is pertinent to mention that the said project is not registered with RERA Punjab as on date, despite being actively marketed to the general public. Such actions are in direct contravention of the provisions of the RERA Act 2016 which strictly prohibit advertisement marketing or sale of any real estate project without prior registration.\r\nThe conduct of the promoter is misleading and has the potential to deceive innocent citizens and prospective investors, thereby causing financial and legal risks.','','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','124248','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e7e72934-cc70-486d-9231-f77a6ea1812a\\','Doc20260408ad1c971d-6ed4-45f6-9217-344ed65712ea.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','124248','.pdf','readwritedataDocMisc\\e7e72934-cc70-486d-9231-f77a6ea1812a\\','Doc202604080debe5fd-d3a9-4522-98c8-8f3e77567892.pdf',0,0,'','0001-01-01 00:00:00.000','','','','',0,0,1,'2026-04-08 22:21:41.000','','','','17',1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'MiscComplainant','2026-04-08 22:21:41.000','MiscComplainant','2026-04-08 22:21:41.000'),(268,1664,2026,'MCNo00182026','FormTypeMISC','Ms Manjit Kaur','Manny_07@sky.com',9619472986,7843443465,'8 Crew Drive, Tipton, West Midlands, DY4 7SS. United Kingdom','Plot Number 173, SHRI GURUNANAK ENCLAVE','Plot 173, Shri Gurunanak ENCLAVE,  Mohali, near Chandigarh','Mohali, CHANDIGARH','Refund dispute. No signed documents, No Agreement, No refund policy stating NOT RE